能","调试UI行为","捕获浏览器截图","查看浏览器日志","使用Playwright进行测试"],"ja":["フロントエンドの機能を検証","UIの動作をデバッグ","ブラウザのスクリーンショットをキャプチャ","ブラウザのログを表示","Playwrightを使用してテスト"],"ko":["프론트엔드 기능을 검증","UI 동작을 디버깅","브라우저 스크린샷을 캡처","브라우저 로그를 확인","Playwright를 사용하여 테스트"],"es":["Verificación de funcionalidad del frontend","Depuración de comportamiento de la UI","Captura de pantallas del navegador","Visualización de registros del navegador"],"fr":["Vérification de la fonctionnalité du frontend","Débogage du comportement de l''UI","Capture d''écran du navigateur","Affichage des journaux du navigateur"],"de":["Überprüfung der Frontend-Funktionalität","Debuggen des UI-Verhaltens","Bildschirmaufnahme des Browsers","Anzeige der Browser-Protokolle"],"pt":["Verificação de funcionalidade frontend","Depuração de comportamento de UI","Captura de screenshots do navegador","Visualização de logs do navegador"],"ru":["Проверка функциональности frontend","Отладка поведения UI","Создание скриншотов браузера","Просмотр логов браузера"],"ar":["التحقق من الوظائف الأمامية","تصحيح أخطاء سلوك الواجهة","التقاط لقطات الشاشة للمتصفح","عرض سجلات المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Playwright","Web应用测试工具","Playwright教程","前端测试框架","Web应用调试","Playwright安装","Playwright设置指南"],"ja":["Playwrightの使い方","Webアプリケーションテストツール","Playwrightチュートリアル","フロントエンドテストフレームワーク","Webアプリケーションをデバッグ","Playwrightのインストール","Playwrightのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["Playwright 사용법","웹애플리케이션 테스트 툴","Playwright 튜토리얼","프론트엔드 테스트 프레임워크","웹애플리케이션 디버깅","Playwright 설치","Playwright 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Playwright","herramientas de pruebas de aplicaciones web","alternativas a Selenium","Playwright vs Cypress","guía de instalación de Playwright","configuración de Playwright"],"fr":["comment utiliser Playwright","outils de test d''applications web","alternatives à Selenium","Playwright vs Cypress","guide d''installation de Playwright","configuration de Playwright"],"de":["wie man Playwright verwendet","Webanwendungstest-Tools","Alternativen zu Selenium","Playwright vs Cypress","Installationsanleitung für Playwright","Einrichtung von Playwright - AI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar Playwright","o que é Playwright","ferramentas de teste de aplicativos web","Playwright vs Selenium","guia de instalação do Playwright","configuração do Playwright"],"ru":["как использовать Playwright","что такое Playwright","инструменты для тестирования веб-приложений","Playwright vs Selenium","руководство по установке Playwright","настройка Playwright"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Playwright","ما هو Playwright","أدوات اختبار التطبيقات الويب","Playwright مقابل Selenium","دليل تثبيت Playwright","إعداد Playwright"]}},"owner":"Galaxy-Dawn","repo":"claude-scholar","repoPath":"Galaxy-Dawn/claude-scholar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Toolkit for interacting with and testing local web applications using Playwright. Supports verifying frontend functionality, debugging UI behavior, capturing browser screenshots, and viewing browser logs.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Web Application Testing\n\nTo test local web applications, write native Python Playwright scripts.\n\n**Helper Scripts Available**:\n- `scripts/with_server.py` - Manages server lifecycle (supports multiple servers)\n\n**Always run scripts with `--help` first** to see usage. DO NOT read the source until you try running the script first and find that a customized solution is abslutely necessary. These scripts can be very large and thus pollute your context window. They exist to be called directly as bl","body":"# Web Application Testing\n\nTo test local web applications, write native Python Playwright scripts.\n\n**Helper Scripts Available**:\n- `scripts/with_server.py` - Manages server lifecycle (supports multiple servers)\n\n**Always run scripts with `--help` first** to see usage. DO NOT read the source until you try running the script first and find that a customized solution is abslutely necessary. These scripts can be very large and thus pollute your context window. They exist to be called directly as black-box scripts rather than ingested into your context window.\n\n## Decision Tree: Choosing Your Approach\n\n```\nUser task → Is it static HTML?\n    ├─ Yes → Read HTML file directly to identify selectors\n    │         ├─ Success → Write Playwright script using selectors\n    │         └─ Fails/Incomplete → Treat as dynamic (below)\n    │\n    └─ No (dynamic webapp) → Is the server already running?\n        ├─ No → Run: python scripts/with_server.py --help\n        │        Then use the helper + write simplified Playwright script\n        │\n        └─ Yes → Reconnaissance-then-action:\n            1. Navigate and wait for networkidle\n            2. Take screenshot or inspect DOM\n            3. Identify selectors from rendered state\n            4. Execute actions with discovered selectors\n```\n\n## Example: Using with_server.py\n\nTo start a server, run `--help` first, then use the helper:\n\n**Single server:**\n```bash\npython scripts/with_server.py --server \"npm run dev\" --port 5173 -- python your_automation.py\n```\n\n**Multiple servers (e.g., backend + frontend):**\n```bash\npython scripts/with_server.py \\\n  --server \"cd backend && python server.py\" --port 3000 \\\n  --server \"cd frontend && npm run dev\" --port 5173 \\\n  -- python your_automation.py\n```\n\nTo create an automation script, include only Playwright logic (servers are managed automatically):\n```python\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=True) # Always launch chromium in headless mode\n    page = browser.new_page()\n    page.goto(''http://localhost:5173'') # Server already running and ready\n    page.wait_for_load_state(''networkidle'') # CRITICAL: Wait for JS to execute\n    # ... your automation logic\n    browser.close()\n```\n\n## Reconnaissance-Then-Action Pattern\n\n1. **Inspect rendered DOM**:\n   ```python\n   page.screenshot(path=''/tmp/inspect.png'', full_page=True)\n   content = page.content()\n   page.locator(''button'').all()\n   ```\n\n2. **Identify selectors** from inspection results\n\n3. **Execute actions** using discovered selectors\n\n## Common Pitfall\n\n❌ **Don''t** inspect the DOM before waiting for `networkidle` on dynamic apps\n✅ **Do** wait for `page.wait_for_load_state(''networkidle'')` before inspection\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Use bundled scripts as black boxes** - To accomplish a task, consider whether one of the scripts available in `scripts/` can help. These scripts handle common, complex workflows reliably without cluttering the context window. Use `--help` to see usage, then invoke directly. \n- Use `sync_playwright()` for synchronous scripts\n- Always close the browser when done\n- Use descriptive selectors: `text=`, `role=`, CSS selectors, or IDs\n- Add appropriate waits: `page.wait_for_selector()` or `page.wait_for_timeout()`\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- **examples/** - Examples showing common patterns:\n  - `element_discovery.py` - Discovering buttons, links, and inputs on a page\n  - `static_html_automation.py` - Using file:// URLs for local HTML\n  - `console_logging.py` - Capturing console logs during automation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:22:12.535Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing native Python web application testing capabilities with Playwright.","zh":"适用于需要使用Playwright进行本机Python Web应用程序测试的自动化代理。","ja":"Playwrightを使用してネイティブPython Webアプリケーションのテスト機能を必要とするAutomation Agentに最適です。","ko":"Playwright를 사용하여 네이티브 Python 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 기능을 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización que necesitan capacidades de prueba de aplicaciones web de Python nativas con Playwright.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation ayant besoin de capacités de test d''applications web Python natives avec Playwright.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die native Python-Webanwendungstestfunktionen mit Playwright benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam de capacidades de teste de aplicativos web Python nativos com Playwright.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, требующих родных возможностей тестирования веб-приложений Python с помощью Playwright.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل التutomatية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات اختبار التطبيقات الوب الخاصة ببيثون الأصلي مع Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to test local web applications using native Python Playwright scripts, managing server lifecycles with helper scripts like `with_server.py`, and supporting multiple servers through protocols like HTTP.","zh":"赋予代理使用本机Python Playwright脚本测试本地Web应用程序的能力，使用帮助脚本（如`with_server.py`）管理服务器生命周期，并通过诸如HTTP的协议支持多个服务器。","ja":"エージェントがネイティブPython Playwrightスクリプトを使用してローカルWebアプリケーションをテストする機能を提供し、ヘルパースクリプト（例： `with_server.py`）を使用してサーバーのライフサイクルを管理し、HTTPなどのプロトコルを介して複数のサーバーをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 네이티브 Python Playwright 스크립트를 사용하여 로컬 웹 애플리케이션을 테스트할 수 있는 기능을 제공하고, 헬퍼 스크립트(예: `with_server.py`)를 사용하여 서버의 수명 주기를 관리하며, HTTP와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 여러 서버를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a probar aplicaciones web locales utilizando scripts de Python Playwright nativos, gestionando los ciclos de vida del servidor con scripts de ayuda como `with_server.py` y admitiendo varios servidores a través de protocolos como HTTP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tester des applications web locales en utilisant des scripts Python Playwright natifs, en gérant les cycles de vie du serveur avec des scripts d''aide tels que `with_server.py` et en prenant en charge plusieurs serveurs via des protocoles tels que HTTP.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, lokale Webanwendungen mithilfe von nativen Python-Playwright-Skripten zu testen, Serverlebenszyklen mit Hilfs-Skripten wie `with_server.py` zu verwalten und mehrere Server über Protokolle wie HTTP zu unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a testar aplicativos web locais usando scripts Python Playwright nativos, gerenciando ciclos de vida do servidor com scripts de ajuda, como `with_server.py`, e suportando vários servidores por meio de protocolos como HTTP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тестировать локальные веб-приложения с помощью родных скриптов Python Playwright, управляя жизненным циклом сервера с помощью вспомогательных скриптов, таких как `with_server.py`, и поддерживая несколько серверов через протоколы, такие как HTTP.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على اختبار التطبيقات الوب المحلية باستخدام نصوص Python الأصلية الخاصة بPlaywright، وإدارة دورة حياة الخادم باستخدام نصوص مساعدة مثل `with_server.py`، ودعم الخواديم المتعددة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web application testing with Playwright","Debugging local web applications using Python scripts","Managing multiple server lifecycles for testing purposes"],"zh":["使用Playwright自动化Web应用程序测试","使用Python脚本调试本地Web应用程序","管理多个服务器生命周期以进行测试"],"ja":["Playwrightを使用したWebアプリケーションの自動テスト","Pythonスクリプトを使用したローカルWebアプリケーションのデバッグ","テスト目的のための複数サーバーライフサイクルの管理"],"ko":["Playwright를 사용한 웹 애플리케이션 자동 테스트","Python 스크립트를 사용한 로컬 웹 애플리케이션 디버깅","테스트 목적을 위한 여러 서버 수명 주기 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la prueba de aplicaciones web con Playwright","Depuración de aplicaciones web locales utilizando scripts de Python","Administración de varios ciclos de vida del servidor para fines de prueba"],"fr":["Automation des tests d''applications web avec Playwright","Débogage d''applications web locales en utilisant des scripts Python","Gestion de plusieurs cycles de vie de serveur pour des fins de test"],"de":["Automatisierung von Webanwendungstests mit Playwright","Fehlerbehebung von lokalen Webanwendungen unter Verwendung von Python-Skripten","Verwaltung mehrerer Serverlebenszyklen für Testzwecke"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de aplicativos web com Playwright","Depurar aplicativos web locais usando scripts Python","Gerenciar vários ciclos de vida do servidor para fins de teste"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования веб-приложений с помощью Playwright","Отладка локальных веб-приложений с помощью скриптов Python","Управление несколькими циклами жизни сервера для целей тестирования"],"ar":["التutomatية لاختبار التطبيقات الوب مع Playwright","تصحيح الأخطاء في التطبيقات الوب المحلية باستخدام نصوص Python","إدارة دورات حياة الخادم المتعددة لأغراض الاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Native Playwright script writing needed","Limited to local web application testing"],"zh":["需要Python环境","需要本机Playwright脚本编写","仅限本地Web应用程序测试"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","ネイティブPlaywrightスクリプトの作成が必要","ローカルWebアプリケーションのテストに限定される"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다.","네이티브 Playwright 스크립트 작성이 필요합니다.","로컬 웹 애플리케이션 테스트에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Se necesita escritura de scripts de Playwright nativos","Limitado a la prueba de aplicaciones web locales"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Écriture de scripts Playwright natifs requise","Limité aux tests d''applications web locales"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Native Playwright-Skript-Schreibung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf lokale Webanwendungstests"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python","Necessário escrever scripts Playwright nativos","Limitado a testes de aplicativos web locais"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Необходимо написание родных скриптов Playwright","Ограничен тестированием локальных веб-приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","يتطلب كتابة نصوص Playwright الأصلية","محدود باختبار التطبيقات الوب المحلية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e01a5c5567dde91929420fd6e973e96c0b9db1181a91526c88f7a0c236223126","qualityScore":50}');
