nConnect وخرائط الفحارس"},"definition":{"en":"request-enhancer is a SaaS platform skill that automatically transforms user requests into detailed prompts for AI assistance, following best practices for vibe coding and SaaS development.","zh":"Request Enhancer Skill v2.0 是一个 AI エージェント 技术，用于增强用户请求","ja":"Request Enhancer Skill v2.0 は、ユーザー要求を強化する AI エージェント 技術です","ko":"Request Enhancer Skill v2.0는 사용자 요청을 강화하는 AI 에이전트 기술입니다","es":"Request Enhancer es una herramienta de AI que mejora la claridad y estructura de solicitudes de usuario para una mejor asistencia.","fr":"Request Enhancer est un outil d''AI qui améliore la clarté et la structure des requêtes des utilisateurs pour une meilleure assistance.","de":"Request Enhancer ist ein AI-Tool, das die Klarheit und Struktur von Benutzersuchen für eine bessere Unterstützung verbessert.","pt":"O Request Enhancer é uma habilidade que melhora a clareza e adiciona contexto às solicitações de usuário.","ru":"Request Enhancer - это навык, который улучшает ясность и добавляет контекст к запросам пользователей.","ar":"Request Enhancer هو مهارة لتحسين وضوح وإضافة السياق لطلبات المستخدمين"},"features":{"en":["Integrated with CleanConnect memory bank system","Enhanced business focus for non-technical founders","Automatic V1 checklist mapping","Risk assessment and mitigation strategy","Structures requests for optimal AI assistance using vibe coding best practices"],"zh":["集成 CleanConnect 内存银行系统","增强业务焦点 для非技术创始人","自动 V1 清单映射","风险评估和缓解策略"],"ja":["CleanConnect メモリーバンクシステムとの統合","非技術的な創業者のためのビジネス焦点の強化","自動 V1 チェックリスト マッピング","リスク評価と緩和戦略"],"ko":["CleanConnect 메모리 뱅크 시스템과의 통합","비기술 창업자의 비즈니스焦点 강화","자동 V1 체크리스트 매핑","위험 평가 및 완화 전략"],"es":["Integración con CleanConnect","Mejora de la claridad y estructura de solicitudes","Checklist de V1 automático","Evaluación y mitigación de riesgos","Enfoque empresarial para fundadores no técnicos"],"fr":["Intégration avec CleanConnect","Amélioration de la clarté et de la structure des requêtes","Checklist V1 automatique","Évaluation et atténuation des risques","Focus commercial pour les fondateurs non techniques"],"de":["Integration mit CleanConnect","Verbesserung der Klarheit und Struktur von Anfragen","Automatische V1-Checklist","Risikobewertung und -minimierung","Unternehmensfokus für nicht-technische Gründer"],"pt":["Integração com CleanConnect","Mapeamento de checklist automático","Avaliação e mitigação de riscos","Desenvolvimento de SaaS com vibe coding","Melhoria da clareza e adição de contexto às solicitações de usuário"],"ru":["Интеграция с CleanConnect","Автоматическое картографирование чек-листов","Оценка и смягчение рисков","Разработка SaaS с vibe coding","Улучшение ясности и добавление контекста к запросам пользователей"],"ar":["دمج مع CleanConnect","خرائط الفحارس التلقائي","تقييم ومعالجة المخاطر","تنمية SaaS مع vibe coding","تحسين وضوح وإضافة السياق لطلبات المستخدمين"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use request-enhancer","request-enhancer alternative","request-enhancer setup guide","what is request-enhancer","request-enhancer vs competitor","request-enhancer install","request-enhancer for SaaS development","request-enhancer for AI agents","request-enhancer and CleanConnect integration"],"zh":["Request Enhancer Skill v2.0","AI エージェント","SaaS 平台","CleanConnect 内存银行系统","风险评估和缓解","用户请求增强","非技术创始人","V1 清单映射"],"ja":["Request Enhancer Skill v2.0","AI エージェント","SaaS プラットフォーム","CleanConnect メモリーバンクシステム","リスク評価と緩和","ユーザー要求強化","非技術的な創業者","V1 チェックリスト マッピング"],"ko":["Request Enhancer Skill v2.0","AI 에이전트","SaaS 플랫폼","CleanConnect 메모리 뱅크 시스템","위험 평가 및 완화","사용자 요청 강화","비기술 창업자","V1 체크리스트 매핑"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","mejora de solicitudes de AI","CleanConnect","checklist de V1","evaluación de riesgos","fundadores no técnicos","desarrollo de SaaS","vibe coding"],"fr":["outils d''AI pour développeurs","amélioration des requêtes AI","CleanConnect","checklist V1","évaluation des risques","fondateurs non techniques","développement de SaaS","vibe coding"],"de":["AI-Tools für Entwickler","Verbesserung von AI-Anfragen","CleanConnect","V1-Checklist","Risikobewertung","nicht-technische Gründer","SaaS-Entwicklung","vibe coding"],"pt":["Request Enhancer","Desenvolvimento de SaaS","CleanConnect","Mapeamento de checklist","Avaliação de riscos","Vibe coding","Melhoria da clareza","Adição de contexto","Solicitações de usuário"],"ru":["Request Enhancer","Разработка SaaS","CleanConnect","Картографирование чек-листов","Оценка рисков","Vibe coding","Улучшение ясности","Добавление контекста","Запросы пользователей","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Request Enhancer","تنمية SaaS","CleanConnect","خرائط الفحارس","تقييم المخاطر","Vibe coding","تحسين وضوح","إضافة السياق","طلبات المستخدمين","الأدوات الذكية"]}},"owner":"SlySlayer32","repo":"dashboard-link-saas","repoPath":"SlySlayer32/dashboard-link-saas","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.642Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"request-enhancer","description":"Automatically rewrites, expands, and enhances user requests using proper linguistics and structured input for optimal vibe coding and SaaS development results","version":"2.0","bodyPreview":"# Request Enhancer Skill v2.0\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\n\r\nThis skill automatically transforms user requests into well-structured, detailed prompts that follow best practices for vibe coding and SaaS development. It enhances clarity, adds context, and structures requests for optimal AI assistance.\r\n\r\n**Key Improvements in v2.0:**\r\n- Integrated with CleanConnect memory bank system\r\n- Enhanced business focus for non-technical founder\r\n- Automatic V1 checklist mapping\r\n- Risk assessment and mitigation strategi","body":"# Request Enhancer Skill v2.0\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\n\r\nThis skill automatically transforms user requests into well-structured, detailed prompts that follow best practices for vibe coding and SaaS development. It enhances clarity, adds context, and structures requests for optimal AI assistance.\r\n\r\n**Key Improvements in v2.0:**\r\n- Integrated with CleanConnect memory bank system\r\n- Enhanced business focus for non-technical founder\r\n- Automatic V1 checklist mapping\r\n- Risk assessment and mitigation strategies\r\n- Progress tracking integration\r\n\r\n## Enhancement Process\r\n\r\n### 1. Request Analysis\r\n- Identify the core intent and objectives\r\n- Detect implicit requirements and assumptions\r\n- Assess technical complexity and domain\r\n- Identify missing context that would be helpful\r\n\r\n### 2. Linguistic Enhancement\r\n- Improve clarity and specificity\r\n- Add proper technical terminology where appropriate\r\n- Structure sentences for unambiguous interpretation\r\n- Ensure professional yet approachable tone\r\n\r\n### 3. Structural Improvements\r\n- Add clear objectives and success criteria\r\n- Include relevant context about the project/environment\r\n- Specify constraints and preferences\r\n- Organize into logical sections with clear headings\r\n\r\n### 4. Best Practices Integration\r\n- Include relevant architectural considerations\r\n- Add security and performance implications\r\n- Suggest testing strategies\r\n- Reference project-specific standards and patterns\r\n\r\n## Enhanced Request Template v2.0\r\n\r\n```markdown\r\n## Objective\r\n[Clear, specific statement of what needs to be accomplished]\r\n\r\n## Business Context\r\n- **User**: Non-technical founder building CleanConnect SaaS\r\n- **Goal**: [Business outcome this enables]\r\n- **Impact**: [Why this matters for the business]\r\n- **Timeline**: [Urgency level: Immediate/This week/Soon]\r\n\r\n## Project Context\r\n- **Project**: CleanConnect - Multi-tenant SaaS for workforce management\r\n- **Tech Stack**: Hono + Supabase + React + TypeScript + pnpm\r\n- **Current Phase**: [Foundation/V1 Build/V2]\r\n- **Recent Progress**: [What was just completed]\r\n\r\n## V1 Checklist Mapping\r\n- **Checklist Item**: [Exact item from plan/]\r\n- **Phase Number**: [Current phase from plan/PLAN_INDEX.md]\r\n- **Complexity**: [Simple/Medium/Complex]\r\n- **Estimated Time**: [Time estimate in hours]\r\n- **Dependencies**: [What needs to be done first]\r\n\r\n## Requirements\r\n### Must-Haves (Non-negotiable)\r\n- [Critical requirements that must be met]\r\n\r\n### Should-Haves (Important)\r\n- [Important features that should be included]\r\n\r\n### Could-Haves (Nice to have)\r\n- [Optional features if time permits]\r\n\r\n## Technical Constraints\r\n- Must follow Zapier-style layering\r\n- All database queries scoped by organizationId\r\n- No vendor SDK calls outside adapters/\r\n- Use fixed tech stack only\r\n- Validate inputs with Zod\r\n\r\n## Risk Assessment\r\n- **Risk Level**: [Low/Medium/High]\r\n- **Potential Issues**: [What could go wrong]\r\n- **Mitigation**: [How we''ll prevent problems]\r\n- **Confidence**: [1-10 confidence level]\r\n\r\n## Success Criteria\r\n- [Measurable outcomes that indicate success]\r\n- [How to verify the implementation works]\r\n- [What the user should be able to do]\r\n\r\n## Testing Strategy\r\n- **Unit Tests**: [What needs unit testing]\r\n- **Integration Tests**: [What needs integration testing]\r\n- **Manual Testing**: [How to manually verify]\r\n\r\n## Next Steps\r\n1. [Immediate first action]\r\n2. [What needs to be decided]\r\n3. [What I need from you]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Implementation Guidelines v2.0\r\n\r\nWhen enhancing requests:\r\n\r\n1. **Founder-First Communication**: \r\n   - Use simple, non-technical language\r\n   - Focus on business outcomes\r\n   - Provide confidence levels\r\n   - Celebrate small wins\r\n\r\n2. **Memory Integration**: \r\n   - Check activeContext.md for current work\r\n   - Reference previous decisions\r\n   - Maintain continuity\r\n   - Update memory after completion\r\n\r\n3. **Risk-Aware Planning**: \r\n   - Always assess risk level\r\n   - Provide mitigation strategies\r\n   - Flag potential blockers early\r\n   - Offer backup options\r\n\r\n4. **Architecture Compliance**: \r\n   - Enforce Zapier-style layering\r\n   - Ensure tenant scoping\r\n   - Use fixed tech stack\r\n   - Follow established patterns\r\n\r\n5. **Progress Tracking**: \r\n   - Map to V1 checklist\r\n   - Estimate complexity realistically\r\n   - Track completion percentage\r\n   - Document lessons learned\r\n\r\n## Example Transformations\r\n\r\n### Before:\r\n\"make a user login thing\"\r\n\r\n### After:\r\n```markdown\r\n## Objective\r\nImplement a secure user authentication system with login and registration functionality for the CleanConnect SaaS platform.\r\n\r\n## Context\r\n- Project: CleanConnect - Multi-tenant SaaS for workforce management\r\n- Tech Stack: Hono (backend) + Supabase (database/auth) + React (frontend) + TypeScript\r\n- Current State: Basic project structure exists, Supabase configured\r\n- Business Impact: Critical for user onboarding and data security\r\n\r\n## Requirements\r\n### Functional Requirements\r\n- User registration with email verification\r\n- Login with email/password\r\n- Password reset functionality\r\n- Session management with JWT tokens\r\n- Multi-tenant isolation by organizationId\r\n\r\n### Technical Requirements\r\n- Use Supabase Auth for authentication\r\n- Implement RLS policies for data isolation\r\n- Secure session handling with httpOnly cookies\r\n- Rate limiting on auth endpoints\r\n- OAuth providers (Google, Microsoft) for enterprise\r\n\r\n### Constraints\r\n- Must follow existing authentication patterns in AGENTS.md\r\n- All database queries must be scoped by organizationId\r\n- No vendor SDK calls outside adapters layer\r\n\r\n## Success Criteria\r\n- Users can register and verify email\r\n- Login works with correct credentials\r\n- Invalid attempts are properly handled\r\n- Sessions persist correctly across refreshes\r\n- Data isolation between organizations is enforced\r\n\r\n## Preferred Approach\r\n- Follow the authentication flow outlined in docs/ARCHITECTURE_BLUEPRINT.md\r\n- Use Zod for input validation\r\n- Implement proper error handling with stable error codes\r\n- Add comprehensive logging for security events\r\n\r\n## Testing Strategy\r\n- Unit tests for auth utilities\r\n- Integration tests for login/registration flows\r\n- Security tests for common vulnerabilities\r\n- Test multi-tenant data isolation\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Automatic Invocation\r\n\r\n**CRITICAL: This skill runs AUTOMATICALLY on EVERY user message before any other processing.**\r\n\r\nThis skill is triggered:\r\n- On ALL user messages (no exceptions)\r\n- Before any other tool or skill runs\r\n- Even for seemingly simple requests\r\n\r\nThe only exceptions are:\r\n- Messages starting with `/no-enhance`\r\n- Messages to other agents/skills that explicitly bypass enhancement\r\n\r\n## Enhancement Rules for CleanConnect v2.0\r\n\r\n### Mandatory Fields to Add:\r\n1. **Business Context**: Why this matters for the founder\r\n2. **Risk Assessment**: Risk level and mitigation strategies\r\n3. **Phase Number**: From plan/PLAN_INDEX.md (not just V1)\r\n4. **Dependencies**: What needs to be done first\r\n5. **Confidence Level**: 1-10 scale for success\r\n\r\n### Auto-Correction Logic:\r\n- If request is vague → Enhance with business context\r\n- If request lacks risk → Add risk assessment\r\n- If request jumps ahead → Realign to current phase\r\n- If request is too broad → Break into smaller tasks\r\n- If request lacks testing → Add comprehensive testing strategy\r\n- If request ignores constraints → Add technical constraints section\r\n\r\n### Memory Integration:\r\n- Check `.windsurf/active/activeContext.md` for current work\r\n- Reference previous decisions from memory bank\r\n- Maintain continuity across sessions\r\n- Update memory after task completion\r\n\r\n### Founder-Friendly Output:\r\n- Use analogies instead of technical terms\r\n- Focus on outcomes and business value\r\n- Provide clear next steps\r\n- Include celebration points for progress\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\n- This skill runs before any other processing\r\n- The enhanced request becomes the new prompt for Cascade\r\n- Users can still manually invoke with @request-enhancer\r\n- Enhancements are conservative - when in doubt, keep it simple\r\n- v2.0 includes improved business focus and risk management\r\n- Integrated with memory bank for context continuity\r\n- Designed specifically for non-technical founder workflow\r\n\r\n## Version History\r\n\r\n- v1.0: Initial implementation with basic enhancement\r\n- v2.0: Added business focus, risk assessment, memory integration, and founder-friendly communication\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T02:14:58.366Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced prompt engineering for optimal assistance.","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI Agents，需要高级的prompt engineering以实现最佳辅助。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeなどのAIエージェントに最適で、高度なプロンプトエンジニアリングを使用して最適な支援を実現します。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 최적의 지원을 위해 고급 프롬프트 엔지니어링이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan ingeniería de prompts avanzada para asistencia óptima.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''une ingénierie de prompts avancée pour une assistance optimale.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine fortschrittliche Prompt-Engineering für eine optimale Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que precisam de engenharia de prompt avançada para assistência ótima.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуется продвинутая инженерия запросов для оптимальной помощи.","ar":"مثالي لعميلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى هندسة تعليمات متقدمة لتحقيق المساعدة المثلى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform user requests into well-structured prompts using best practices for vibe coding and SaaS development, integrating with systems like CleanConnect and incorporating risk assessment and mitigation strategies.","zh":"赋予代理将用户请求转换为结构良好的提示的能力，使用vibe coding和SaaS开发的最佳实践，并与CleanConnect等系统集成，纳入风险评估和缓解策略。","ja":"エージェントは、ユーザーのリクエストを结构化されたプロンプトに変換する機能を持ち、vibeコーディングとSaaS開発のベストプラクティスを使用し、CleanConnectなどのシステムと統合し、リスク評価と緩和戦略を含めます。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 요청을 구조화된 프롬프트로 변환 할 수있는 기능을 제공하며, 바이브 코딩 및 SaaS 개발의最佳实践을 사용하고 CleanConnect와 같은 시스템과 통합하며, 위험 평가 및 완화 전략을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar las solicitudes de los usuarios en prompts bien estructurados utilizando las mejores prácticas para la codificación de vibraciones y el desarrollo de SaaS, integrándose con sistemas como CleanConnect e incorporando estrategias de evaluación y mitigación de riesgos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les demandes des utilisateurs en prompts bien structurés en utilisant les meilleures pratiques pour la codification de vibrations et le développement de SaaS, en s''intégrant avec des systèmes comme CleanConnect et en incorporant des stratégies d''évaluation et d''atténuation des risques.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Benutzeranfragen in gut strukturierte Prompts umzuwandeln, indem sie die besten Praktiken für Vibe-Coding und SaaS-Entwicklung verwenden, sich in Systeme wie CleanConnect integrieren und Risikobewertungs- und Minderungsstrategien einbeziehen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar solicitações de usuário em prompts bem estruturados usando as melhores práticas para codificação de vibe e desenvolvimento de SaaS, integrando com sistemas como CleanConnect e incorporando estratégias de avaliação e mitigação de riscos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать запросы пользователей в хорошо структурированные запросы, используя лучшие практики для кодирования вибрации и разработки SaaS, интегрируя с системами, такими как CleanConnect, и включающими стратегии оценки и смягчения рисков.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحويل طلبات المستخدم إلى تعليمات منظمة جيدًا باستخدام أفضل الممارسات لترميز التوجيه وتطوير برنامج ما بعد البيع، متكامل مع نظم مثل CleanConnect ومتضمن استراتيجيات لتقييم المخاطر وتخفيفها."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating the transformation of user requests into detailed prompts","Enhancing clarity and adding context to user requests for AI assistance","Generating V1 checklist mappings for non-technical founders and SaaS developers"],"zh":["自动将用户请求转换为详细的提示","增强清晰度并为AI辅助添加上下文","为非技术创始人和SaaS开发人员生成V1检查清单映射"],"ja":["ユーザーのリクエストを詳細なプロンプトに自動変換する","AI支援のために明確性を高め、コンテキストを追加する","非技術的な創設者とSaaS開発者向けのV1チェックリストマッピングを生成する"],"ko":["사용자 요청을 상세한 프롬프트로 자동 변환","AI 지원을 위해 명확성을 높이고 컨텍스트를 추가","비 기술 창업자 및 SaaS 개발자를 위한 V1 체크리스트 매핑 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la transformación de solicitudes de usuarios en prompts detallados","Mejorar la claridad y agregar contexto a las solicitudes de usuarios para asistencia de IA","Generar asignaciones de lista de verificación V1 para fundadores y desarrolladores de SaaS no técnicos"],"fr":["Automatiser la transformation des demandes des utilisateurs en prompts détaillés","Améliorer la clarté et ajouter du contexte aux demandes des utilisateurs pour une assistance d''IA","Générer des mappages de liste de vérification V1 pour les fondateurs et les développeurs de SaaS non techniques"],"de":["Die Umwandlung von Benutzeranfragen in detaillierte Prompts automatisieren","Die Klarheit verbessern und Kontext zu den Benutzeranfragen für KI-Unterstützung hinzufügen","V1-Checklisten-Zuordnungen für nicht-technische Gründer und SaaS-Entwickler generieren"],"pt":["Automatizar a transformação de solicitações de usuário em prompts detalhados","Melhorar a clareza e adicionar contexto às solicitações de usuário para assistência de IA","Gerar mapeamentos de lista de verificação V1 para fundadores e desenvolvedores de SaaS não técnicos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать преобразование запросов пользователей в подробные запросы","Улучшить ясность и добавить контекст к запросам пользователей для помощи ИИ","Генерировать сопоставления контрольных списков V1 для не технических основателей и разработчиков SaaS"],"ar":["أتمتة تحويل طلبات المستخدم إلى تعليمات مفصلة","تحسين الوضوح وإضافة السياق لطلبات المستخدم لتحقيق مساعدة الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنتاج خرائط قوائم التحقق الإصدار 1 لأصحاب المشاريع ومتطوّري برنامج ما بعد البيع غير التقنيين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with CleanConnect memory bank system","Optimized for non-technical founders and SaaS developers","Dependent on risk assessment and mitigation strategies for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要集成CleanConnect内存银行系统","针对非技术创始人和SaaS开发人员进行优化","依赖于风险评估和缓解策略以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["CleanConnectメモリバンクシステムとの統合が必要","非技術的な創設者とSaaS開発者向けに最適化","リスク評価と緩和戦略に依存して最高の性能を実現"],"ko":["CleanConnect 메모리 뱅크 시스템과 통합이 필요","비 기술 창업자 및 SaaS 개발자를 위해 최적화","위험 평가 및 완화 전략에 의존하여 최상의 성능을 달성"],"es":["Requiere integración con el sistema de memoria CleanConnect","Optimizado para fundadores y desarrolladores de SaaS no técnicos","Dependiente de estrategias de evaluación y mitigación de riesgos para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le système de mémoire CleanConnect","Optimisé pour les fondateurs et les développeurs de SaaS non techniques","Dépendant des stratégies d''évaluation et d''atténuation des risques pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit dem CleanConnect-Speichersystem","Optimiert für nicht-technische Gründer und SaaS-Entwickler","Abhängig von Risikobewertungs- und Minderungsstrategien für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Requer integração com o sistema de banco de memória CleanConnect","Otimizado para fundadores e desenvolvedores de SaaS não técnicos","Dependente de estratégias de avaliação e mitigação de riscos para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с системой банка памяти CleanConnect","Оптимизирован для не технических основателей и разработчиков SaaS","Зависит от стратегий оценки и смягчения рисков для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل م