INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('SlySlayer32/dashboard-link-saas/request-enhancer', 'request-enhancer', 'SlySlayer32', 'dashboard-link-saas', 'community', 'request-enhancer SlySlayer32 dashboard-link-saas community The request-enhancer skill automates the transformation of user requests into well-structured prompts for optimal AI assistance, benefiting non-technical founders and SaaS developers. Request Enhancer Skill v2.0 是一个 SaaS 平台，通过集成 CleanConnect 内存银行系统和风险评估策略来增强用户请求 Request Enhancer Skill v2.0 は、CleanConnect メモリーバンクシステムとリスク評価戦略を活用して、ユーザー要求を強化する SaaS プラットフォームです Request Enhancer Skill v2.0는 CleanConnect 메모리 뱅크 시스템과 위험 평가 전략을 활용하여 사용자 요청을 강화하는 SaaS 플랫폼입니다 Request Enhancer es una habilidad que transforma solicitudes de usuario en prompts detallados para una mejor asistencia de AI. Mejora la claridad y estructura con CleanConnect y checklist de V1. Request Enhancer est une compétence qui transforme les requêtes des utilisateurs en invites détaillées pour une meilleure assistance AI. Améliore la clarté et la structure avec CleanConnect et checklist V1. Request Enhancer ist eine Fähigkeit, die Benutzersuchen in detaillierte Prompts für eine bessere AI-Unterstützung umwandelt. Verbessert die Klarheit und Struktur mit CleanConnect und V1-Checklist. O Request Enhancer é uma habilidade que transforma solicitações de usuário em prompts bem estruturados com CleanConnect e mapeamento de checklist. Request Enhancer - это навык, который преобразует запросы пользователей в хорошо структурированные подсказки с CleanConnect и картографированием чек-листов. Request Enhancer هو مهارة لتحويل طلبات المستخدمين إلى مساعدات بنية مع CleanConnect وخرائط الفحارس how to use request-enhancer request-enhancer alternative request-enhancer setup guide what is request-enhancer request-enhancer vs competitor request-enhancer install request-enhancer for SaaS development request-enhancer for AI agents request-enhancer and CleanConnect integration Request Enhancer Skill v2.0 AI エージェント SaaS 平台 CleanConnect 内存银行系统 风险评估和缓解 用户请求增强 非技术创始人 V1 清单映射 Integrated with CleanConnect memory bank system Enhanced business focus for non-technical founders Automatic V1 checklist mapping Risk assessment and mitigation strategy Structures requests for optimal AI assistance using vibe coding best practices request-enhancer is a SaaS platform skill that automatically transforms user requests into detailed prompts for AI assistance, following best practices for vibe coding and SaaS development.');
