Optimisation de React Native de Callstack"],"de":["Optimierung von JavaScript und React","Optimierung von iOS und Android","Optimierung von Bundles","Code-Muster für eine bessere Optimierung","Shell-Befehle zur Messung und Optimierung des Prozesses","Leitfaden basierend auf dem Ultimativen Leitfaden zur Optimierung von React Native von Callstack"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para JavaScript/React","Otimização de desempenho para Nativo (iOS/Android)","Otimização de bundling para melhorar a eficiência","Padrões rápidos para correção de código","Comandos rápidos para medição e processo","Guia baseado no ''Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization'' da Callstack"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для JavaScript/React","Оптимизация производительности для Native (iOS/Android)","Оптимизация пакетов для улучшения эффективности","Быстрые шаблоны для исправления кода","Быстрые команды для измерения и процесса","Руководство, основанное на ''Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization'' от Callstack"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لجافاسكريبت/ري액ت","تحسين الأداء للنativos (iOS/Android)","تحسين حزم لتحسين الكفاءة","نماذج سريعة لتصحيح الشفرة","أوامر سريعة لقياس وعمليات","دليل يعتمد على ''دليل نهائي لتحسين ري액ت نيتيف'' من Callstack"]},"keywords":{"en":["react-native-best-practices setup guide","how to use react-native-best-practices","react-native-best-practices vs react native optimization","what is react-native-best-practices","react-native-best-practices install","react native performance optimization techniques","react-native-best-practices alternative","react native bundling optimizations","react-native-best-practices tutorial"],"zh":["React Native 优化","React Native 最佳实践","JavaScript 优化","Native 优化","Bundling 优化","React Native 性能优化"],"ja":["React Native 最適化","React Native ベストプラクティス","JavaScript 最適化","ネイティブ最適化","バンドリング最適化","React Native パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["React Native 최적화","React Native 베스트 프랙티스","JavaScript 최적화","네이티브 최적화","번들링 최적화","React Native 성능 최적화"],"es":["react native optimización","mejores prácticas react native","guias de react native","optimización de bundles react native","optimización de ios y android","react native performance optimization","herramientas de react native","agentes de IA para react native","herramientas de desarrollo de react native"],"fr":["optimisation react native","meilleures pratiques react native","guides react native","optimisation des bundles react native","optimisation d''iOS et Android","react native performance optimization","outils react native","agents d''IA pour react native","outils de développement react native"],"de":["react native optimierung","beste praktiken react native","leitfäden react native","optimierung von bundles react native","optimierung von ios und android","react native leistungsoptimierung","tools react native","kI-agenten für react native","entwicklungstools react native"],"pt":["react native otimização","melhores práticas react native","otimização de desempenho react native","bundling react native","javascript react native","nativo ios android","guias de configuração react native"],"ru":["react native оптимизация","лучшие практики react native","оптимизация производительности react native","пакеты react native","javascript react native","native ios android","руководства по настройке react native","ИИ Агенты для react native"],"ar":["ري액ت نيتيف تحسين","أفضل الممارسات ري액ت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء ري액ت نيتيف","حزم ري액ت نيتيف","جافاسكريبت ري액ت نيتيف","نativos ios android","دلائل إعداد ري액ت نيتيف","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لري액ت نيتيف"]}},"owner":"KorSoftwareSolutions","repo":"ui","repoPath":"KorSoftwareSolutions/ui","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.515Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Defer non-critical work with `InteractionManager`\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in `references/`:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| `js-profile-react.md` | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| `js-measure-fps.md` | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| `js-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| `js-atomic-state.md` | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| `js-concurrent-react.md` | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| `js-react-compiler.md` | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| `js-animations-reanimated.md` | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| `js-uncontrolled-components.md` | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `native-turbo-modules.md` | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| `native-sdks-over-polyfills.md` | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| `native-measure-tti.md` | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| `native-threading-model.md` | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| `native-profiling.md` | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| `native-platform-setup.md` | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| `native-view-flattening.md` | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| `native-memory-patterns.md` | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| `native-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `bundle-barrel-exports.md` | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| `bundle-analyze-js.md` | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| `bundle-tree-shaking.md` | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| `bundle-analyze-app.md` | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| `bundle-r8-android.md` | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| `bundle-hermes-mmap.md` | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| `bundle-native-assets.md` | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| `bundle-library-size.md` | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| `bundle-code-splitting.md` | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | `js-measure-fps.md` → `js-profile-react.md` |\n| Too many re-renders | `js-profile-react.md` → `js-react-compiler.md` |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | `native-measure-tti.md` → `bundle-analyze-js.md` |\n| Large app size | `bundle-analyze-app.md` → `bundle-r8-android.md` |\n| Memory growing | `js-memory-leaks.md` or `native-memory-leaks.md` |\n| Animation drops frames | `js-animations-reanimated.md` |\n| List scroll jank | `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` |\n| TextInput lag | `js-uncontrolled-components.md` |\n| Native module slow | `native-turbo-modules.md` → `native-threading-model.md` |\n| Native library alignment issue | `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` |\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:59:21.036Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing React Native performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要React Native性能优化能力的移动应用开发代理。","ja":"React Nativeのパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするモバイルアプリ開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"React Native 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 모바일 앱 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles que necesitan capacidades de optimización de rendimiento de React Native.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''applications mobiles ayant besoin de capacités d''optimisation de performance de React Native.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App Development Agents, die React Native Leistungs-Optimierungs-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de capacidades de otimização de desempenho do React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки мобильных приложений, которым необходимы возможности оптимизации производительности React Native.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تحسين أداء React Native."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications using JavaScript, Native, and bundling optimizations, covering best practices for iOS and Android development, and leveraging Callstack''s ''Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization'' for expert guidance.","zh":"赋予代理优化使用JavaScript、Native和捆绑优化的React Native应用的能力，涵盖iOS和Android开发的最佳实践，并利用Callstack的''React Native优化终极指南''获取专家指导。","ja":"JavaScript、Native、バンドル最適化を使用したReact Nativeアプリの最適化をエージェントに可能にすることで、iOSおよびAndroid開発のベストプラクティスをカバーし、Callstackの「React Native最適化の究極のガイド」を使用して専門家の指導を得ることができます。","ko":"에이전트가 JavaScript, Native 및 번들 최적화를 사용하여 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화할 수 있도록 하여, iOS 및 Android 개발을 위한 모범 사례를 다루고, 전문가 지침을 얻기 위해 Callstack의 ''React Native 최적화의 궁극적인 가이드''를 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones React Native utilizando optimizaciones de JavaScript, Native y empaquetado, cubriendo las mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de iOS y Android, y aprovechando la ''Guía definitiva para la optimización de React Native'' de Callstack para obtener orientación experta.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native en utilisant des optimisations JavaScript, Native et de regroupement, en couvrant les meilleures pratiques pour le développement iOS et Android, et en exploitant le ''Guide ultime pour l''optimisation de React Native'' de Callstack pour obtenir des conseils d''experts.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, React Native-Anwendungen mithilfe von JavaScript-, Native- und Bündel-Optimierungen zu optimieren, die besten Praktiken für die Entwicklung von iOS und Android abdecken und Callstacks ''Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization'' für Expertenrat ausnutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicativos React Native usando otimizações JavaScript, Nativa e de empacotamento, cobrindo as melhores práticas para desenvolvimento iOS e Android, e aproveitando o ''Guia Definitivo para Otimização do React Native'' da Callstack para orientação especializada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React Native с использованием оптимизаций JavaScript, Native и пакетирования, охватывая лучшие практики для разработки iOS и Android, и используя ''Полное руководство по оптимизации React Native'' от Callstack для экспертных рекомендаций.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحسين تطبيقات React Native باستخدام تحسينات JavaScript والنسخة الأصلية وتحسينات التعبئة، وتغطية أفضل الممارسات لتطوير iOS و Android، وتوظيف ''دليل نهائي لتحسين React Native'' من Callstack لتوجيه خبير."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing JavaScript and React optimizations for improved app performance","Debugging and resolving Native module issues for iOS and Android","Optimizing bundling configurations for faster app loading times"],"zh":["为改善应用程序性能实施JavaScript和React优化","调试和解决iOS和Android的Native模块问题","优化捆绑配置以实现更快的应用程序加载时间"],"ja":["アプリのパフォーマンスを向上させるためのJavaScriptとReactの最適化の実装","iOSとAndroidのネイティブモジュールの問題のデバッグと解決","アプリのロード時間を短縮するためのバンドル設定の最適化"],"ko":["애플리케이션 성능 개선을 위한 JavaScript 및 React 최적화 구현","iOS 및 Android의 네이티브 모듈 문제 해결 및 디버깅","애플리케이션 로드 시간을 더 빠르게 하는 번들 구성 최적화"],"es":["Implementar optimizaciones de JavaScript y React para una mejor rendimiento de la aplicación","Depurar y resolver problemas de módulos nativos para iOS y Android","Optimizar configuraciones de empaquetado para tiempos de carga de aplicaciones más rápidos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des optimisations JavaScript et React pour améliorer les performances de l''application","Déboguer et résoudre les problèmes de modules natifs pour iOS et Android","Optimiser les configurations de regroupement pour des temps de chargement d''applications plus rapides"],"de":["Implementierung von JavaScript- und React-Optimierungen für verbesserte App-Leistung","Fehlerbehebung und Lösung von Problemen mit nativen Modulen für iOS und Android","Optimierung von Bündelkonfigurationen für schnellere App-Ladezeiten"],"pt":["Implementação de otimizações JavaScript e React para melhorar o desempenho do aplicativo","Depuração e resolução de problemas de módulos Nativa para iOS e Android","Otimização de configurações de empacotamento para tempos de carregamento de aplicativos mais rápidos"],"ru":["Реализация оптимизаций JavaScript и React для улучшения производительности приложения","Отладка и решение проблем модулей Native для iOS и Android","Оптимизация конфигураций пакетирования для более быстрого времени загрузки приложения"],"ar":["تنفيذ تحسينات JavaScript و React لتحسين أداء التطبيق","تصحيح الأعطال وحل مشاكل الوحدات الأصلية لنظامي التشغيل iOS و Android","تحسين إعدادات التعبئة لتحقيق أوقات تحميل التطبيقات أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React Native and JavaScript","Focused on React Native optimization, not general mobile app development"],"zh":["需要了解React Native和JavaScript","专注于React Native优化，而不是一般的移动应用开发"],"ja":["React NativeとJavaScriptの知識が必要","一般的なモバイルアプリ開発ではなく、React Nativeの最適化に焦点を当てている"],"ko":["React Native 및 JavaScript에 대한 지식이 필요함","일반 모바일 앱 개발이 아닌 React Native 최적화에 중점을 둠"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React Native y JavaScript","Se centra en la optimización de React Native, no en el desarrollo general de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React Native et JavaScript","Se concentre sur l''optimisation de React Native, et non sur le développement général d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React Native und JavaScript","Konzentriert sich auf die Optimierung von React Native, nicht auf die allgemeine Entwicklung von Mobile Apps"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de React Native e JavaScript","Focado na otimização do React Native, não no desenvolvimento geral de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Требует знания React Native и JavaScript","Сосредоточен на оптимизации React Native, а не на общем разработке мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React Native و JavaScript","مركز على تحسين React Native، وليس على تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة العامة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b0db741dc9bdcd5ca922d4c1026e231b16d7ac273b5fa281171e88072507f086","qualityScore":50}');
