ive Best Practices? Guía para optimizar el rendimiento de aplicaciones React Native","fr":"Qu''est-ce que les Meilleures Pratiques React Native ? Guide pour optimiser les performances des applications React Native","de":"Was sind Beste Praktiken für React Native? Leitfaden zur Leistungsoptimierung von React-Native-Anwendungen","pt":"O que são as melhores práticas para React Native? São diretrizes para otimizar o desempenho de aplicativos React Native","ru":"Что такое лучшие практики для React Native? Это руководство для оптимизации производительности приложений React Native","ar":"ما هي أفضل الممارسات ل React Native؟ هي إرشادات لتحسين أداء تطبيقات React Native"},"features":{"en":["Provides Quick Pattern code snippets for immediate pattern matching","Includes Quick Command shell commands for process and measurement","Covers JavaScript and React performance optimizations","Offers Native (iOS/Android) performance optimization techniques","Includes bundling optimizations for improved app performance","Follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding"],"zh":["JavaScript 优化","Native 优化","bundling 优化","Quick Pattern 代码片段","Quick Command Shell 命令"],"ja":["JavaScript 最適化","Native 最適化","バンドリング最適化","Quick Pattern コードスニペット","Quick Command シェルコマンド"],"ko":["JavaScript 최적화","Native 최적화","번들링 최적화","Quick Pattern 코드 스니펫","Quick Command 쉘 명령"],"es":["Optimización de JavaScript y React","Mejores prácticas para bundling y carga de aplicaciones","Guía para la medición y optimización del rendimiento","Ejemplos de código para patrones incorrectos y correctos","Comandos de shell para procesos y medición","Basado en la guía definitiva de Callstack para la optimización de React Native"],"fr":["Optimisation de JavaScript et React","Meilleures pratiques pour le bundling et le chargement des applications","Guide pour la mesure et l''optimisation des performances","Exemples de code pour les modèles incorrects et corrects","Commandes shell pour les processus et les mesures","Basé sur le guide ultime de Callstack pour l''optimisation de React Native"],"de":["Optimierung von JavaScript und React","Beste Praktiken für Bundling und Ladevorgänge von Anwendungen","Leitfaden für die Messung und Optimierung der Leistung","Codebeispiele für falsche und richtige Muster","Shell-Befehle für Prozesse und Messungen","Basierend auf dem ultimativen Leitfaden von Callstack für die Optimierung von React Native"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para JavaScript e React","Otimização nativa para iOS e Android","Otimização de empacotamento para melhorar o tempo de carregamento","Padrões rápidos para reconhecimento de padrões incorretos","Comandos rápidos para medição e processo"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для JavaScript и React","Родная оптимизация для iOS и Android","Оптимизация пакетирования для улучшения времени загрузки","Быстрые шаблоны для распознавания неправильных шаблонов","Быстрые команды для измерения и процесса"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء ل JavaScript و React","تحسين الأصلية ل iOS و Android","تحسين التعبئة لتحسين وقت التحميل","نماذج سريعة لتحديد الأنماط الخاطئة","أوامر سريعة للقياس والعملية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use react-native-best-practices","react-native-best-practices setup guide","react-native performance optimization techniques","react-native-best-practices vs react-native-optimization","react-native-best-practices install","what is react-native-best-practices","react-native-best-practices alternative","react-native optimization guide","react-native-best-practices tutorial","react-native performance improvement"],"zh":["React Native 优化","JavaScript 优化","Native 优化","bundling 优化","React Native 最佳实践","AIエージェント"],"ja":["React Native 最適化","JavaScript 最適化","Native 最適化","バンドリング最適化","React Native ベストプラクティス","AIエージェント"],"ko":["React Native 최적화","JavaScript 최적화","Native 최적화","번들링 최적화","React Native 최고의 실践","AI 도구"],"es":["react native optimización","mejores prácticas react native","guias de react native","optimización de rendimiento react native","bundling react native","optimización de javascript react native","herramientas de react native","agentes de ia para react native"],"fr":["optimisation react native","meilleures pratiques react native","guides react native","optimisation des performances react native","bundling react native","optimisation de javascript react native","outils react native","agents d''ia pour react native"],"de":["react native optimierung","beste praktiken react native","leitfäden für react native","leistungsoptimierung react native","bundling react native","optimierung von javascript react native","tools für react native","kii-agents für react native"],"pt":["react native otimização","melhores práticas react native","otimização de desempenho react native","javascript otimização","react otimização","ios otimização","android otimização","empacotamento otimização"],"ru":["react native оптимизация","лучшие практики react native","оптимизация производительности react native","javascript оптимизация","react оптимизация","ios оптимизация","android оптимизация","пакетирование оптимизация"],"ar":["react native تحسين","أفضل الممارسات react native","تحسين الأداء react native","javascript تحسين","react تحسين","ios تحسين","android تحسين","تعبئة تحسين"]}},"owner":"Faizan1421","repo":"skills-Ai","repoPath":"Faizan1421/skills-Ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T06:23:00.226Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Defer non-critical work with `InteractionManager`\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in `references/`:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| `js-profile-react.md` | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| `js-measure-fps.md` | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| `js-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| `js-atomic-state.md` | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| `js-concurrent-react.md` | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| `js-react-compiler.md` | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| `js-animations-reanimated.md` | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| `js-uncontrolled-components.md` | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `native-turbo-modules.md` | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| `native-sdks-over-polyfills.md` | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| `native-measure-tti.md` | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| `native-threading-model.md` | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| `native-profiling.md` | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| `native-platform-setup.md` | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| `native-view-flattening.md` | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| `native-memory-patterns.md` | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| `native-memory-leaks.md` | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| `bundle-barrel-exports.md` | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| `bundle-analyze-js.md` | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| `bundle-tree-shaking.md` | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| `bundle-analyze-app.md` | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| `bundle-r8-android.md` | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| `bundle-hermes-mmap.md` | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| `bundle-native-assets.md` | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| `bundle-library-size.md` | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| `bundle-code-splitting.md` | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | `js-measure-fps.md` → `js-profile-react.md` |\n| Too many re-renders | `js-profile-react.md` → `js-react-compiler.md` |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | `native-measure-tti.md` → `bundle-analyze-js.md` |\n| Large app size | `bundle-analyze-app.md` → `bundle-r8-android.md` |\n| Memory growing | `js-memory-leaks.md` or `native-memory-leaks.md` |\n| Animation drops frames | `js-animations-reanimated.md` |\n| List scroll jank | `js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md` |\n| TextInput lag | `js-uncontrolled-components.md` |\n| Native module slow | `native-turbo-modules.md` → `native-threading-model.md` |\n| Native library alignment issue | `native-android-16kb-alignment.md` |\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T08:35:17.608Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents needing advanced React Native optimization techniques.","zh":"非常适合需要高级React Native优化技术的移动开发代理。","ja":"React Nativeの高度な最適化テクニックを必要とするモバイル開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React Native 최적화 기술이 필요한 모바일 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo móvil que necesitan técnicas de optimización avanzadas de React Native.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement mobile ayant besoin de techniques d''optimisation avancées de React Native.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Development Agents, die erweiterte React Native-Optimierungstechniken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Móvel que precisam de técnicas avançadas de otimização do React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильной разработки, которым необходимы продвинутые методы оптимизации React Native.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الهاتف المحمول التي تحتاج إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React Native."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications using JavaScript, Native, and bundling optimizations, leveraging Callstack''s ''Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization'' for improved performance, covering key areas like code splitting, memoization, and caching, and utilizing quick pattern matching and shell commands for process measurement.","zh":"赋予代理优化React Native应用的能力，使用JavaScript、Native和打包优化，利用Callstack的''React Native优化终极指南''提高性能，涵盖代码分割、记忆化和缓存等关键领域，并利用快速模式匹配和shell命令进行过程测量。","ja":"エージェントがReact Nativeアプリケーションを最適化できるようにすることで、JavaScript、ネイティブ、バンドル最適化を使用し、パフォーマンスを向上させるためにCallstackの「React Native最適化の究極ガイド」を利用し、コード分割、メモ化、キャッシュなどの主要な領域をカバーし、プロセス測定のためにクイックパターンマッチングとシェルコマンドを利用する。","ko":"에이전트가 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화할 수 있도록 해주는 것으로, JavaScript, 네이티브, 번들 최적화를 사용하여 Callstack의 ''React Native 최적화 종합 가이드''를 통해 성능을 향상시키고, 코드 분할, 메모화, 캐싱 등 주요 영역을 다루며, 프로세스 측정을 위해 빠른 패턴 매칭과 셸 명령을 활용한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar aplicaciones de React Native utilizando JavaScript, Native y optimizaciones de empaquetado, aprovechando la ''Guía definitiva para la optimización de React Native'' de Callstack para un mejor rendimiento, cubriendo áreas clave como la división de código, la memorización y la caché, y utilizando coincidencia de patrones rápida y comandos de shell para la medición de procesos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native en utilisant JavaScript, Native et des optimisations de regroupement, en exploitant le ''Guide ultime pour l''optimisation de React Native'' de Callstack pour améliorer les performances, en couvrant des domaines clés tels que la division de code, la mémorisation et la mise en cache, et en utilisant une correspondance de modèles rapide et des commandes shell pour la mesure des processus.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, React Native-Anwendungen mithilfe von JavaScript, Native und Bündeloptimierungen zu optimieren, indem sie Callstacks ''Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization'' für verbesserte Leistung nutzen, wichtige Bereiche wie Code-Splitting, Memoisierung und Caching abdecken und schnelles Mustermatching und Shell-Befehle für Prozessmessungen verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar aplicações React Native usando otimizações JavaScript, Nativo e de empacotamento, aproveitando o ''Guia Definitivo para Otimização do React Native'' da Callstack para melhor desempenho, cobrindo áreas-chave como divisão de código, memoização e cache, e utilizando combinação rápida de padrões e comandos do shell para medição de processos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать приложения React Native, используя оптимизации JavaScript, Native и упаковки, опираясь на ''Полное руководство по оптимизации React Native'' от Callstack для улучшения производительности, охватывая ключевые области, такие как разделение кода, мемоизация и кэширование, и используя быстрое сопоставление с образцами и команды оболочки для измерения процессов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين أداء تطبيقات React Native باستخدام تحسينات JavaScript والتحسينات الأصلية وعمليات التعبئة، مستفيدًا من دليل ''التحسين النهائي لتطبيقات React Native'' من Callstack لتحسين الأداء، وشرح المجالات الرئيسية مثل تقسيم الشفرة والتخزين المؤقت والแคش، واستخدام مطابقة الأنماط السريعة وأوامر Shell لقياس العمليات."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React Native application performance for smoother user experiences","Implementing efficient JavaScript and Native code optimizations","Streamlining bundling processes for faster app loading times"],"zh":["为更流畅的用户体验优化React Native应用性能","实现高效的JavaScript和Native代码优化","简化打包过程以实现更快的应用加载时间"],"ja":["よりスムーズなユーザーエクスペリエンスのためにReact Nativeアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する","効率的なJavaScriptとネイティブコードの最適化を実装する","バンドルプロセスを스트リームライン化してアプリのロード時間を短縮する"],"ko":["보다 매끄러운 사용자 경험을 위해 React Native 애플리케이션 성능 최적화","효율적인 JavaScript 및 네이티브 코드 최적화 구현","번들링 프로세스简化을 통한 빠른 애플리케이션 로딩 시간"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de aplicaciones de React Native para experiencias de usuario más suaves","Implementar optimizaciones de código JavaScript y Nativo eficientes","Optimizar procesos de empaquetado para tiempos de carga de aplicaciones más rápidos"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances des applications React Native pour des expériences utilisateur plus fluides","Mettre en œuvre des optimisations de code JavaScript et Natif efficaces","Optimiser les processus de regroupement pour des temps de chargement d''applications plus rapides"],"de":["Optimieren des Leistungsverhaltens von React Native-Anwendungen für reibungslosere Benutzererfahrungen","Implementieren effizienter JavaScript- und Native-Code-Optimierungen","Optimieren von Bündelprozessen für schnellere Ladezeiten von Apps"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho de aplicações React Native para experiências de usuário mais suaves","Implementar otimizações de código JavaScript e Nativo eficientes","Otimizar processos de empacotamento para tempos de carregamento de aplicativos mais rápidos"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность приложений React Native для более плавного пользовательского опыта","Реализовывать эффективные оптимизации кода JavaScript и Native","Оптимизировать процессы упаковки для более быстрого времени загрузки приложений"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيقات React Native لتحقيق تجارب مستخدم أكثر سلاسة","تنفيذ تحسينات كفءة للشفرة JavaScript والأصلية","تحسين عمليات التعبئة لتحقيق أوقات تحميل التطبيقات الأسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native project setup","Limited to React Native ecosystem","Dependent on Callstack''s optimization guide for best practices"],"zh":["需要React Native项目设置","仅限于React Native生态系统","依赖于Callstack的优化指南以获取最佳实践"],"ja":["React Nativeプロジェクトの設定が必要","React Nativeエコシステムに限定される","ベストプラクティスを取得するためにCallstackの最適化ガイドに依存する"],"ko":["React Native 프로젝트 설정 필요","React Native 생태계에만 국한됨","최적화 가이드에 따라 최고의 관행을 얻으려면 Callstack에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto de React Native","Limitado al ecosistema de React Native","Dependiente de la guía de optimización de Callstack para las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React Native","Limité à l''écosystème React Native","Dépend de la guide d''optimisation de Callstack pour les meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Benötigt eine React Native-Projektsetup","Begrenzt auf das React Native-Ökosystem","Abhängig von Callstacks Optimierungsleitfaden für die besten Praktiken"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto React Native","Limitado ao ecossistema React Native","Dependente do guia de otimização da Callstack para as melhores práticas"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта React Native","Ограничен экосистемой React Native","Зависит от руководства по оптимизации Callstack для лучших практик"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React Native","محدود ببيئة React Native","يعتمد على دليل تحسين أداء Callstack لأفضل الممارسات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b0db741dc9bdcd5ca922d4c1026e231b16d7ac273b5fa281171e88072507f086","qualityScore":50}');
