INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('wix/react-native-navigation/rnn-codebase', 'rnn-codebase', 'wix', 'react-native-navigation', 'community', 'rnn-codebase wix react-native-navigation community hacktoberfest navigation navigator react-native react-native-navigation The rnn-codebase skill provides a complete native navigation solution for React Native, benefiting developers who need efficient navigation commands. It enables smooth navigation through JS/TS, TurboModule, and native iOS and Android layers. rnn-codebase是一个React Native的原生导航解决方案，具有三层架构：JS/TS、TurboModule和iOS/Android原生层。 rnn-codebaseは、React Native用のネイティブナビゲーションソリューションです。JS/TS、TurboModule、iOS/Androidネイティブ層の3層アーキテクチャを備えています - AIエージェント rnn-codebase는 React Native용 네이티브 네비게이션 솔루션으로, JS/TS, TurboModule 및 iOS/Android 네이티브 레이어의 3계층 아키텍처를 갖추고 있습니다. rnn-codebase es una solución de navegación nativa completa para React Native, con una arquitectura de tres capas que incluye JS/TS, TurboModule y capas nativas para iOS y Android. rnn-codebase est une solution de navigation native complète pour React Native, avec une architecture à trois couches comprenant JS/TS, TurboModule et des couches natives pour iOS et Android. rnn-codebase ist eine komplette native Navigationslösung für React Native, mit einer dreischichtigen Architektur, die JS/TS, TurboModule und native Schichten für iOS und Android umfasst. O RNN-Codebase é uma solução de navegação nativa para React Native, com três camadas que espelham umas às outras: JS/TS, TurboModule e nativo para iOS e Android. RNN-Codebase — это полное решение для навигации в React Native, состоящее из трёх слоев: JS/TS, TurboModule и родной для iOS и Android, использующее ИИ Агенты RNN-Codebase هو حل كامل للتنقل في React Native، يتكون من ثلاث طبقات تتطابق مع بعضها البعض: JS/TS و TurboModule و الأصلي لنظامي iOS و Android باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي how to use rnn-codebase rnn-codebase setup guide react native navigation solution rnn-codebase alternative rnn-codebase vs react navigation native navigation for react native rnn-codebase install react native turbo module rnn-codebase React Native导航 原生导航解决方案 JS/TS TurboModule iOS Android 导航命令 高性能导航 Utilizes TurboModule bridge for efficient communication between JS/TS and native modules Supports navigation commands through `Navigation.push()` and `NativeCommandsSender.ts` Employs `RNNTurboModule` for iOS and `NavigationTurboModule.kt` for Android Processes navigation commands through a pipeline in `Commands.ts` Integrates with `RNNCommandsHandler` and `RNNViewController` for native iOS navigation rnn-codebase is a React Native navigation solution with a three-layer architecture, facilitating navigation commands through JS/TS, TurboModule bridge, and native iOS and Android modules.');
