,"Recursos de animação e simulação para robototecnica","Integração com Gazebo e outros ambientes de simulação","Suporte a MJCF e SDF para definição de modelos"],"ru":["Обнаружение столкновений для реалистичных симуляций","Python-биндинги для интеграции с другими библиотеками","Поддержка динамики твёрдых тел и многотельной динамики","Функции анимации и симуляции для робототехники","Интеграция с Gazebo и другими симуляционными средами","Поддержка MJCF и SDF для определения моделей"],"ar":["كشف الاصطدام لتحاكي الواقعية","ربط بايثون لتكامل مع مكتبات أخرى","دعم ديناميكيات الجسم الصلب ومتعددة الأجسام","ميزات التحريك والتحاكي للrobotics","تكامل مع Gazebo وبيئات التحاكي الأخرى","دعم MJCF و SDF لتعريف النماذج"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use dart-contribute","dart-contribute vs gazebo","dart-contribute setup guide","what is dart-contribute","dart-contribute alternative","dart-contribute install","C++20 physics engine","python bindings for DART","collision detection in robotics","dart-contribute for animation"],"zh":["DART-Contribute","C++20 物理引擎","机器人开发","动画开发","碰撞检测","约束","Python 绑定","分支命名","代码风格指南"],"ja":["DART-Contribute","C++20 物理エンジン","ロボット開発","アニメーション開発","衝突検知","制約","Python バインディング","ブランチ命名","コードスタイルガイド"],"ko":["DART-Contribute","C++20 물리 엔진","로봇 개발","애니메이션 개발","충돌 검출","제약","Python 바인딩","브랜치命名","코드 스타일 가이드"],"es":["motor de física C++20","robótica y animación","detección de colisiones","enlaces de Python","Gazebo","URDF","cinemática de cuerpos rígidos","Herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","Agentes de IA para robótica"],"fr":["moteur de physique C++20","robotique et animation","détection de collision","liens Python","Gazebo","URDF","cinématique des corps rigides","Outils d''IA pour développeurs","Agents d''IA pour la robotique"],"de":["C++20-Physik-Motor","Robotik und Animation","Kollisionsdetektion","Python-Bindings","Gazebo","URDF","Kinematik von starren Körpern","KI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Agents für Robotik"],"pt":["DART Contribute","motor de física","detecção de colisão","vinculação Python","dinâmica de corpos rígidos","simulação de robototecnica","Gazebo","MJCF","SDF","desenvolvimento de jogos"],"ru":["DART Contribute","физический движок","обнаружение столкновений","Python-биндинги","динамика твёрдых тел","симуляция робототехники","Gazebo","MJCF","SDF","разработка игр"],"ar":["أداة DART Contribute","محرك الفيزياء","كشف الاصطدام","ربط بايثون","ديناميكيات الجسم الصلب","تحاكي الروبوتات","Gazebo","MJCF","SDF","تطوير الألعاب"]}},"owner":"dartsim","repo":"dart","repoPath":"dartsim/dart","stars":1058,"forks":296,"updatedAt":"2026-02-22T15:46:08Z","topics":["collision-detection","computer-animation","constraint-dynamics","dartpy","dynamics","gazebo","inverse-kinematics","kinematics","lie-group","mjcf","multibody-dynamics","physics-engine","python-bindings","rigid-body-dynamics","robotics","sdf","simulation","urdf"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dart-contribute","description":"DART contribution workflow - branching, PRs, code review, dual-PR for bugfixes","bodyPreview":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-contribute/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART Contribution Workflow\n\nLoad this skill when contributing code to DART.\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nFor complete guide: `docs/onboarding/contributing.md`\n\nFor code style: `docs/onboarding/code-style.md`\n\n## Branch Naming\n\n- `feature/<topic>` - New features\n- `fix/<topic>` - Bug fixes\n-","body":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-contribute/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART Contribution Workflow\n\nLoad this skill when contributing code to DART.\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nFor complete guide: `docs/onboarding/contributing.md`\n\nFor code style: `docs/onboarding/code-style.md`\n\n## Branch Naming\n\n- `feature/<topic>` - New features\n- `fix/<topic>` - Bug fixes\n- `refactor/<topic>` - Refactoring\n- `docs/<topic>` - Documentation\n\n## PR Workflow\n\n```bash\n# Create branch\ngit checkout -b <type>/<topic> origin/main\n\n# Make changes, then\npixi run lint\npixi run test-all\n\n# Push and create PR\ngit push -u origin HEAD\ngh pr create --draft --milestone \"DART 7.0\"\n```\n\nRule of thumb: run `pixi run lint` before committing so auto-fixes are included.\n\nUse `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` and ensure the PR description covers Summary, Motivation, Changes, Testing, Breaking Changes, and Related Issues.\n\n## Milestones (Required)\n\nAlways set a milestone when creating PRs:\n\n| Target Branch  | Milestone                     |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `main`         | `DART 7.0` (or next major)    |\n| `release-6.16` | `DART 6.16.x` (current patch) |\n\n```bash\n# Set milestone on existing PR\ngh pr edit <PR#> --milestone \"DART 7.0\"\n\n# List available milestones\ngh api repos/dartsim/dart/milestones --jq ''.[] | .title''\n```\n\n## CRITICAL: Bug Fix Dual-PR\n\nBug fixes require PRs to **BOTH** branches:\n\n1. **`release-6.16`** - Current release\n2. **`main`** - Next release\n\nSteps:\n\n1. Fix on `release-6.16` first\n2. Cherry-pick to `main`\n3. Create separate PRs for each\n\n## CHANGELOG (After PR Created)\n\nAfter creating a PR, check if CHANGELOG.md needs updating:\n\n| Change Type                      | Update CHANGELOG?                    |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| Bug fixes                        | ✅ Yes                               |\n| New features                     | ✅ Yes                               |\n| Breaking changes                 | ✅ Yes (in Breaking Changes section) |\n| Documentation improvements       | ✅ Yes (in Tooling and Docs)         |\n| CI/tooling changes               | ✅ Yes (in Tooling and Docs)         |\n| Refactoring (no behavior change) | ⚠️ Maybe (if significant)            |\n| Dependency bumps                 | ⚠️ Maybe (if user-facing)            |\n| Typo fixes                       | ❌ No                                |\n\nFormat: `- Description. ([#PR](https://github.com/dartsim/dart/pull/PR))`\n\n```bash\n# Example entry in CHANGELOG.md under appropriate section:\n- Added AI-native documentation with AGENTS.md and module-specific guides. ([#2446](https://github.com/dartsim/dart/pull/2446))\n```\n\n## Code Review\n\n- Address all feedback\n- Keep changes minimal\n- Update tests if behavior changed\n- Run full validation before pushing fixes\n\n## CI Loop\n\n```bash\ngh run watch <RUN_ID> --interval 30\n```\n\nFix failures until green.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:26:29.653Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Robotics and Animation Agents requiring advanced physics engine capabilities with C++20 and Python bindings.","zh":"适合需要高级物理引擎能力的Robotics和Animation Agents，支持C++20和Python绑定。","ja":"ロボティクスとアニメーションエージェントが高度な物理エンジン機能を必要とする場合に適しています。C++20とPythonバインディングをサポートしています。","ko":"고급 물리 엔진 기능이 필요한 로봇공학 및 애니메이션 에이전트에 적합합니다. C++20 및 Python 바인딩을 지원합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Robótica y Animación que requieren capacidades avanzadas de motor de física con enlaces C++20 y Python.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de robotique et d''animation nécessitant des capacités de moteur de physique avancées avec des liaisons C++20 et Python.","de":"Ideal für Robotik- und Animationsagenten, die erweiterte Physik-Engine-Funktionen mit C++20- und Python-Bindings erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Robótica e Animação que exigem capacidades avançadas de motor de física com C++20 e ligação Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для роботов и анимационных агентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей физического движка с C++20 и Python-привязками.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الروبوتات والرسوم المتحركة الذين يحتاجون إلى مواصفات محرك الفيزياء المتقدمة مع C++20 وربط Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to simulate complex robotics and animation scenarios using a C++20 physics engine, leveraging collision detection, constraints, and Python bindings for seamless integration with DART, gazebo, and urdf.","zh":"赋予代理模拟复杂的机器人和动画场景的能力，使用C++20物理引擎，利用碰撞检测、约束和Python绑定与DART、gazebo和urdf进行无缝集成。","ja":"C++20物理エンジンを使用して、エージェントが複雑なロボティクスとアニメーションのシナリオをシミュレートできるようにします。衝突検出、制約、Pythonバインディングを活用して、DART、gazebo、urdfとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"C++20 물리 엔진을 사용하여 에이전트가 복잡한 로봇공학 및 애니메이션 시나리오를 시뮬레이션할 수 있도록 합니다. 충돌 감지, 제약 및 Python 바인딩을 활용하여 DART, gazebo 및 urdf와 無縫に 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simular escenarios de robótica y animación complejos utilizando un motor de física C++20, aprovechando la detección de colisiones, restricciones y enlaces Python para una integración perfecta con DART, gazebo y urdf.","fr":"Permet aux agents de simuler des scénarios de robotique et d''animation complexes en utilisant un moteur de physique C++20, en exploitant la détection de collision, les contraintes et les liaisons Python pour une intégration transparente avec DART, gazebo et urdf.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Roboter- und Animations-Szenarien unter Verwendung eines C++20-Physik-Motors zu simulieren, der Kollisionsdetektion, Einschränkungen und Python-Bindings für eine nahtlose Integration mit DART, gazebo und urdf nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a simular cenários complexos de robótica e animação usando um motor de física C++20, aproveitando a detecção de colisões, restrições e ligação Python para integração transparente com DART, gazebo e urdf.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью模улировать сложные робототехнические и анимационные сценарии с использованием физического движка C++20, использующего обнаружение столкновений, ограничения и Python-привязки для бесшовной интеграции с DART, gazebo и urdf.","ar":"يمكن الوكيل من محاكاة سيناريوهات متقدمة لروبوتات والرسوم المتحركة باستخدام محرك فيزياء C++20 ، واستخدام كشف الاصطدامات والقيود وربط Python من أجل التكامل السلس مع DART و gazebo و urdf."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing realistic robotics simulations with collision detection and constraints","Creating detailed animation sequences with precise physics engine control","Integrating DART with gazebo and urdf for comprehensive robotics and animation development"],"zh":["开发具有碰撞检测和约束的真实机器人模拟","创建具有精确物理引擎控制的详细动画序列","将DART与gazebo和urdf集成，实现全面机器人和动画开发"],"ja":["衝突検出と制約を備えたリアルなロボティクスシミュレーションの開発","正確な物理エンジン制御を備えた詳細なアニメーションシーケンスの作成","DARTをgazeboとurdfと統合して、包括的なロボティクスとアニメーションの開発を行う"],"ko":["충돌 감지 및 제약을 갖춘 실제 로봇공학 시뮬레이션 개발","정밀한 물리 엔진 제어를 갖춘詳細한 애니메이션 시퀀스 생성","DART를 gazebo 및 urdf와 통합하여 종합적인 로봇공학 및 애니메이션 개발을 수행합니다"],"es":["Desarrollar simulaciones de robótica realistas con detección de colisiones y restricciones","Crear secuencias de animación detalladas con un control preciso del motor de física","Integrar DART con gazebo y urdf para un desarrollo de robótica y animación integral"],"fr":["Développer des simulations de robotique réalistes avec détection de collision et contraintes","Créer des séquences d''animation détaillées avec un contrôle précis du moteur de physique","Intégrer DART avec gazebo et urdf pour un développement de robotique et d''animation complet"],"de":["Entwicklung realistischer Roboter-Simulationen mit Kollisionsdetektion und Einschränkungen","Erstellen detaillierter Animationssequenzen mit präziser Physik-Engine-Steuerung","Integration von DART mit gazebo und urdf für umfassende Roboter- und Animationsentwicklung"],"pt":["Desenvolver simulações realistas de robótica com detecção de colisões e restrições","Criar sequências de animação detalhadas com controle preciso do motor de física","Integrar DART com gazebo e urdf para desenvolvimento abrangente de robótica e animação"],"ru":["Разработка реалистичных симуляций робототехники с обнаружением столкновений и ограничениями","Создание детальных анимационных последовательностей с точным контролем физического движка","Интеграция DART с gazebo и urdf для комплексного развития робототехники и анимации"],"ar":["إنشاء محاكاة واقعية لروبوتات مع كشف الاصطدامات والقيود","إنشاء تسلسلات رسوم متحركة مفصلة مع تحكم دقيق في محرك الفيزياء","دمج DART مع gazebo و urdf من أجل تطوير شامل لروبوتات والرسوم المتحركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires C++20 compatibility","Limited to DART, gazebo, and urdf ecosystems","Python bindings required for non-C++ interactions"],"zh":["需要C++20兼容性","仅限于DART、gazebo和urdf生态系统","需要Python绑定进行非C++交互"],"ja":["C++20の互換性が必要","DART、gazebo、urdfのエコシステムに限定される","非C++の相互作用にはPythonバインディングが必要"],"ko":["C++20 호환성이 필요합니다","DART, gazebo 및 urdf 생태계에만 제한됩니다","비C++ 상호 작용을 위한 Python 바인딩이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con C++20","Limitado a los ecosistemas DART, gazebo y urdf","Se requieren enlaces Python para interacciones no C++"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité C++20","Limité aux écosystèmes DART, gazebo et urdf","Des liaisons Python sont requises pour les interactions non C++"],"de":["Benötigt C++20-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf die DART-, gazebo- und urdf-Ökosysteme","Python-Bindings sind für nicht-C++-Interaktionen erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com C++20","Limitado aos ecossistemas DART, gazebo e urdf","Ligação Python necessária para interações não-C++"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с C++20","Ограничен экосистемами DART, gazebo и urdf","Python-привязки необходимы для не-C++ взаимодействий"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع C++20","محدود بنظام DART و gazebo و urdf","ربط Python مطلوب للتفاعلات غير C++"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"849857141ee951730d7100aa9faa0ad520aa5ba5cdf23fd185c6884ea6bc4314","qualityScore":49}');
