cts は、Playwright の fixtures パターンと役割ベースのロケータを使用したモダンな POM アーキテクチャです","ko":"Playwright Page Objects 는 Playwright 의 fixtures 패턴과 역할 기반 로케이터를 사용하는 현대적인 POM 아키텍처입니다","es":"Playwright Page Objects es una herramienta de pruebas E2E que utiliza patrones de fixtures y composición para una arquitectura POM eficiente","fr":"Playwright Page Objects est un outil de test E2E qui utilise des modèles de fixtures et de composition pour une architecture POM efficace","de":"Playwright Page Objects ist ein Tool für E2E-Tests, das Fixtures-Muster und Komposition für eine effiziente POM-Architektur verwendet","pt":"O que é Playwright Page Objects? É uma ferramenta de desenvolvimento que fornece uma arquitetura de POM moderna.","ru":"Что такое Playwright Page Objects? Это инструмент разработки, который обеспечивает современную архитектуру POM.","ar":"ما هي أداة Playwright Page Objects؟ هي أداة تطوير توفر بنية تحتية حديثة لنمط Objects Page."},"features":{"en":["Implements modern POM architecture using Playwright''s fixtures pattern","Utilizes composition over inheritance for maintainable test code","Employs role-based locators for efficient element identification","Supports on-demand instantiation via fixtures","Enables reusable component-level test abstractions","Integrates with tools like React, Vite, and Vitest for seamless testing"],"zh":["现代 POM 架构","Fixtures 模式","基于角色的定位器","支持 React 和 TypeScript","集成 Storybook 和 Vitest"],"ja":["モダンな POM アーキテクチャ","Fixtures パターン","役割ベースのロケータ","React と TypeScript のサポート","Storybook と Vitest の統合"],"ko":["현대적인 POM 아키텍처","Fixtures 패턴","역할 기반 로케이터","React 와 TypeScript 지원","Storybook 와 Vitest 통합"],"es":["Patrones de fixtures para una instantiación a demanda","Composición sobre herencia para una mayor flexibilidad","Locators basados en roles para una identificación precisa de elementos","Integración con herramientas como React, React Query y Storybook","Compatibilidad con TypeScript y Vite para un desarrollo más eficiente"],"fr":["Modèles de fixtures pour une instantiation à la demande","Composition sur héritage pour une plus grande flexibilité","Locators basés sur les rôles pour une identification précise des éléments","Intégration avec des outils tels que React, React Query et Storybook","Compatibilité avec TypeScript et Vite pour un développement plus efficace"],"de":["Fixtures-Muster für eine bedarfsorientierte Instantiierung","Komposition über Vererbung für eine größere Flexibilität","Rollenbasierte Locators für eine präzise Elementidentifizierung","Integration mit Tools wie React, React Query und Storybook","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript und Vite für eine effizientere Entwicklung"],"pt":["Arquitetura de POM moderna usando o padrão de fixtures do Playwright","Integração com React, TypeScript e Vite","Suporte a locators baseados em papéis","Composição em vez de herança","Instantiação sob demanda com fixtures"],"ru":["Современная архитектура POM, использующая шаблон fixtures от Playwright","Интеграция с React, TypeScript и Vite","Поддержка локаторов на основе ролей","Композиция вместо наследования","Воспроизведение под запросом с помощью fixtures"],"ar":["بنية تحتية حديثة لنمط Objects Page باستخدام نمط الإصلاح من Playwright","التكامل مع React و TypeScript و Vite","دعم محددات القائمة على الأدوار","التركيب بدلاً من الوراثة","إنشاء حزم على الطلب باستخدام الإصلاحات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use playwright-page-objects","playwright-page-objects setup guide","playwright-page-objects vs Cypress","playwright-page-objects install","what is playwright-page-objects","playwright-page-objects alternative","playwright-page-objects tutorial","playwright-page-objects react integration","playwright-page-objects vitest support"],"zh":["Playwright Page Objects","AIエージェント","E2E 测试","POM 架构","React","TypeScript","Storybook","Vitest"],"ja":["Playwright Page Objects","AIエージェント","E2E テスト","POM アーキテクチャ","React","TypeScript","Storybook","Vitest"],"ko":["Playwright Page Objects","AI 에이전트","E2E 테스트","POM 아키텍처","React","TypeScript","Storybook","Vitest"],"es":["Playwright Page Objects","pruebas E2E","patrones de fixtures","composición sobre herencia","locators basados en roles","React","React Query","Storybook","TypeScript","Vite"],"fr":["Playwright Page Objects","tests E2E","modèles de fixtures","composition sur héritage","locators basés sur les rôles","React","React Query","Storybook","TypeScript","Vite"],"de":["Playwright Page Objects","E2E-Tests","Fixtures-Muster","Komposition über Vererbung","rollenbasierte Locators","React","React Query","Storybook","TypeScript","Vite"],"pt":["playwright page objects","desenvolvimento web","react","typescript","vite","arquitetura de pom","fixtures","locators baseados em papéis","composição em vez de herança"],"ru":["playwright page objects","разработка веб-приложений","react","typescript","vite","архитектура pom","fixtures","локаторы на основе ролей","композиция вместо наследования"],"ar":["أداة Playwright Page Objects","تطوير تطبيقات الويب","react","typescript","vite","بنية تحتية لنمط Objects Page","إصلاحات","محددات القائمة على الأدوار","التركيب بدلاً من الوراثة"]}},"owner":"bartstc","repo":"vite-ts-react-template","repoPath":"bartstc/vite-ts-react-template","stars":114,"forks":12,"updatedAt":"2026-02-07T10:28:19Z","topics":["chakra-ui","claude-code","copilot","github-actions","i18next","msw","playwright","pnpm","react","react-query","react-router-v7","reactjs","spa-template","storybook","template","typescript","vite","vitest","xstate","zustand"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-page-objects","description":"Use when creating page objects or refactoring Playwright E2E tests for better maintainability with Page Object Model patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Playwright Page Objects\n\nModern POM architecture using Playwright''s fixtures pattern, composition over inheritance, and role-based locators.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Setting up E2E test architecture from scratch\n- Creating new page objects or component helpers\n- Implementing test fixtures for dependency injection\n- Refactoring existing page objects for maintainability\n- Writing reusable component-level test abstractions\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Fixtures over PageManager** — On-demand instantiatio","body":"# Playwright Page Objects\n\nModern POM architecture using Playwright''s fixtures pattern, composition over inheritance, and role-based locators.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Setting up E2E test architecture from scratch\n- Creating new page objects or component helpers\n- Implementing test fixtures for dependency injection\n- Refactoring existing page objects for maintainability\n- Writing reusable component-level test abstractions\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Fixtures over PageManager** — On-demand instantiation, automatic setup/teardown, native TypeScript inference\n2. **Composition over inheritance** — Compose from focused components, avoid deep class hierarchies\n3. **Role-based selectors first** — `getByRole()` > `getByLabel()` > `getByText()` > `getByTestId()`\n4. **Tests own assertions** — Page objects expose state via getters, tests make assertions\n5. **Separate pages by workflow** — ProductListPage ≠ ProductDetailsPage (different user interactions)\n6. **Readonly locators** — All page object locator properties should be `readonly`\n7. **Fluent interfaces** — Methods return `this` for chaining; navigation methods return target page object\n8. **Private internals** — Mark implementation details (spinners, retry logic, helpers) as `private`\n9. **Wait for stability** — Use `waitForPageLoad()`, `waitForResponse()` before assertions\n10. **High-level actions** — Create AppActions class for complex multi-page user flows\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern            | When to Use                                | Reference                                             |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Fixtures           | Always for page object instantiation       | [fixtures-pattern.md](references/fixtures-pattern.md) |\n| Basic POM          | All page objects                           | [core-patterns.md](references/core-patterns.md)       |\n| Composition        | Shared UI elements (header, cards, modals) | [core-patterns.md](references/core-patterns.md)       |\n| Waiting strategies | Loading states, API responses              | [core-patterns.md](references/core-patterns.md)       |\n| High-level actions | Multi-page flows (checkout, onboarding)    | [core-patterns.md](references/core-patterns.md)       |\n| Form handling      | Multi-step forms, validation               | [form-handling.md](references/form-handling.md)       |\n\n## Locator Priority\n\n```\n1. page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Add to Cart'' })  // Preferred\n2. page.getByLabel(''Email'')                           // Form inputs\n3. page.getByText(''Welcome back'')                     // Non-interactive\n4. page.getByPlaceholder(''Search...'')                 // When no label\n5. page.getByTestId(''cart-item-count'')                // Escape hatch\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns Summary\n\n| Anti-Pattern        | Problem                     | Solution                        |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| Assertions in POMs  | Hidden test logic           | Expose state, assert in tests   |\n| Fat page objects    | 50+ locators unmaintainable | Split into components           |\n| Deep inheritance    | Rigid, hard to modify       | Use composition                 |\n| CSS selectors       | Break on styling changes    | Use role-based selectors        |\n| Wrapping Playwright | Unnecessary abstraction     | Use Playwright directly         |\n| All members public  | Exposes internals           | Mark internal members `private` |\n\n## References\n\n- [Fixtures Pattern](references/fixtures-pattern.md) — Setup and dependency injection\n- [Core Patterns](references/core-patterns.md) — Basic POM, composition, locators, waiting, high-level actions\n- [Form Handling](references/form-handling.md) — Multi-step flows, validation components\n- [Anti-Patterns](references/anti-patterns.md) — What to avoid\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:30:43.952Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing robust End-to-End testing capabilities with Playwright and React","zh":"非常适合需要使用Playwright和React进行强大的端到端测试能力的前端代理","ja":"PlaywrightとReactを使った堅牢なエンドツーエンドテスト機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright와 React를 사용하여 강력한 종단 간 테스트 기능을 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de prueba de extremo a extremo robustas con Playwright y React","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de test de bout en bout robustes avec Playwright et React","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die robuste End-to-End-Testfunktionen mit Playwright und React benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades robustas de teste de ponta a ponta com Playwright e React","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы надежные возможности тестирования от начала до конца с помощью Playwright и React","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات اختبار شاملة قوية مع Playwright و React"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement modern Page Object Model architecture using Playwright''s fixtures pattern, composition over inheritance, and role-based locators, streamlining E2E testing with tools like Vite","zh":"赋予代理实施使用Playwright的固定模式、组合优于继承和基于角色的定位器的现代页面对象模型架构，从而通过像Vite这样的工具简化E2E测试","ja":"Playwrightのフィクスチャパターン、コンポジションオーバー継承、ロールベースのロケータを使用して、モダンなページオブジェクトモデルアーキテクチャを実装するエージェントをエンパワーメントし、ViteのようなツールでE2Eテストをストリームライン化する","ko":"Playwright의 고정 패턴, 구성이 상속을凌驾하고 역할 기반의 위치 지정자를 사용하여 현대적인 페이지 객체 모델 아키텍처를 구현하도록 에이전트를 강화하여 Vite와 같은 도구로 종단 간 테스트를 간소화하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar arquitectura de modelo de objeto de página moderna usando el patrón de fixtures de Playwright, composición sobre herencia y localizadores basados en roles, simplificando las pruebas de extremo a extremo con herramientas como Vite","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une architecture de modèle d''objet de page moderne en utilisant le modèle de fixtures de Playwright, la composition sur l''héritage et les localiseurs basés sur les rôles, simplifiant ainsi les tests de bout en bout avec des outils comme Vite","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine moderne Page-Object-Modell-Architektur zu implementieren, die Playwrights Fixtures-Muster, Zusammensetzung über Vererbung und rollenbasierte Locator verwendet, um End-to-End-Tests mit Tools wie Vite zu rationalisieren","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem arquitetura de modelo de objeto de página moderna usando o padrão de fixtures do Playwright, composição em vez de herança e localizadores baseados em funções, simplificando o teste de ponta a ponta com ferramentas como Vite","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовать современную архитектуру модели объекта страницы, используя шаблон фикстур Playwright, композицию вместо наследования и локаторы на основе ролей, упрощая тестирование от начала до конца с помощью инструментов, таких как Vite","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتنفيذ هيكلة نموذج كائن الصفحة الحديثة باستخدام نمط إصلاحات Playwright، والتركيب بدلاً من الوراثة، ومحددات الدور، وبذلك يُبسط اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية مع أدوات مثل Vite"},"useCases":{"en":["Setting up E2E test architecture from scratch","Creating reusable component-level test abstractions","Refactoring existing page objects for maintainability"],"zh":["从头开始设置端到端测试架构","创建可重用的组件级测试抽象","重构现有的页面对象以实现可维护性"],"ja":["エンドツーエンドテストアーキテクチャをスクラッチから設定する","再利用可能なコンポーネントレベルのテスト抽象を作成する","既存のページオブジェクトをメンテナンス性のためにリファクタリングする"],"ko":["종단 간 테스트 아키텍처를 처음부터 설정","재사용 가능한 구성 요소 수준의 테스트 추상을 생성","既存의 페이지 개체를 유지 보수 가능하게 리팩토링"],"es":["Configuración de la arquitectura de prueba de extremo a extremo desde cero","Creación de abstracciones de prueba a nivel de componente reutilizable","Reestructuración de objetos de página existentes para mantener la capacidad de mantenimiento"],"fr":["Configuration de l''architecture de test de bout en bout à partir de zéro","Création d''abstractions de test au niveau du composant réutilisable","Réorganisation d''objets de page existants pour maintenir la capacité de maintenance"],"de":["Einrichtung der End-to-End-Testarchitektur von Grund auf","Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Testabstraktionen auf Komponentenebene","Umstrukturierung bestehender Seitenobjekte für die Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Configuração da arquitetura de teste de ponta a ponta do zero","Criação de abstrações de teste de nível de componente reutilizáveis","Reestruturação de objetos de página existentes para manutenção"],"ru":["Настройка архитектуры тестирования от начала до конца с нуля","Создание многократно используемых абстракций тестирования на уровне компонентов","Перестройка существующих объектов страницы для поддержки"],"ar":["تكوين هيكلة اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية من الصفر","إنشاء تجريدات اختبار مستوى المكون قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","إعادة هيكلة كائنات الصفحة الحالية من أجل الصيانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright and React setup","Limited to Single Page Application development"],"zh":["需要Playwright和React设置","仅限单页应用程序开发"],"ja":["PlaywrightとReactの設定が必要","シングルページアプリケーションの開発に限定"],"ko":["Playwright와 React 설정이 필요","단일 페이지 애플리케이션 개발에 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Playwright y React","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones de página única"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Playwright et React","Limité au développement d''applications à page unique"],"de":["Benötigt Playwright- und React-Setup","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Single-Page-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Playwright e React","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de Aplicativos de Página Única"],"ru":["Требует настройки Playwright и React","Ограничен разработкой Одностраничных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Playwright و React","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات ص