INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('JetBrains/intellij-community/debugging', 'debugging', 'JetBrains', 'intellij-community', 'community', 'debugging JetBrains intellij-community community code-editor ide intellij intellij-community intellij-platform The debugging skill provides technical resources for IntelliJ IDEA & IntelliJ Platform, benefiting developers who need to diagnose IDE freezes and analyze exceptions. It offers guides on logging, performance, and exception analysis. IntelliJ IDEA调试功能提供了强大的日志搜索和异常分析能力 IntelliJ IDEAのデバッグ機能は強力なログ検索と例外分析機能を提供します IntelliJ IDEA의 디버깅 기능은 강력한 로그 검색과 예외 분석 기능을 제공합니다 Depuración de código en IntelliJ IDEA con recursos técnicos para Agents de IA. Aprende a diagnosticar problemas y optimizar tu código Débogage de code dans IntelliJ IDEA avec des ressources techniques pour les outils d''IA. Découvrez comment diagnostiquer les problèmes et optimiser votre code Code-Debugging in IntelliJ IDEA mit technischen Ressourcen für KI-Tools. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Probleme diagnostizieren und Ihren Code optimieren können Depuração no IntelliJ IDEA inclui investigação de congelamentos, análise de exceções e busca no arquivo idea.log Отладка в IntelliJ Platform включает в себя диагностику зависаний, анализ исключений и поиск в файле idea.log تصحيح أخطاء أداة IntelliJ IDEA يتضمن تحليل التجميدات وتحليل الاستثناءات والبحث في ملف idea.log how to use debugging in IntelliJ what is debugging in software development debugging alternative to print statements debugging vs logging intellij debugging setup guide debugging install for IntelliJ IDEA intellij platform debugging tutorial debugging best practices for developers intellij idea debugging tools IntelliJ IDEA调试 日志搜索 异常分析 Logger FAQ How to Investigate Freezes Exception Analyzing FAQ idea.log文件搜索 AIエージェント调试 代码错误修复 Searches idea.log using specific log levels and patterns Provides Logger FAQ for frequently asked logging questions Offers guides on how to investigate freezes in IntelliJ IDEA Includes Exception Analyzing FAQ for categorizing exceptions Supports performance optimization through diagnostic techniques Utilizes IntelliJ Platform for comprehensive debugging capabilities Debugging is the process of identifying and fixing errors in code, involving techniques such as logging, exception analysis, and performance optimization.');
