s GCP spécifiques","Intégration avec le gestionnaire de packages CCPI","Assistance automatisée pour les tâches de configuration de Memorystore"],"de":["Produktionsorchestrierungsmuster","Interaktive Tutorials mit 11 Jupyter-Notebooks","Unterstützung für GCP-spezifische Fähigkeiten","Integration mit dem CCPI-Paket-Manager","Automatisierte Unterstützung für Memorystore-Konfigurationsaufgaben"],"pt":["Fornece orientação passo a passo para configuração de Memorystore","Ativa automaticamente ao mencionar ''memorystore config'' em sua solicitação","Cobre padrões de configuração de Memorystore e práticas recomendadas","Suporta serviços específicos do GCP, incluindo Compute, Storage, BigQuery e Vertex AI"],"ru":["Предоставляет пошаговое руководство для конфигурации Memorystore","Активируется автоматически при упоминании ''memorystore config'' в вашем запросе","Покрывает шаблоны конфигурации Memorystore и лучшие практики","Поддерживает сервисы GCP, включая Compute, Storage, BigQuery и Vertex AI"],"ar":["يوفر إرشادات خطوة خطوة لضبط مخزن الذاكرة","يتنشط تلقائيًا عند ذكر ''ضبط مخزن الذاكرة'' في طلبك","يغطي أنماط ضبط مخزن الذاكرة وأفضل الممارسات","يدعم خدمات جوجل سحابية، بما في ذلك Compute و Storage و BigQuery و Vertex AI"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use memorystore-config","memorystore-config setup guide","GCP skills memorystore-config","memorystore-config vs cloud storage","what is memorystore-config","memorystore-config install","automated memorystore config","GCP memorystore-config best practices","memorystore-config for AI agents","memorystore-config tutorial"],"zh":["Memorystore Config","Google Cloud Platform","AIエージェント工具","Compute","Storage","BigQuery","Vertex AI","CCPI包管理器","Jupyter Notebook"],"ja":["Memorystore Config","Google Cloud Platform","AIエージェント","Compute","Storage","BigQuery","Vertex AI","CCPIパッケージマネージャー","Jupyter Notebook"],"ko":["Memorystore Config","Google Cloud Platform","AI 에이전트","Compute","Storage","BigQuery","Vertex AI","CCPI 패키지 매니저","Jupyter Notebook"],"es":["Memorystore Config","AI Agent","Herramientas de AI","GCP Skills","Configuración de Memorystore","Patrones de orquestación de producción","Tutoriales interactivos","CCPI package manager"],"fr":["Configuration de Memorystore","Agent IA","Outils d''IA","Compétences GCP","Configuration de Memorystore","Modèles d''orchestration de production","Didacticiels interactifs","Gestionnaire de packages CCPI"],"de":["Memorystore Config","AI-Agent","AI-Tools","GCP-Fähigkeiten","Memorystore-Konfiguration","Produktionsorchestrierungsmuster","Interaktive Tutorials","CCPI-Paket-Manager"],"pt":["memorystore config","configuração de memorystore","gcp skills","orquestração de produção","tutoriais interativos","jupyter notebooks","ccpi package manager"],"ru":["memorystore config","конфигурация memorystore","gcp навыки","оркестровка производства","интерактивные уроки","jupyter notebooks","менеджер пакетов ccpi"],"ar":["ضبط مخزن الذاكرة","ضبط مخزن الذاكرة في جوجل سحابية","مهارات جوجل سحابية","أوركسترا إنتاج","دروس تفاعلية","دفاتر جupyter","مدير حزم ccpi"]}},"owner":"jeremylongshore","repo":"claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","repoPath":"jeremylongshore/claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.274Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"memorystore-config","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Memorystore Config\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for memorystore config tasks within the GCP Skills domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"memorystore config\" in your request\n- Ask about memorystore config patterns or best practices\n- Need help with google cloud platform skills covering compute, storage, bigquery, vertex ai, and gcp-specific services.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for memorystore config\n2.","body":"# Memorystore Config\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for memorystore config tasks within the GCP Skills domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"memorystore config\" in your request\n- Ask about memorystore config patterns or best practices\n- Need help with google cloud platform skills covering compute, storage, bigquery, vertex ai, and gcp-specific services.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for memorystore config\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with memorystore config\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of gcp skills concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **GCP Skills** skill category.\nTags: gcp, bigquery, vertex-ai, cloud-run, firebase\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:36.239Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing automated Google Cloud Platform memorystore configuration management.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化Google Cloud Platform memorystore 配置管理的Cloud Agents。","ja":"Google Cloud Platform のmemorystore 構成管理の自動化が必要なCloud Agents に最適です。","ko":"Google Cloud Platform memorystore 구성 관리를 자동화해야 하는 Cloud Agents 에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Cloud que necesitan una configuración automatizada de memorystore de Google Cloud Platform.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud ayant besoin d''une configuration automatique de memorystore de Google Cloud Platform.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die eine automatisierte Konfiguration von Google Cloud Platform memorystore benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem que necessitam de configuração de gerenciamento de memorystore automatizada da Plataforma Google Cloud.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, которым требуется автоматизированное управление конфигурацией Google Cloud Platform memorystore.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة تكوين ذاكرة التخزين التلقائي من منصة جوجل سحابية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate memorystore config tasks using Google Cloud Platform services, providing step-by-step guidance for memorystore configuration and supporting compute, storage, BigQuery, Vertex AI, and GCP-specific services through memorystore config patterns and best practices.","zh":"赋予代理自动化memorystore 配置任务的能力，使用Google Cloud Platform 服务，提供memorystore 配置的逐步指南，并通过memorystore 配置模式和最佳实践支持计算、存储、BigQuery、Vertex AI 和GCP 特定服务。","ja":"エージェントにmemorystore 構成タスクの自動化を可能にし、Google Cloud Platform サービスを使用してmemorystore 構成のステップバイステップ ガイダンスを提供し、memorystore 構成パターンとベスト プラクティスを通じてコンピューティング、ストレージ、BigQuery、Vertex AI、GCP 特有のサービスをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 memorystore 구성 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 해주며, Google Cloud Platform 서비스를 사용하여 memorystore 구성에 대한 단계별 지침을 제공하고, memorystore 구성 패턴 및 최고의 실제를 통해 컴퓨팅, 스토리지, BigQuery, Vertex AI 및 GCP 특정 서비스를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas de configuración de memorystore utilizando servicios de Google Cloud Platform, proporcionando una guía paso a paso para la configuración de memorystore y soporte para servicios de computación, almacenamiento, BigQuery, Vertex AI y servicios específicos de GCP a través de patrones de configuración y mejores prácticas de memorystore.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tâches de configuration de memorystore en utilisant les services de Google Cloud Platform, fournissant une guidance étape par étape pour la configuration de memorystore et prenant en charge les services de calcul, de stockage, BigQuery, Vertex AI et les services spécifiques à GCP via des modèles de configuration et des meilleures pratiques de memorystore.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Aufgaben zur Konfiguration von memorystore mithilfe von Google Cloud Platform-Diensten zu automatisieren, indem Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitungen für die Konfiguration von memorystore und Unterstützung für Compute-, Storage-, BigQuery-, Vertex-AI- und GCP-spezifische Dienste über Konfigurationsmuster und Best Practices für memorystore bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar tarefas de configuração de memorystore usando serviços da Plataforma Google Cloud, fornecendo orientação passo a passo para configuração de memorystore e suportando computação, armazenamento, BigQuery, Vertex AI e serviços específicos do GCP por meio de padrões de configuração de memorystore e práticas recomendadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать задачи конфигурации memorystore с помощью сервисов Google Cloud Platform, предоставляя пошаговое руководство по конфигурации memorystore и поддержку вычислений, хранилища, BigQuery, Vertex AI и сервисов, специфичных для GCP, посредством шаблонов конфигурации memorystore и рекомендованных практик.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على 자동化 مهام تكوين ذاكرة التخزين باستخدام خدمات منصة جوجل سحابية، وتقديم إرشادات خطوة بخطوة لتكوين ذاكرة التخزين ودعم الحوسبة والتخزين وبيج كويري وفيرتكس أي والخدمات المحددة لجوجل سحابية من خلال أنماط تكوين ذاكرة التخزين وأفضل الممارسات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating memorystore config setup","Generating memorystore configuration templates","Debugging memorystore config issues"],"zh":["自动化memorystore 配置设置","生成memorystore 配置模板","调试memorystore 配置问题"],"ja":["memorystore 構成の設定の自動化","memorystore 構成テンプレートの生成","memorystore 構成の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["memorystore 구성 설정 자동화","memorystore 구성 템플릿 생성","memorystore 구성 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Configuración automática de la instalación de memorystore","Generación de plantillas de configuración de memorystore","Depuración de problemas de configuración de memorystore"],"fr":["Configuration automatique de l''installation de memorystore","Génération de modèles de configuration de memorystore","Débogage des problèmes de configuration de memorystore"],"de":["Automatisierte Einrichtung von memorystore","Generierung von Vorlagen für die Konfiguration von memorystore","Fehlerbehebung bei Konfigurationsproblemen von memorystore"],"pt":["Configuração automática de setup de memorystore","Geração de modelos de configuração de memorystore","Depuração de problemas de configuração de memorystore"],"ru":["Автоматическая настройка конфигурации memorystore","Генерация шаблонов конфигурации memorystore","Отладка проблем конфигурации memorystore"],"ar":["تكوين تلقائي لإعداد ذاكرة التخزين","توليد قوالب تكوين ذاكرة التخزين","تصحيح أخطاء تكوين ذاكرة التخزين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google Cloud Platform account access","Limited to Google Cloud Platform services"],"zh":["需要Google Cloud Platform 账户访问权限","仅限Google Cloud Platform 服务"],"ja":["Google Cloud Platform アカウントへのアクセスが必要","Google Cloud Platform サービスに限定される"],"ko":["Google Cloud Platform 계정 접근 권한 필요","Google Cloud Platform 서비스에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a una cuenta de Google Cloud Platform","Limitado a los servicios de Google Cloud Platform"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à un compte Google Cloud Platform","Limité aux services de Google Cloud Platform"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf ein Google Cloud Platform-Konto","Begrenzt auf Google Cloud Platform-Dienste"],"pt":["Requer acesso à conta da Plataforma Google Cloud","Limitado aos serviços da Plataforma Google Cloud"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к учетной записи Google Cloud Platform","Ограничен сервисами Google Cloud Platform"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى حساب منصة جوجل سحابية","محدود بخدمات منصة جوجل سحابية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5e50336ea58cc30385cad5dc0a82f0d3e4ebeeeced24c7d62e7b26e75b6aa35c","qualityScore":49}');
