AI CCPI包管理器 Jupyter Notebook Provides step-by-step guidance for memorystore config Supports production orchestration patterns Includes interactive tutorials with 11 Jupyter notebooks Utilizes the CCPI package manager Offers assistance with Google Cloud Platform skills, including Vertex AI memorystore-config is a skill that offers automated assistance for memorystore configuration tasks, supporting GCP services like compute, storage, and BigQuery.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lawvable/awesome-legal-skills/statute-analysis-rafal-fryc', 'community', 'lawvable', 'awesome-legal-skills', 'lawvable/awesome-legal-skills', 'statute-analysis-rafal-fryc', 0, 0, 49, '2026-03-08T01:57:15.277Z', '2026-03-08T02:00:45.842Z', '9c30fd8ba1c10c2b7ccb70e9e4cbebc1a7ba545b307c71a8d84300b3b32bc322', '{"id":"lawvable/awesome-legal-skills/statute-analysis-rafal-fryc","name":"statute-analysis-rafal-fryc","description":{"en":"The statute-analysis-rafal-fryc skill provides a curated list of awesome Agent Skills for automating legal work, helping developers and legal professionals understand legislative intent and apply statutes to specific legal situations.","zh":"statute-analysis-rafal-fryc技能提供了法律文本分析的技术指南，包括法令解释方法和立法意图","ja":"statute-analysis-rafal-frycスキルは、法令解釈と立法意図のための技術ガイドを提供します","ko":"statute-analysis-rafal-fryc 기술은 법률 규정 분석을 위한 기술 가이드를 제공하며, 법령 해석 방법과 입법 의도를 포함합니다","es":"El análisis de estatutos es una habilidad de agente de IA que ayuda a interpretar y aplicar leyes y regulaciones","fr":"L''analyse de statuts est une compétence d''agent IA qui aide à interpréter et à appliquer les lois et les réglementations","de":"Die Gesetzesanalyse ist eine Fähigkeit des KI-Agents, die dabei hilft, Gesetze und Vorschriften zu interpretieren und anzuwenden","pt":"O statute-analysis-rafal-fryc é uma habilidade de agente que fornece métodos de interpretação estatutária e canons de construção para automatizar o trabalho legal.","ru":"Статут-анализ-рафал-фрайц - это навык агента, который предоставляет методы статутной интерпретации и каноны конструкции для автоматизации юридической работы на основе ИИ Агентов.","ar":"مهارة الوكيل statue-analysis-rafal-fryc توفر أساليب تفسير المراسيم وقواعد البناء لتوفير الوقت في العمل القانوني باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"seo":{"title":{"en":"statute-analysis-rafal-fryc: Stat