s a skill that enables statutory interpretation and analysis for automating legal work, covering methods and canons of construction, legislative intent, and cross-jurisdictional compliance analysis.","zh":"statute-analysis-rafal-fryc是指使用AI技术分析法律文本的过程","ja":"statute-analysis-rafal-frycは、AIエージェントを使用して法令解釈を行う技術です","ko":"statute-analysis-rafal-fryc는 AI 기술을 사용하여 법률 규정 분석을 수행하는 기술입니다","es":"Análisis de estatutos es el proceso de interpretación y aplicación de leyes y regulaciones","fr":"L''analyse de statuts est le processus d''interprétation et d''application des lois et réglementations","de":"Gesetzesanalyse ist der Prozess der Auslegung und Anwendung von Gesetzen und Vorschriften","pt":"O statute-analysis-rafal-fryc é uma habilidade de agente que ajuda a interpretar estatutos e regulamentos.","ru":"Статут-анализ-рафал-фрайц - это навык агента, который помогает интерпретировать статуты и регламенты на основе ИИ Агентов.","ar":"مهارة الوكيل statue-analysis-rafal-fryc هي قدرة على تفسير المراسيم واللوائح باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"features":{"en":["Provides guidance on how to read and interpret statutes, regulations, or rules","Supports statutory interpretation methods and canons of construction","Enables understanding of legislative intent and application of statutes to specific legal situations","Extracts requirements from legal text and distinguishes between different types of legal requirements","Performs cross-jurisdictional compliance analysis"],"zh":["法令解释方法","立法意图分析","跨司法管辖区合规分析","法令文本提取","不同类型法律要求的区分"],"ja":["法令解釈方法","立法意図分析","クロスジャスティス分析","法令文書の抽出","さまざまなタイプの法的要件の区別"],"ko":["법령 해석 방법","입법 의도 분석","교차 사법 구역 분석","법률 규정 추출","다양한 유형의 법적 요구 사항의 구분"],"es":["Interpretación de estatutos y regulaciones","Métodos de interpretación y cánones de construcción","Análisis de intención legislativa","Aplicación de estatutos a situaciones legales específicas","Extracción de requisitos de texto legal","Análisis de cumplimiento transjurisdiccional"],"fr":["Interprétation de statuts et réglementations","Méthodes d''interprétation et canons de construction","Analyse de l''intention législative","Application des statuts à des situations juridiques spécifiques","Extraction de exigences de texte juridique","Analyse de conformité transjuridictionnelle"],"de":["Auslegung von Gesetzen und Vorschriften","Auslegungsmethoden und Konstruktionskanons","Analyse der gesetzgebenden Absicht","Anwendung von Gesetzen auf spezifische Rechtslagen","Extraktion von Anforderungen aus rechtlichem Text","Analyse der transjurisdiktionellen Konformität"],"pt":["Métodos de interpretação estatutária","Canons de construção","Análise de intenção legislativa","Aplicação de estatutos a situações legais específicas","Extração de requisitos de texto legal","Análise de conformidade cross-jurisdicional"],"ru":["Методы статутной интерпретации","Каноны конструкции","Анализ законодательного намерения","Применение статутов к конкретным юридическим ситуациям","Извлечение требований из юридического текста","Анализ соответствия на основе ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["أساليب تفسير المراسيم","قواعد البناء","تحليل النية التشريعية","تطبيق المراسيم على مواقف قانونية محددة","استخراج المتطلبات من النص القانوني","تحليل مطابقة القوانين باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use statute-analysis-rafal-fryc","statute-analysis-rafal-fryc alternative","statute-analysis-rafal-fryc install","what is statute-analysis-rafal-fryc","statute-analysis-rafal-fryc vs competitor","statute-analysis-rafal-fryc setup guide"],"zh":["法令解释","法律文本分析","AI技术","法规分析","立法意图","跨司法管辖区合规","法令文本提取","法规解释"],"ja":["法令解釈","法令文書分析","AIエージェント","法規分析","立法意図","クロスジャスティス","法令文書の抽出","法規解釈"],"ko":["법령 해석","법률 규정 분석","AI 기술","법규 분석","입법 의도","교차 사법 구역","법률 규정 추출","법규 해석"],"es":["análisis de estatutos","herramientas de agente de IA","interpretación de leyes","regulaciones","intención legislativa","cumplimiento transjurisdiccional","automatización de trabajo legal"],"fr":["analyse de statuts","outils d''agent IA","interprétation de lois","réglementations","intention législative","conformité transjuridictionnelle","automatisation de travail juridique"],"de":["Gesetzesanalyse","KI-Agenten-Tools","Auslegung von Gesetzen","Vorschriften","gesetzgebende Absicht","transjurisdiktionelle Konformität","Automatisierung von juristischer Arbeit"],"pt":["análise de estatutos","interpretação estatutária","canons de construção","intenção legislativa","aplicação de estatutos","extração de requisitos","conformidade cross-jurisdicional","automatização do trabalho legal"],"ru":["анализ статутов","статутная интерпретация","каноны конструкции","законодательное намерение","применение статутов","извлечение требований","соответствие на основе ИИ Агентов","автоматизация юридической работы"],"ar":["تحليل المراسيم","تفسير المراسيم","قواعد البناء","النية التشريعية","تطبيق المراسيم","استخراج المتطلبات","مطابقة القوانين باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","توفير الوقت في العمل القانوني"]}},"owner":"lawvable","repo":"awesome-legal-skills","repoPath":"lawvable/awesome-legal-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.277Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"statute-analysis-rafal-fryc","description":"Guide for reading, interpreting, and applying statutes, regulations, and rules in legal and compliance contexts. Use when the user asks about (1) how to read and interpret statutes, regulations, or rules, (2) statutory interpretation methods and canons of construction, (3) understanding legislative intent, (4) applying statutes to specific legal situations, (5) extracting requirements from legal text, (6) distinguishing between different types of legal requirements, or (7) cross-jurisdictional compliance analysis.","version":"2026.01.14","bodyPreview":"# Statutory Interpretation Guide\r\n\r\n## When to Use This Skill\r\n\r\nUse this skill when the user asks about:\r\n- How to read and interpret statutes, regulations, or rules\r\n- Statutory interpretation methods and canons of construction\r\n- Understanding legislative intent\r\n- Applying statutes to specific legal situations\r\n- Extracting requirements from legal text\r\n- Distinguishing between different types of legal requirements\r\n- Cross-jurisdictional compliance analysis\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Understanding the Le","body":"# Statutory Interpretation Guide\r\n\r\n## When to Use This Skill\r\n\r\nUse this skill when the user asks about:\r\n- How to read and interpret statutes, regulations, or rules\r\n- Statutory interpretation methods and canons of construction\r\n- Understanding legislative intent\r\n- Applying statutes to specific legal situations\r\n- Extracting requirements from legal text\r\n- Distinguishing between different types of legal requirements\r\n- Cross-jurisdictional compliance analysis\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Understanding the Legal Hierarchy\r\n\r\n### Statutes vs. Regulations vs. Rules\r\n\r\n| Type | Created By | Characteristics |\r\n|------|------------|-----------------|\r\n| **Statute** | Legislature (Congress, state legislature) | Formal written enactment; commands, prohibits, or declares policy; provides framework |\r\n| **Regulation** | Government agency | Implements statutes; more detailed than statutes; has force of law |\r\n| **Rule** | Government agency or court | Another term for regulation (administrative rules) or procedural requirements |\r\n\r\n**Key Insight:** Statutes give agencies authority to create regulations. Always read BOTH the statute AND implementing regulations for complete understanding. The regulation often contains the operational details that the statute leaves to agency discretion.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Before Reading: Preliminary Steps\r\n\r\n### 1. Verify Currency and Status\r\n\r\nBefore analyzing any statute:\r\n- [ ] Check the effective date (may be future)\r\n- [ ] Determine if amendments are pending\r\n- [ ] Find the consolidated/codified version\r\n- [ ] Identify implementing regulations\r\n- [ ] Check for court decisions interpreting the statute\r\n- [ ] Note multiple effective dates for different provisions\r\n\r\n**Lesson:** The statute as passed may not be the statute as implemented. A statute with a future effective date may be amended before taking effect.\r\n\r\n### 2. Understand the Regulatory Ecosystem\r\n\r\n- [ ] Identify the enforcement agency\r\n- [ ] Research the agency''s enforcement history\r\n- [ ] Check for guidance documents, FAQs, or informal interpretations\r\n- [ ] Determine if the agency is known for aggressive or permissive enforcement\r\n\r\n**Lesson:** The same statutory language can mean different things depending on who enforces it.\r\n\r\n### 3. Browse the Structure First\r\n\r\nState statutes are organized by topic and subtopic. Before diving into specific sections:\r\n- Browse the index or table of contents\r\n- Understand how your issue fits in the larger whole\r\n- Note the overall organizational pattern\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Reading the Statute: Core Techniques\r\n\r\n### Start with Definitions\r\n\r\n**Every word has meaning.** Find the definitions section first and reference it constantly.\r\n\r\n- Terms may have specific statutory meanings that differ from common usage\r\n- Definitions may incorporate external standards by reference\r\n- Some definitions depend on other definitions (creating interconnected webs)\r\n- Watch for whether definitions are exhaustive (\"means\") or illustrative (\"includes\")\r\n\r\n**Practical Tip:** Create a reference sheet of key definitions before analyzing substantive provisions.\r\n\r\n### Read Slowly and Carefully\r\n\r\nStatutes are dense. Every word AND punctuation mark has meaning.\r\n- Read each sentence multiple times\r\n- Parse complex sentences into their component parts\r\n- Don''t skim—statutory language rewards close attention\r\n\r\n### The Operator Words\r\n\r\nThese words have consistent legal functions across all statutes:\r\n\r\n| Term | Meaning |\r\n|------|---------|\r\n| **Shall** | Mandatory—you are REQUIRED to do this |\r\n| **May** | Permissive—you are ALLOWED to do this |\r\n| **And** | Conjunctive—ALL elements must be satisfied |\r\n| **Or** | Disjunctive—ANY ONE element is sufficient |\r\n| **Unless / Except** | Signals an exception to the general rule |\r\n| **Subject to** | This provision is limited by another section |\r\n| **Notwithstanding** | This provision applies DESPITE what other sections say |\r\n| **If...then / Upon / Provided that** | A precondition must be satisfied |\r\n| **Means** | Exhaustive definition follows |\r\n| **Includes** | Examples follow (may not be exhaustive) |\r\n\r\n**Critical Warning:** Misreading \"and\" as \"or\" or \"shall\" as \"may\" fundamentally changes a provision''s meaning.\r\n\r\n### Track Cross-References\r\n\r\nWhen you encounter references to other statutes or sections:\r\n- Stop and read those referenced provisions\r\n- They may expand, limit, or modify the provision you''re analyzing\r\n- Build a map of how sections relate to each other\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Tools of Statutory Interpretation\r\n\r\nWhen language is ambiguous, use these established methods:\r\n\r\n### A. The Text Itself\r\n\r\n**Plain Meaning Rule:** Courts assume words mean what an ordinary person would understand. If clear and unambiguous, no further inquiry is needed.\r\n\r\n**Dictionary Definitions:** Compare multiple dictionaries for consensus. Use legal dictionaries for technical terms, general dictionaries for common terms.\r\n\r\n### B. Canons of Construction\r\n\r\n**Textual Canons:**\r\n\r\n| Canon | Meaning |\r\n|-------|---------|\r\n| **General-Terms Canon** | General terms get their full scope without arbitrary limitation |\r\n| **Negative-Implication Canon** (Expressio Unius) | Expressing one thing implies exclusion of others |\r\n| **Whole-Act Rule** | Construe the text as a coherent whole |\r\n| **Consistent Usage Presumption** | Same word used repeatedly has the same meaning |\r\n| **Meaningful Variation** | Different terms presumably have different meanings |\r\n| **Surplusage Canon** | Every word should have meaning; avoid rendering words superfluous |\r\n| **Associated Words Canon** (Noscitur a Sociis) | Words grouped together inform each other''s meaning |\r\n| **Ejusdem Generis** | General terms following specific ones are limited to the same class |\r\n\r\n**Purpose Canons:**\r\n\r\n| Canon | Application |\r\n|-------|-------------|\r\n| **Presumption Against Ineffectiveness** | Favor interpretations that further the statute''s purpose |\r\n| **Avoiding Absurdity** | Reject interpretations producing absurd results |\r\n| **Remedial Statutes** | Liberally construe to achieve remedial purpose |\r\n| **Rule of Lenity** | Penal statutes strictly construed in favor of defendant |\r\n\r\n### C. Legal Interpretations\r\n\r\n- **Case Law:** Court decisions interpreting the statute\r\n- **Agency Regulations:** Implementing rules (courts grant deference)\r\n- **Agency Guidance:** FAQs, guidance documents, enforcement actions\r\n- **Legislative History:** Committee reports, floor debates, sponsor statements\r\n\r\n### D. Purpose and Context\r\n\r\n- **Preamble/Purpose Clauses:** Often state legislative intent explicitly\r\n- **Findings Sections:** Explain the problem the statute addresses\r\n- **Structural Context:** How the provision fits in the overall scheme\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Distinguishing Requirement Types\r\n\r\nWhen extracting requirements, categorize by type:\r\n\r\n| Type | Examples | Implementation |\r\n|------|----------|----------------|\r\n| **Disclosure** | Privacy notices, warning labels, terms | Legal/policy team; document publication |\r\n| **Operational** | Response deadlines, internal processes | Compliance team; process design |\r\n| **Technical** | System requirements, security standards | Engineering team |\r\n| **UI/Design** | Link placement, font size, button design | Product/design team |\r\n\r\n**Key Insight:** A \"privacy policy requirements\" checklist should not include operational deadlines that never appear in the policy itself. Separate WHAT must be disclosed from HOW the business must operate.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Handling Exemptions\r\n\r\n### Entity vs. Data Exemptions\r\n\r\n- **Entity exemptions:** The entire organization is exempt\r\n- **Data exemptions:** Only certain data types are exempt; comply for non-exempt data\r\n\r\n### Federal Preemption\r\n\r\nMost state statutes defer to federal sector-specific laws:\r\n- HIPAA (health), GLBA (financial), FCRA (credit), FERPA (education), etc.\r\n\r\n### Delayed Application vs. Exemption\r\n\r\nSome entities have delayed compliance deadlines rather than permanent exemptions. Track WHEN the grace period ends.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Applicability Analysis\r\n\r\nBefore extracting requirements, determine WHO must comply:\r\n\r\n### Common Threshold Types\r\n\r\n| Type | Examples |\r\n|------|----------|\r\n| **Revenue** | Annual gross revenue > $X million |\r\n| **Volume** | Process data of > X consumers/transactions |\r\n| **Revenue from Activity** | Derive X% of revenue from [regulated activity] |\r\n| **Entity Type** | Applies to [developers/controllers/operators] |\r\n\r\n### Conjunctive vs. Disjunctive Thresholds\r\n\r\n- **OR (Disjunctive):** Meet ANY threshold = covered\r\n- **AND (Conjunctive):** Must meet ALL thresholds = covered\r\n\r\n**Lesson:** A statute requiring \"$25M revenue AND 100K consumers\" is far more limited than one requiring either condition.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Cross-Jurisdictional Analysis\r\n\r\nWhen analyzing multiple related statutes:\r\n\r\n### Look for Patterns\r\n\r\n- \"Consumer-protective\" vs. \"business-friendly\" orientations\r\n- Common provisions vs. unique outliers\r\n- Standard vs. unusual thresholds\r\n- Model laws that others follow\r\n\r\n### Watch for Variations\r\n\r\n- Rights may differ (some jurisdictions omit \"standard\" rights)\r\n- Definitions vary (especially \"sale,\" \"sensitive data,\" thresholds)\r\n- Age-based protections use different cutoffs\r\n- Enforcement mechanisms differ significantly\r\n\r\n**Practical Approach:** Identify the most protective standard as a baseline; note where others are more permissive.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Enforcement Analysis\r\n\r\n### Factors Affecting Practical Priority\r\n\r\n| Factor | Questions to Ask |\r\n|--------|------------------|\r\n| **Enforcement Authority** | Who can enforce? AG only? Private parties? Agency? |\r\n| **Penalties** | Civil, criminal, or administrative? Amount? |\r\n| **Cure Period** | Opportunity to fix before penalties? |\r\n| **Private Right of Action** | Can individuals sue? |\r\n| **Enforcement History** | Is the agency actively enforcing? |\r\n\r\n**Lesson:** Two requirements with identical language may have vastly different practical importance depending on enforcement dynamics.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## What the Statute Doesn''t Say\r\n\r\nCompare against typical provisions to identify notable absences:\r\n\r\n- [ ] Is there a private right of action? (If not, note explicitly)\r\n- [ ] Are there safe harbors?\r\n- [ ] Are definitions exhaustive or illustrative?\r\n- [ ] What is left to regulatory discretion?\r\n- [ ] What common provisions are notably absent?\r\n\r\n**Lesson:** The absence of a remedy or protection is often as significant as what is included.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Consistency and Common Sense\r\n\r\nKeep these principles in mind:\r\n\r\n1. **Internal Consistency:** Statutes are written to be consistent, not contradictory. If your interpretation creates a conflict, reconsider.\r\n\r\n2. **Avoiding Absurdity:** Statutes are written to make sense. If your interpretation leads to an absurd result, it''s probably wrong.\r\n\r\n3. **Purposive Reading:** Consider what problem the legislature was trying to solve. Interpretations that further that purpose are preferred.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Quick Reference Checklist\r\n\r\n### Before Reading\r\n- [ ] Current version verified?\r\n- [ ] Effective date noted?\r\n- [ ] Amendments checked?\r\n- [ ] Implementing regulations identified?\r\n- [ ] Enforcement agency identified?\r\n\r\n### During Reading\r\n- [ ] Definitions section located and referenced?\r\n- [ ] Applicability thresholds identified?\r\n- [ ] Cross-references tracked?\r\n- [ ] Operator words (shall/may, and/or) parsed carefully?\r\n- [ ] Exemptions identified and categorized?\r\n\r\n### After Reading\r\n- [ ] Requirements categorized by type?\r\n- [ ] Ambiguous terms flagged?\r\n- [ ] Enforcement mechanisms analyzed?\r\n- [ ] Time-based requirements extracted?\r\n- [ ] Notable absences documented?\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Navigation\r\n\r\nSee `references/index.md` for detailed documentation including:\r\n- Comprehensive canons of construction with examples\r\n- Practical lessons from multi-statute analysis\r\n- Detailed checklists and reference tables\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:45.842Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Legal Analysis Agents needing advanced statutory interpretation and legislative intent understanding capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级法律解释和立法意图理解能力的法律分析代理","ja":"高度な法的解釈と立法意図の理解能力が必要な法的分析エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 법률 해석 및 입법 의도 이해 능력이 필요한 법률 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Jurídico que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de interpretación estatutaria y comprensión de la intención legislativa.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse juridique ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''interprétation statutaire et de compréhension de l''intention législative.","de":"Perfekt für Rechtsanalyseagenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Auslegung von Gesetzen und zum Verständnis der gesetzgebenden Absicht benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Jurídica que necessitam de interpretação estatutária avançada e capacidades de compreensão de intenção legislativa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов юридического анализа, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности интерпретации статутов и понимания законодательной интерпретации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء القانونيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تفسير تشريعي متقدم وقدرات فهم النية التشريعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply statutes to specific legal situations, extract requirements from legal text, and perform cross-jurisdictional compliance analysis using statutory interpretation methods and canons of construction, such as understanding legislative intent and distinguishing between different types of legal requirements.","zh":"使代理能够将法令应用于特定的法律情况，提取法律文本中的要求，并使用法令解释方法和建设规范进行跨司法管辖区的合规性分析，例如理解立法意图和区分不同类型的法律要求","ja":"代理が法令を特定の法的状況に適用し、法的テキストから要件を抽出し、立法意図の理解や法的要件の違いを識別するなどの法令解釈方法や建設規範を使用して、跨司法管轄区域のコンプライアンス分析を実行できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 법령을 특정 법적 상황에 적용하고 법적 텍스트에서 요구 사항을 추출하며 법령 해석 방법과 건설 규범을 사용하여 입법 의도와 다른 유형의 법적 요구 사항을 구분하는 등 크로스 저지션 컴플라이언스 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar estatutos a situaciones legales específicas, extraer requisitos de textos legales y realizar análisis de cumplimiento entre jurisdicciones utilizando métodos de interpretación estatutaria y cánones de construcción, como la comprensión de la intención legislativa y la distinción entre diferentes tipos de requisitos legales.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les statuts à des situations juridiques spécifiques, d''extraire les exigences des textes juridiques et de réaliser une analyse de conformité transfrontalière en utilisant des méthodes d''interprétation statutaire et des canons de construction, tels que la compréhension de l''intention législative et la distinction entre les différents types d''exigences juridiques.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Gesetze auf spezifische Rechtssituationen anzuwenden, Anforderungen aus Rechtstexten zu extrahieren und eine konformitätsübergreifende Analyse unter Verwendung von Auslegungsmethoden für Gesetze und Konstruktionskanonen durchzuführen, wie z.B. das Verständnis der gesetzgebenden Absicht und die Unterscheidung zwischen verschiedenen Arten von Rechtsanforderungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar estatutos a situações jurídicas específicas, extrair requisitos de texto jurídico e realizar análise de conformidade interestadual usando métodos de interpretação estatutária e cânones de construção, como compreender a intenção legislativa e distinguir entre diferentes tipos de requisitos jurídicos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять статуты к конкретным юридическим ситуациям, извлекать требования из юридического текста и проводить анализ соблюдения законодательства в разных юрисдикциях с использованием методов интерпретации статутов и канонов толкования, таких как понимание законодательной интерпретации и различение между различными видами юридических требований.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطبيق التشريعات على مواقف قانونية محددة، واستخراج المتطلبات من النص القانوني، وإجراء تحليل الامتثال عبر الولايات باستخدام أساليب التفسير التشريعي وقواعد البناء، مثل فهم النية التشريعية والتمييز بين أنواع متعددة من المتطلبات القانونية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating statutory interpretation for legal professionals","Generating compliance reports for cross-jurisdictional analysis","Extracting requirements from legal text for regulatory adherence"],"zh":["为法律专业人员自动化法令解释","为跨司法管辖区分析生成合规报告","从法律文本中提取要求以遵守法规"],"ja":["法的専門家のための法令解釈の自動化","跨司法管轄区域分析のためのコンプライアンスレポートの生成","法規制遵守のための法的テキストからの要件の抽出"],"ko":["법률 전문가들을 위한 법령 해석 자동화","크로스 저지션 분석을 위한 컴플라이언스 리포트 생성","규제 준수를 위한 법적 텍스트로부터 요구 사항 추출"],"es":["Automatización de la interpretación estatutaria para profesionales del derecho","Generación de informes de cumplimiento para análisis transfronterizo","Extracción de requisitos de textos legales para adherencia regulatoria"],"fr":["Automation de l''interprétation statutaire pour les professionnels du droit","Génération de rapports de conformité pour l''analyse transfrontalière","Extraction des exigences des textes juridiques pour la conformité réglementaire"],"de":["Automatisierung der Auslegung von Gesetzen für Rechtsfachleute","Erstellung von Konformitätsberichten für übergreifende Analysen","Extraktion von Anforderungen aus Rechtstexten für regulatorische Einhaltung"],"pt":["Automating statutory interpretation for legal professionals","Gerando relatórios de conformidade para análise interestadual","Extraindo requisitos de texto jurídico para aderência regulatória"],"ru":["Автоматизация интерпретации статутов для юридических специалистов","Генерация отчетов о соблюдении законодательства для анализа в разных юрисдикциях","Извлечение требований из юридического текста для соблюдения нормативных требований"],"ar":["توفير التفسير التشريعي للوكلاء القانونيين","إعداد تقارير الامتثال للتحليل عبر الولايات","استخراج المتطلبات من النص القانوني للامتثال التنظيمي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive legal text database access","Limited to jurisdictions with accessible statutory data","May require additional legal expertise for complex interpretations"],"zh":["需要全面性的法律文本数据库访问","仅限于具有可访问的法令数据的司法管辖区","可能需要额外的法律专业知识以进行复杂的解释"],"ja":["包括的な法的テキストデータベースへのアクセスが必要","アクセス可能な法令データを持つ司法管轄区域に限定される","複雑な解釈には追加の法的専門知識が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["포괄적인 법적 텍스트 데이터베이스 액세스가 필요","액세스 가능한 법령 데이터를 가진 사법 관할 区域에 제한됨","복잡한 해석에는 추가적인 법적 전문 지식이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a una base de datos de textos legales integral","Limitado a jurisdicciones con datos estatutarios accesibles","Puede requerir experiencia jurídica adicional para interpretaciones complejas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à une base de données de textes juridiques complète","Limité aux juridictions avec des données statutaires accessibles","Peut nécessiter une expertise juridique supplémentaire pour des interprétations complexes"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf eine umfassende Datenbank von Rechtstexten","Begrenzt auf Rechtsordnungen mit zugänglichen Gesetzesdaten","Kann zusätzliche juristische Fachkenntnisse für komplexe Auslegungen erfordern"],"pt":["Requer acesso abrangente a base de dados de texto jurídico","Limitado a jurisdições com dados estatutários acessíveis","Pode requerer conhecimento jurídico adicional para interpretações complexas"],"ru":["Требует всестороннего доступа к базе данных юридического текста","Ограничен юрисдикциями с доступными статутными данными","Может потребовать дополнительную юридическую экспертизу для сложных интерпретаций"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول الشامل إلى قاعدة بيانات النص القانوني","محدود بالولايات القضائية التي تتوفر فيها بيانات تشريعية قابلة للوصول","يمكن أن يتطلب خبرة قانونية إضافية لتفسيرات معقدة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"9c30fd8ba1c10c2b7ccb70e9e4cbebc1a7ba545b307c71a8d84300b3b32bc322","qualityScore":49}');
