INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('danilonovaisv/PORTFOLIO-DANILO-FINAL/frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan', 'frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan', 'danilonovaisv', 'PORTFOLIO-DANILO-FINAL', 'community', 'frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan danilonovaisv PORTFOLIO-DANILO-FINAL community The frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan skill analyzes frontend code to identify XSS vulnerabilities, benefiting developers working with React, Vue, Angular, and vanilla JavaScript. 本工具提供前端移动安全XSS漏洞扫描功能，支持React、Vue、Angular和JavaScript代码 このツールはフロントエンドモバイルセキュリティのXSS脆弱性をスキャンし、React、Vue、Angular、JavaScriptコードをサポートします 이 도구는 프론트엔드 모바일 보안 XSS 취약점을 스캔하고 React, Vue, Angular, JavaScript 코드를 지원합니다 El escáner de vulnerabilidades XSS para frontend es una herramienta que analiza código React, Vue, Angular y JavaScript para detectar puntos de inyección y manipulación de DOM no seguros. L''outil de détection de vulnérabilités XSS pour frontend est un outil qui analyse le code React, Vue, Angular et JavaScript pour détecter les points d''injection et la manipulation de DOM non sécurisés. Der XSS-Schwachstellen-Scanner für Frontend ist ein Tool, das React-, Vue-, Angular- und JavaScript-Code analysiert, um unsichere Injection-Punkte und DOM-Manipulationen zu erkennen. Escaneie seu código frontend para detectar vulnerabilidades de XSS em React, Vue, Angular e JavaScript puro Сканируйте свой фронтенд-код для обнаружения уязвимостей XSS в React, Vue, Angular и чистом JavaScript افحص رمز الجبهة الخاص بك لاكتشاف الثغرات XSS في React و Vue و Angular و JavaScript النقي how to use frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan alternative xss vulnerability scanner for frontend code frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan setup guide what is frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan vs other scanners install frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan for React developers frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan for Angular developers frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan for Vue developers 前端移动安全 XSS扫描 AIエージェント React安全 Vue安全 Angular安全 JavaScript安全 XSS防止 前端安全最佳实践 Analyzes React, Vue, Angular, and vanilla JavaScript code for XSS vulnerabilities Identifies injection points and unsafe DOM manipulation Detects improper sanitization in frontend code Provides guidance on best practices for XSS vulnerability prevention Supports workflow tasks related to XSS vulnerability scanning frontend-mobile-security-xss-scan is a skill that detects and prevents Cross-Site Scripting vulnerabilities in frontend code, focusing on injection points and improper sanitization.');
