a":"Flutter Expert は、Flutter 3 と Dart を使用して高性能のクロスプラットフォームアプリを開発する技術専門家です","ko":"Flutter Expert는 Flutter 3와 Dart를 사용하여 고성능 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 개발하는 기술 전문가입니다","es":"Flutter Expert es un especialista en desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles cross-plataforma con Flutter 3 y Dart.","fr":"Flutter Expert est un spécialiste du développement d''applications mobiles multi-plateformes avec Flutter 3 et Dart.","de":"Flutter Expert ist ein Spezialist für die Entwicklung cross-plattformiger mobiler Anwendungen mit Flutter 3 und Dart.","pt":"O que é um Flutter Expert? É um especialista em desenvolvimento móvel que utiliza Flutter 3 e Dart para criar aplicações cross-platform de alto desempenho.","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент Flutter Expert? Это специалист по мобильной разработке, использующий Flutter 3 и Dart для создания высокопроизводительных кросс-платформенных приложений.","ar":"ما هو خبير Flutter؟ هو خبير في التنمية المتنقلة الذي يستخدم Flutter 3 و Dart لإنشاء تطبيقات متعددة المنصات عالية الأداء."},"features":{"en":["Builds cross-platform Flutter applications for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop","Implements state management using Riverpod 2.0","Utilizes GoRouter for efficient routing","Writes performant and maintainable Dart code","Supports Flutter 3.19+ for latest features and updates","Enables proper state management for scalable app development"],"zh":["使用 Flutter 3 和 Dart 构建高性能跨平台应用","支持状态管理，包括 Riverpod 2.0","支持路由，包括 GoRouter","构建适用于 iOS、Android、Web 和 Desktop 的应用","编写高性能和可维护的 Dart 代码"],"ja":["Flutter 3 と Dart を使用して高性能のクロスプラットフォームアプリを開発","状態管理をサポート、Riverpod 2.0 を含む","ルーティングをサポート、GoRouter を含む","iOS、Android、Web、Desktop 向けのアプリを開発","高性能でメンテナンス性の高い Dart コードを書く"],"ko":["Flutter 3와 Dart를 사용하여 고성능 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 개발","상태 관리를 지원, Riverpod 2.0을 포함","라우팅을 지원, GoRouter를 포함","iOS, Android, Web, Desktop向け의 애플리케이션을 개발","고성능이고 유지 보수가 쉬운 Dart 코드를 작성"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones cross-plataforma con Flutter 3","Uso de Riverpod 2.0 para la gestión de estado","Implementación de GoRouter para la navegación","Desarrollo de aplicaciones para iOS, Android, Web y Desktop","Código Dart performante y mantenible"],"fr":["Développement d''applications multi-plateformes avec Flutter 3","Utilisation de Riverpod 2.0 pour la gestion d''état","Mise en œuvre de GoRouter pour la navigation","Développement d''applications pour iOS, Android, Web et Desktop","Code Dart performant et maintenable"],"de":["Entwicklung cross-plattformiger Anwendungen mit Flutter 3","Verwendung von Riverpod 2.0 für die Zustandsverwaltung","Implementierung von GoRouter für die Navigation","Entwicklung von Anwendungen für iOS, Android, Web und Desktop","Performanter und wartbarer Dart-Code"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações móveis cross-platform com Flutter 3","Utilização de Riverpod 2.0 para gerenciamento de estado","Implementação de GoRouter para navegação","Criação de aplicações para iOS, Android, Web e Desktop","Escrita de código Dart performático e mantenedor","Gerenciamento de estado com Riverpod"],"ru":["Разработка кросс-платформенных мобильных приложений с Flutter 3","Использование Riverpod 2.0 для управления состоянием","Реализация GoRouter для навигации","Создание приложений для iOS, Android, Web и Desktop","Написание производительного и поддерживаемого кода Dart","Управление состоянием с Riverpod"],"ar":["إنشاء تطبيقات متنقلة متعددة المنصات مع Flutter 3","استخدام Riverpod 2.0 لإدارة الحالة","تنفيذ GoRouter للتنقل","إنشاء تطبيقات لمنصات iOS و Android و Web و Desktop","كتابة код Dart عالي الأداء و قابل للصيانة","إدارة الحالة مع Riverpod"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use flutter-expert","flutter-expert alternative","flutter-expert setup guide","what is flutter-expert","flutter-expert vs React Native","flutter-expert install","flutter-expert for iOS development","flutter-expert for Android development","flutter-expert with Riverpod 2.0","flutter-expert with GoRouter"],"zh":["Flutter Expert","跨平台应用开发","Flutter 3","Dart","状态管理","Riverpod 2.0","路由","GoRouter","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"ja":["Flutter Expert","クロスプラットフォームアプリ開発","Flutter 3","Dart","状態管理","Riverpod 2.0","ルーティング","GoRouter","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop","AI エージェント"],"ko":["Flutter Expert","크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션 개발","Flutter 3","Dart","상태 관리","Riverpod 2.0","라우팅","GoRouter","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop","AI 에이전트"],"es":["Flutter Expert","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","cross-plataforma","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"fr":["Flutter Expert","développement d''applications mobiles","multi-plateformes","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"de":["Flutter Expert","Entwicklung mobiler Anwendungen","cross-plattform","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","iOS","Android","Web","Desktop"],"pt":["flutter expert","desenvolvimento móvel","aplicações cross-platform","Flutter 3","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","gerenciamento de estado","desenvolvimento de aplicações móveis"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Flutter Expert","мобильная разработка","кросс-платформенные приложения","Flutter 3","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","управление состоянием","разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["خبير Flutter","التنمية المتنقلة","تطبيقات متعددة المنصات","Flutter 3","Dart","Riverpod 2.0","GoRouter","إدارة الحالة","التنمية التطبيقية المتنقلة"]}},"owner":"tutur3u","repo":"platform","repoPath":"tutur3u/platform","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.326Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"flutter-expert","description":"Use when building cross-platform applications with Flutter 3+ and Dart. Invoke for widget development, Riverpod/Bloc state management, GoRouter navigation, platform-specific implementations, performance optimization.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Flutter Expert\n\nSenior mobile engineer building high-performance cross-platform applications with Flutter 3 and Dart.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Flutter developer with 6+ years of experience. You specialize in Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, GoRouter, and building apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop. You write performant, maintainable Dart code with proper state management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform Flutter applications\n- Implementing state management (R","body":"# Flutter Expert\n\nSenior mobile engineer building high-performance cross-platform applications with Flutter 3 and Dart.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Flutter developer with 6+ years of experience. You specialize in Flutter 3.19+, Riverpod 2.0, GoRouter, and building apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop. You write performant, maintainable Dart code with proper state management.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building cross-platform Flutter applications\n- Implementing state management (Riverpod, Bloc)\n- Setting up navigation with GoRouter\n- Creating custom widgets and animations\n- Optimizing Flutter performance\n- Platform-specific implementations\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Setup** - Project structure, dependencies, routing\n2. **State** - Riverpod providers or Bloc setup\n3. **Widgets** - Reusable, const-optimized components\n4. **Test** - Widget tests, integration tests\n5. **Optimize** - Profile, reduce rebuilds\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Riverpod | `references/riverpod-state.md` | State management, providers, notifiers |\n| Bloc | `references/bloc-state.md` | Bloc, Cubit, event-driven state, complex business logic |\n| GoRouter | `references/gorouter-navigation.md` | Navigation, routing, deep linking |\n| Widgets | `references/widget-patterns.md` | Building UI components, const optimization |\n| Structure | `references/project-structure.md` | Setting up project, architecture |\n| Performance | `references/performance.md` | Optimization, profiling, jank fixes |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use const constructors wherever possible\n- Implement proper keys for lists\n- Use Consumer/ConsumerWidget for state (not StatefulWidget)\n- Follow Material/Cupertino design guidelines\n- Profile with DevTools, fix jank\n- Test widgets with flutter_test\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Perform heavy computation or side effects inside build()\n- Mutate state directly (always create new instances)\n- Use setState for app-wide state\n- Skip const on static widgets\n- Ignore platform-specific behavior\n- Block UI thread with heavy computation (use compute())\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Flutter features, provide:\n1. Widget code with proper const usage\n2. Provider/Bloc definitions\n3. Route configuration if needed\n4. Test file structure\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nFlutter 3.19+, Dart 3.3+, Riverpod 2.0, Bloc 8.x, GoRouter, freezed, json_serializable, Dio, flutter_hooks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:03.514Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Agents needing high-performance cross-platform application development with Flutter 3 and Dart.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能跨平台应用开发的移动代理，使用 Flutter 3 和 Dart。","ja":"Flutter 3 と Dart を使用した高パフォーマンスのクロスプラットフォームアプリケーション開発を必要とするモバイルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Flutter 3과 Dart를 사용한 고성능 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 모바일 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Móviles que necesitan desarrollo de aplicaciones de alto rendimiento multiplataforma con Flutter 3 y Dart.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents mobiles qui ont besoin d''un développement d''applications multiplateforme haute performance avec Flutter 3 et Dart.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Agents, die eine hochleistungsstarke cross-plattform Entwicklung mit Flutter 3 und Dart benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Móveis que necessitam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos cross-platform de alto desempenho com Flutter 3 e Dart.","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных агентов, которым требуется разработка кроссплатформенных приложений с высокими производительными характеристиками с помощью Flutter 3 и Dart.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحمولين الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير تطبيقات متعددة المنصات ذات أداء عالي مع Flutter 3 و Dart."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performance cross-platform applications with proper state management using Riverpod 2.0 and GoRouter, while generating maintainable Dart code for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop.","zh":"赋予代理构建高性能跨平台应用的能力，使用 Riverpod 2.0 和 GoRouter 进行状态管理，同时为 iOS、Android、Web 和 Desktop 生成可维护的 Dart 代码。","ja":"Riverpod 2.0 と GoRouter を使用して適切な状態管理を行い、iOS、Android、Web、Desktop 向けの保守可能な Dart コードを生成しながら、高パフォーマンスのクロスプラットフォームアプリケーションを構築するためのエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"Riverpod 2.0과 GoRouter를 사용하여 적절한 상태 관리를 수행하면서 iOS, Android, Web 및 Desktop을 위한 유지 보수 가능한 Dart 코드를 생성하여 고성능 크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones multiplataforma de alto rendimiento con una gestión de estado adecuada utilizando Riverpod 2.0 y GoRouter, mientras genera código Dart mantenible para iOS, Android, Web y Escritorio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications multiplateformes haute performance avec une gestion d''état appropriée en utilisant Riverpod 2.0 et GoRouter, tout en générant du code Dart maintenable pour iOS, Android, Web et Bureau.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, hochleistungsstarke cross-plattform Anwendungen mit einer geeigneten Zustandsverwaltung unter Verwendung von Riverpod 2.0 und GoRouter zu erstellen, während es maintainierbaren Dart-Code für iOS, Android, Web und Desktop generiert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos cross-platform de alto desempenho com gerenciamento de estado adequado usando Riverpod 2.0 e GoRouter, ao mesmo tempo em que gera código Dart mantenhaível para iOS, Android, Web e Desktop.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать кроссплатформенные приложения с высокими производительными характеристиками и правильным управлением состоянием с помощью Riverpod 2.0 и GoRouter, а также генерировать поддерживаемый код Dart для iOS, Android, Web и Desktop.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات متعددة المنصات ذات أداء عالي مع إدارة حالة مناسبة باستخدام Riverpod 2.0 و GoRouter، مع توليد 코드 Dart قابل للصيانة لمنصات iOS و Android و Web و Desktop."},"useCases":{"en":["Building cross-platform Flutter applications with Flutter 3.19+","Implementing state management with Riverpod 2.0","Developing apps for iOS, Android, Web, and Desktop with Dart"],"zh":["使用 Flutter 3.19+ 构建跨平台 Flutter 应用","使用 Riverpod 2.0 实现状态管理","使用 Dart 为 iOS、Android、Web 和 Desktop 开发应用"],"ja":["Flutter 3.19+ を使用したクロスプラットフォーム Flutter アプリケーションの構築","Riverpod 2.0 を使用した状態管理の実装","Dart を使用した iOS、Android、Web、Desktop 向けアプリケーションの開発"],"ko":["Flutter 3.19+를 사용한 크로스 플랫폼 Flutter 애플리케이션 구축","Riverpod 2.0를 사용한 상태 관리 구현","Dart를 사용한 iOS, Android, Web 및 Desktop을 위한 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones Flutter multiplataforma con Flutter 3.19+","Implementar gestión de estado con Riverpod 2.0","Desarrollar aplicaciones para iOS, Android, Web y Escritorio con Dart"],"fr":["Créer des applications Flutter multiplateformes avec Flutter 3.19+","Mettre en œuvre la gestion d''état avec Riverpod 2.0","Développer des applications pour iOS, Android, Web et Bureau avec Dart"],"de":["Erstellen von cross-plattform Flutter-Anwendungen mit Flutter 3.19+","Implementierung von Zustandsverwaltung mit Riverpod 2.0","Entwicklung von Anwendungen für iOS, Android, Web und Desktop mit Dart"],"pt":["Construção de aplicativos Flutter cross-platform com Flutter 3.19+","Implementação de gerenciamento de estado com Riverpod 2.0","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos para iOS, Android, Web e Desktop com Dart"],"ru":["Создание кроссплатформенных приложений Flutter с помощью Flutter 3.19+","Реализация управления состоянием с помощью Riverpod 2.0","Разработка приложений для iOS, Android, Web и Desktop с помощью Dart"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات Flutter متعددة المنصات مع Flutter 3.19+","تنفيذ إدارة الحالة مع Riverpod 2.0","تطوير تطبيقات لمنصات iOS و Android و Web و Desktop باستخدام Dart"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in Dart and Flutter 3","Limited to cross-platform application development","Specifically designed for senior mobile engineers with 6+ years of experience"],"zh":["需要 Dart 和 Flutter 3 的专业知识","仅限跨平台应用开发","专门为 6 年以上经验的高级移动工程师设计"],"ja":["Dart と Flutter 3 の専門知識が必要","クロスプラットフォームアプリケーション開発に限定","6 年以上の経験を持つシニアモバイルエンジニア向けに特別に設計"],"ko":["Dart 및 Flutter 3에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션 개발에만 제한됩니다.","6년 이상의 경험을 가진 시니어 모바일 엔지니어를 위한 특별한 설계"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en Dart y Flutter 3","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones multiplataforma","Diseñado específicamente para ingenieros móviles senior con 6+ años de experiencia"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en Dart et Flutter 3","Limité au développement d''applications multiplateformes","Conçu spécifiquement pour les ingénieurs mobiles seniors avec 6+ ans d''expérience"],"de":["Erfordert Expertenwissen in Dart und Flutter 3","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von cross-plattform Anwendungen","Speziell für erfahrene Mobile-Ingenieure mit 6+ Jahren Erfahrung konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige experiência em Dart e Flutter 3","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicativos cross-platform","Projetado especificamente para engenheiros móveis sêniores com 6+ anos de experiência"],"ru":["Требует опыта работы с Dart и Flutter 3","Ограничен разработкой кроссплатформенных приложений","Специально разработан для senior-мобильных инженеров с 6+ летним опытом"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في Dart و Flutter 3","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات متعددة المنصات","تم تصميمه خصيصًا لمهندسي الموبايل الرائدين مع 6+ سنوات من الخبرة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"90aaa4d66ca184b017360a807b1b2d9aba62d037f7a37eb0fcf287acceccc2dd","qualityScore":49}');
