thon 3.11+代码","ja":"Python Proは、高度なPython開発スキルで、タイプセーフとasync-firstのPython 3.11+コードを使用します","ko":"Python Pro는 고급 Python 개발 기술로, 유형 안전과 비동기 우선의 Python 3.11+ 코드를 사용합니다","es":"Python Pro es un desarrollador senior de Python que domina el lenguaje y su ecosistema.","fr":"Python Pro est un développeur senior Python qui maîtrise le langage et son écosystème.","de":"Python Pro ist ein Senior-Entwickler für Python, der die Sprache und ihr Ökosystem beherrscht.","pt":"Python Pro é um desenvolvedor senior Python que cria código type-safe e performático para aplicações web, ciência de dados e automação.","ru":"ИИ Агент Python Pro - это senior разработчик Python, создающий type-safe и производительный код для веб-разработки,数据 науки и автоматизации.","ar":"Python Pro هو مطور python كبير يخلق كود type-safe وperformático لتطبيقات الويب وعلوم البيانات وأتمتة الأنظمة."},"features":{"en":["Writes type-safe Python with complete type coverage","Implements async-first programming for efficient concurrency","Develops production-ready code for web development, data science, automation, and system programming","Utilizes Python 3.11+ features for modern and efficient coding","Focuses on production best practices for reliable and maintainable code","Ensures performant code across various programming domains"],"zh":["类型安全的Python代码","异步优先的开发","生产就绪的Python 3.11+代码","跨web开发、数据科学、自动化和系统编程","专注于生产最佳实践"],"ja":["タイプセーフなPythonコード","async-firstの開発","production-readyなPython 3.11+コード","Web開発、データサイエンス、自動化、システムプログラミング","生産ベストプラクティスに焦点"],"ko":["유형 안전한 Python 코드","비동기 우선의 개발","프로덕션 준비가 된 Python 3.11+ 코드","웹 개발, 데이터 과학, 자동화, 시스템 프로그래밍","프로덕션 최고의 관행에 중점"],"es":["Desarrollo de código tipo-seguro con Python 3.11+","Implementación de código async-first para producción","Experiencia en desarrollo web, ciencia de datos y programación de sistemas","Conocimientos de producción y mejores prácticas","Dominio de Python 3.11+ y su ecosistema"],"fr":["Développement de code type-safe avec Python 3.11+","Mise en œuvre de code async-first pour la production","Expérience dans le développement web, la science des données et la programmation système","Connaissances de production et de meilleures pratiques","Maîtrise de Python 3.11+ et de son écosystème"],"de":["Erstellung von type-sicheren Code mit Python 3.11+","Implementierung von async-first Code für die Produktion","Erfahrung in Webentwicklung, Datenwissenschaft und Systemprogrammierung","Kenntnisse von Produktion und Best Practices","Beherrschung von Python 3.11+ und seinem Ökosystem"],"pt":["Código type-safe com cobertura de tipo completa","Desenvolvimento de aplicações web com Python 3.11+","Análise de dados e automação com Python","Implementação de práticas de produção para código Python","Suporte a async-first e programação concorrente"],"ru":["Type-safe код с полной типовой покрываностью","Разработка веб-приложений на Python 3.11+","Анализ данных и автоматизация с помощью Python","Реализация производственных практик для кода Python","Поддержка async-first и параллельного программирования"],"ar":["كود type-safe مع تغطية كاملة للنوع","تطوير تطبيقات الويب باستخدام python 3.11+","تحليل البيانات وأتمتة الأنظمة باستخدام python","تنفيذ ممارسات الإنتاج للكود python","دعم async-first وبرمجة متزامنة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use python-pro","python-pro vs python 3.10","python-pro install guide","what is python-pro","python-pro alternative","python-pro setup for web development","python-pro tutorial for data science","python-pro best practices","python-pro async programming","python-pro type safety"],"zh":["Python Pro","类型安全","异步优先","生产就绪","Python 3.11+","web开发","数据科学","自动化","系统编程","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Python Pro","タイプセーフ","async-first","production-ready","Python 3.11+","Web開発","データサイエンス","自動化","システムプログラミング","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Python Pro","유형 안전","비동기 우선","프로덕션 준비","Python 3.11+","웹 개발","데이터 과학","자동화","시스템 프로그래밍","AI 에이전트"],"es":["Python Pro","desarrollo de código tipo-seguro","async-first","Python 3.11+","desarrollo web","ciencia de datos","programación de sistemas","producción","mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Python Pro","développement de code type-safe","async-first","Python 3.11+","développement web","science des données","programmation système","production","meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Python Pro","Erstellung von type-sicheren Code","async-first","Python 3.11+","Webentwicklung","Datenwissenschaft","Systemprogrammierung","Produktion","Best Practices"],"pt":["python pro","desenvolvimento python","código type-safe","python 3.11+","aplicações web python","análise de dados python","automação python","práticas de produção python"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Python Pro","разработка на Python","type-safe код","Python 3.11+","веб-разработка на Python","анализ данных на Python","автоматизация на Python","производственные практики Python"],"ar":["python pro","تطوير python","كود type-safe","python 3.11+","تطبيقات الويب python","تحليل البيانات python","أتمتة الأنظمة python","ممارسات الإنتاج python"]}},"owner":"fmgarcia","repo":"InfinitosCuentosWeb","repoPath":"fmgarcia/InfinitosCuentosWeb","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-pro","description":"Use when building Python 3.11+ applications requiring type safety, async programming, or production-grade patterns. Invoke for type hints, pytest, async/await, dataclasses, mypy configuration.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Python Pro\n\nSenior Python developer with 10+ years experience specializing in type-safe, async-first, production-ready Python 3.11+ code.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Python engineer mastering modern Python 3.11+ and its ecosystem. You write idiomatic, type-safe, performant code across web development, data science, automation, and system programming with focus on production best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing type-safe Python with complete type coverage\n- Implementi","body":"# Python Pro\n\nSenior Python developer with 10+ years experience specializing in type-safe, async-first, production-ready Python 3.11+ code.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Python engineer mastering modern Python 3.11+ and its ecosystem. You write idiomatic, type-safe, performant code across web development, data science, automation, and system programming with focus on production best practices.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing type-safe Python with complete type coverage\n- Implementing async/await patterns for I/O operations\n- Setting up pytest test suites with fixtures and mocking\n- Creating Pythonic code with comprehensions, generators, context managers\n- Building packages with Poetry and proper project structure\n- Building API packages with FastAPI and Pydantic libraries\n- Performance optimization and profiling\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze codebase** - Review structure, dependencies, type coverage, test suite\n2. **Design interfaces** - Define protocols, dataclasses, type aliases\n3. **Implement** - Write Pythonic code with full type hints and error handling\n4. **Test** - Create comprehensive pytest suite with >90% coverage\n5. **Validate** - Run mypy, black, ruff; ensure quality standards met\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Type System | `references/type-system.md` | Type hints, mypy, generics, Protocol |\n| Async Patterns | `references/async-patterns.md` | async/await, asyncio, task groups |\n| Standard Library | `references/standard-library.md` | pathlib, dataclasses, functools, itertools |\n| Testing | `references/testing.md` | pytest, fixtures, mocking, parametrize |\n| Packaging | `references/packaging.md` | poetry, pip, pyproject.toml, distribution |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Type hints for all function signatures and class attributes\n- PEP 8 compliance with black formatting\n- Comprehensive docstrings (Google style)\n- Test coverage exceeding 90% with pytest\n- Use `X | None` instead of `Optional[X]` (Python 3.10+)\n- Async/await for I/O-bound operations\n- Dataclasses over manual __init__ methods\n- Context managers for resource handling\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Skip type annotations on public APIs\n- Use mutable default arguments\n- Mix sync and async code improperly\n- Ignore mypy errors in strict mode\n- Use bare except clauses\n- Hardcode secrets or configuration\n- Use deprecated stdlib modules (use pathlib not os.path)\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Python features, provide:\n1. Module file with complete type hints\n2. Test file with pytest fixtures\n3. Type checking confirmation (mypy --strict passes)\n4. Brief explanation of Pythonic patterns used\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nPython 3.11+, typing module, mypy, pytest, black, ruff, dataclasses, async/await, asyncio, pathlib, functools, itertools, Poetry, Pydantic, contextlib, collections.abc, Protocol\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:07:18.080Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Coding Agents requiring expertise in type-safe, async-first Python 3.11+ development.","zh":"适合需要在类型安全、异步优先的Python 3.11+开发中具备专长的高级编码代理。","ja":"型安全、非同期優先のPython 3.11+開発における専門知識を必要とする高度なコーディング エージェントに適しています。","ko":"타입 안전 및 비동기 우선 Python 3.11+ 개발에서 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 고급 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificación Avanzados que requieren experiencia en desarrollo de Python 3.11+ de tipo seguro y async-first.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Codage Avancés nécessitant une expertise dans le développement Python 3.11+ de type sécurisé et async-first.","de":"Ideal für Advanced Coding Agents, die Expertenwissen in der Entwicklung von type-sicheren, async-first Python 3.11+-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação Avançados que exigem expertise em desenvolvimento Python 3.11+ tipo-seguro e async-first.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов кодирования, требующих экспертизы в разработке на Python 3.11+, обеспечивающей безопасность типов и async-first.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز المتقدم الذي يتطلب الخبرة في تطوير Python 3.11+ آمن النوع و async-first."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write idiomatic, performant, and production-ready Python code with complete type coverage, utilizing async-first principles and modern Python 3.11+ features, perfect for web development, data science, automation, and system programming.","zh":"赋予代理编写符合惯用法、性能高且可用于生产的Python代码的能力，具有完整的类型覆盖，利用异步优先原则和现代Python 3.11+功能，非常适合Web开发、数据科学、自动化和系统编程。","ja":"エージェントが、完全な型のカバーを持ち、同期優先の原則と最新のPython 3.11+の機能を利用した、規範に従った、高性能で、本番環境で使用できるPythonコードを書くことを可能にします。Web開発、データサイエンス、自動化、システムプログラミングに最適です。","ko":"에이전트가 관용적이고 성능이 뛰어난 프로덕션 준비 코드를 작성할 수 있도록 해주며 완전한 유형 커버리지를 제공하고 비동기 우선 원칙 및 최신 Python 3.11+ 기능을 사용하여 웹 개발, 데이터 과학, 자동화 및 시스템 프로그래밍에 적합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a escribir código Python idiomático, eficiente y listo para producción con cobertura de tipo completa, utilizando principios async-first y características modernas de Python 3.11+, perfecto para el desarrollo web, la ciencia de datos, la automatización y la programación de sistemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''écrire du code Python idiomatique, performant et prêt pour la production avec une couverture de type complète, en utilisant les principes async-first et les fonctionnalités modernes de Python 3.11+, parfait pour le développement web, la science des données, l''automatisation et la programmation système.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, idiomatischen, leistungsfähigen und produktionsreifen Python-Code mit vollständiger Typabdeckung zu schreiben, der auf async-first-Prinzipien und modernen Python 3.11+-Funktionen basiert, ideal für Webentwicklung, Data Science, Automation und Systemprogrammierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a escreverem código Python idiomático, performático e pronto para produção com cobertura de tipo completa, utilizando princípios async-first e recursos modernos do Python 3.11+, perfeitos para desenvolvimento web, ciência de dados, automação e programação de sistemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью писать идиоматический, производительный и готовый к производству код на Python с полным покрытием типов, используя принципы async-first и современные возможности Python 3.11+, идеально подходящий для веб-разработки, науки о данных, автоматизации и системного программирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية كتابة رمز بايثون محلي وذكي وجاهز للإنتاج مع تغطية كاملة للنوع، مع استخدام مبادئ async-first وميزات بايثون 3.11+ الحديثة، مثالية للتطوير الويب وعلوم البيانات والتحكم الآلي وبرمجة الأنظمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing type-safe Python with complete type coverage","Implementing async-first production-ready code","Developing performant web applications with Python 3.11+"],"zh":["编写具有完整类型覆盖的类型安全Python代码","实施异步优先的生产就绪代码","使用Python 3.11+开发高性能的Web应用程序"],"ja":["完全な型のカバーを持つ型安全なPythonコードを書く","同期優先の本番環境で使用できるコードを実装する","Python 3.11+を使用して、高性能なWebアプリケーションを開発する"],"ko":["완전한 유형 커버리지를 갖춘 타입 안전 Python 코드 작성","비동기 우선 프로덕션 준비 코드 구현","Python 3.11+를 사용한 고성능 웹 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["Escribir Python de tipo seguro con cobertura de tipo completa","Implementar código de producción async-first","Desarrollar aplicaciones web eficientes con Python 3.11+"],"fr":["Écrire du Python de type sécurisé avec une couverture de type complète","Mettre en œuvre du code de production async-first","Développer des applications web performantes avec Python 3.11+"],"de":["Sicheren Python-Code mit vollständiger Typabdeckung schreiben","Async-first-Produktionscode implementieren","Leistungsfähige Webanwendungen mit Python 3.11+ entwickeln"],"pt":["Escrever Python tipo-seguro com cobertura de tipo completa","Implementar código de produção async-first","Desenvolver aplicações web performáticas com Python 3.11+"],"ru":["Написание безопасного по типам Python с полным покрытием типов","Реализация async-first кода, готового к производству","Разработка производительных веб-приложений на Python 3.11+"],"ar":["كتابة بايثون آمن النوع مع تغطية كاملة للنوع","تنفيذ رمز الإنتاج async-first","تطوير تطبيقات ويب ذكية مع Python 3.11+"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.11+ environment","Focus on type-safe and async-first development"],"zh":["需要Python 3.11+环境","专注于类型安全和异步优先开发"],"ja":["Python 3.11+の環境が必要","型安全および同期優先開発に焦点を当てている"],"ko":["Python 3.11+ 환경 필요","타입 안전 및 비동기 우선 개발에 중점을 둠"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Python 3.11+","Enfocarse en el desarrollo de tipo seguro y async-first"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python 3.11+","Se concentrer sur le développement de type sécurisé et async-first"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python 3.11+-Umgebung","Fokus auf type-sichere und async-first-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python 3.11+","Foco no desenvolvimento tipo-seguro e async-first"],"ru":["Требует окружения Python 3.11+","Фокус на разработке, обеспечивающей безопасность типов и async-first"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python 3.11+","التركيز على التطوير آمن النوع و async-first"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d3d3195a53d351c230768814381cdeddf1138ed15414fac6b384352d49ca8824","qualityScore":49}');
