tions d''entreprise avec .NET 8","Utilisation de C# 12 pour des applications à haute performance","Mise en œuvre de modèles d''applications natives de cloud","Intégration avec React 19 pour des interfaces utilisateur avancées","Utilisation d''Entity Framework Core pour la gestion de bases de données","Architecture d''application propre et évolutivité"],"de":["Entwicklung von Unternehmensanwendungen mit .NET 8","Verwendung von C# 12 für Anwendungen mit hoher Leistung","Implementierung von Cloud-nativen AnwendungsMustern","Integration mit React 19 für erweiterte Benutzeroberflächen","Verwendung von Entity Framework Core für Datenbankverwaltung","Sauberer und skalierbarer Anwendungs-Architektur"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações empresariais escaláveis com .NET 8","Criação de minimal APIs com .NET 8","Utilização de Entity Framework Core para gerenciamento de dados","Desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas de nuvem com .NET Core","Utilização de C# 12 para desenvolvimento de aplicações"],"ru":["Разработка масштабируемых корпоративных приложений с использованием .NET 8 для ИИ Агентов","Создание минимальных API с использованием .NET 8","Использование Entity Framework Core для управления данными","Разработка облачных приложений с использованием .NET Core","Использование C# 12 для разработки приложений"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات Unternehmen قابلة للتوسعة مع .NET 8 للأدوات الذكية","إنشاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المُختَصرة مع .NET 8","استخدام Entity Framework Core لإدارة البيانات","تطوير التطبيقات الأصلية السحابية مع .NET Core","استخدام C# 12 لتطوير التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use dotnet-core-expert","dotnet-core-expert alternative","dotnet-core-expert setup guide","what is dotnet-core-expert","dotnet-core-expert vs .NET 8","dotnet-core-expert install","dotnet-core-expert for cloud-native applications","dotnet-core-expert for minimal APIs","dotnet-core-expert for enterprise applications"],"zh":[".NET Core 专家",".NET 8","C# 12","最小 API","云原生应用开发","Clean Architecture","高性能应用开发","企业应用开发"],"ja":[".NET Core エキスパート",".NET 8","C# 12","最小 API","クラウドネイティブ アプリケーション開発","Clean Architecture","高パフォーマンス アプリケーション開発","企業アプリケーション開発"],"ko":[".NET Core 전문가",".NET 8","C# 12","최소 API","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발","Clean Architecture","고성능 애플리케이션 개발","기업 애플리케이션 개발"],"es":["dotnet core expert","desarrollo de aplicaciones empresariales",".NET 8","C# 12","patrones de aplicaciones nativas de la nube","React 19","Entity Framework Core","arquitectura de aplicación limpia","dotnet core desarrollador","herramientas de desarrollo de dotnet core"],"fr":["expert en dotnet core","développement d''applications d''entreprise",".NET 8","C# 12","modèles d''applications natives de cloud","React 19","Entity Framework Core","architecture d''application propre","développeur dotnet core","outils de développement dotnet core"],"de":["dotnet core Experte","Entwicklung von Unternehmensanwendungen",".NET 8","C# 12","Cloud-nativen AnwendungsMuster","React 19","Entity Framework Core","saubere Anwendungs-Architektur","dotnet core Entwickler","dotnet core Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicações empresariais","minimal APIs .NET 8","Entity Framework Core","desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas de nuvem","C# 12","especialista .NET Core","guia de configuração .NET Core Expert"],"ru":["разработка корпоративных приложений","минимальные API .NET 8 для ИИ Агентов","Entity Framework Core","разработка облачных приложений","C# 12","эксперт .NET Core","руководство по настройке .NET Core Expert"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات Unternehmen","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المُختَصرة .NET 8 للأدوات الذكية","Entity Framework Core","تطوير التطبيقات الأصلية السحابية","C# 12","خبير .NET Core","دليل إعداد خبير .NET Core"]}},"owner":"vorluno","repo":"Vorluno-Planilla","repoPath":"vorluno/Vorluno-Planilla","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.456Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-core-expert","description":"Use when building .NET 8 applications with minimal APIs, clean architecture, or cloud-native microservices. Invoke for Entity Framework Core, CQRS with MediatR, JWT authentication, AOT compilation.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- I","body":"# .NET Core Expert\n\nSenior .NET Core specialist with deep expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, minimal APIs, and cloud-native application development.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior .NET engineer with 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications. You specialize in .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns. You build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building minimal APIs with .NET 8\n- Implementing clean architecture with CQRS/MediatR\n- Setting up Entity Framework Core with async patterns\n- Creating microservices with cloud-native patterns\n- Implementing JWT authentication and authorization\n- Optimizing performance with AOT compilation\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify architecture pattern, data models, API design\n2. **Design solution** - Create clean architecture layers with proper separation\n3. **Implement** - Write high-performance code with modern C# features\n4. **Secure** - Add authentication, authorization, and security best practices\n5. **Test** - Write comprehensive tests with xUnit and integration testing\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Minimal APIs | `references/minimal-apis.md` | Creating endpoints, routing, middleware |\n| Clean Architecture | `references/clean-architecture.md` | CQRS, MediatR, layers, DI patterns |\n| Entity Framework | `references/entity-framework.md` | DbContext, migrations, relationships |\n| Authentication | `references/authentication.md` | JWT, Identity, authorization policies |\n| Cloud-Native | `references/cloud-native.md` | Docker, health checks, configuration |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use .NET 8 and C# 12 features\n- Enable nullable reference types\n- Use async/await for all I/O operations\n- Implement proper dependency injection\n- Use record types for DTOs\n- Follow clean architecture principles\n- Write integration tests with WebApplicationFactory\n- Configure OpenAPI/Swagger documentation\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use synchronous I/O operations\n- Expose entities directly in API responses\n- Store secrets in code or appsettings.json\n- Skip input validation\n- Use legacy .NET Framework patterns\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Mix concerns across architectural layers\n- Use deprecated EF Core patterns\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing .NET features, provide:\n1. Project structure (solution/project files)\n2. Domain models and DTOs\n3. API endpoints or service implementations\n4. Database context and migrations if applicable\n5. Brief explanation of architectural decisions\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\n.NET 8, C# 12, ASP.NET Core, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, MediatR, CQRS, clean architecture, dependency injection, JWT authentication, xUnit, Docker, Kubernetes, AOT compilation, OpenAPI/Swagger\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:06.764Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Modern AI Agents needing expertise in .NET 8, modern C#, and cloud-native application development for building enterprise applications.","zh":"适合于需要在 .NET 8、现代 C# 和云原生应用开发方面拥有专长的现代 AI 代理。","ja":".NET 8、モダン C#、クラウドネイティブアプリケーション開発に精通しているモダン AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":".NET 8, 현대적인 C# 및 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발에 전문성을 필요로 하는 현대적인 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Modernos que necesitan experiencia en .NET 8, C# moderno y desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de la nube para la creación de aplicaciones empresariales.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA Modernes ayant besoin d''expertise en .NET 8, C# moderne et développement d''applications cloud-native pour la création d''applications d''entreprise.","de":"Perfekt für moderne KI-Agents, die Erfahrung in .NET 8, modernem C# und cloudbasierten Anwendungsentwicklung für den Bau von Unternehmensanwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Modernos que precisam de especialização em .NET 8, C# moderno e desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas em nuvem para construir aplicações empresariais.","ru":"Идеально для современных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы знания в области .NET 8, современного C# и разработки облачных приложений для создания корпоративных приложений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الحديثة الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في .NET 8 و C# الحديثة وتطوير التطبيقات الأصلية السحابية لإنشاء تطبيقات الشركات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performance, scalable applications with clean architecture using .NET 8, C# 12, minimal APIs, Entity Framework Core, and cloud-native patterns, enabling the creation of robust and efficient enterprise solutions.","zh":"赋予代理构建高性能、可扩展的应用程序的能力，使用 .NET 8、C# 12、最小 API、Entity Framework Core 和云原生模式，从而实现强大且高效的企业解决方案的创建。","ja":".NET 8、C# 12、最小 API、Entity Framework Core、クラウドネイティブ パターンを使用して、クリーンなアーキテクチャで高性能、可扩展なアプリケーションを構築するエージェントをEmpowerし、強固で効率的な企業ソリューションの作成を可能にします。","ko":".NET 8, C# 12, 최소한의 API, Entity Framework Core 및 클라우드 네이티브 패턴을 사용하여 깨끗한 아키텍처로 높은 성능 및 확장 가능한 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 강력하고 효율적인 엔터프라이즈 솔루션의 생성을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones de alto rendimiento y escalables con arquitectura limpia utilizando .NET 8, C# 12, APIs mínimas, Entity Framework Core y patrones nativos de la nube, lo que permite la creación de soluciones empresariales robustas y eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications à haute performance et évolutives avec une architecture propre en utilisant .NET 8, C# 12, API minimales, Entity Framework Core et des modèles cloud-native, permettant ainsi la création de solutions d''entreprise robustes et efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, hochleistungs- und skalierbare Anwendungen mit sauberer Architektur zu erstellen, indem .NET 8, C# 12, minimale APIs, Entity Framework Core und cloudbasierte Muster verwendet werden, wodurch die Erstellung robuster und effizienter Unternehmenslösungen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações de alto desempenho, escaláveis, com arquitetura limpa usando .NET 8, C# 12, APIs mínimas, Entity Framework Core e padrões nativos em nuvem, permitindo a criação de soluções empresariais robustas e eficientes.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать высокопроизводительные, масштабируемые приложения с чистой архитектурой, используя .NET 8, C# 12, минимальные API, Entity Framework Core и облачные шаблоны, что позволяет создавать надежные и эффективные корпоративные решения.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات عالية الأداء قابلة للتوسيع مع هندسة نظيفة باستخدام .NET 8 و C# 12 و APIs المحدودة و Entity Framework Core و أنماط سحابية أصلية، مما يسمح بإنشاء حلول شركات قوية وفعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building minimal APIs with .NET 8 for streamlined backend services","Developing cloud-native applications with scalable and secure architectures","Optimizing enterprise application performance using Entity Framework Core and C# 12"],"zh":["使用 .NET 8 构建最小 API 以实现简化的后端服务","使用可扩展且安全的架构开发云原生应用程序","使用 Entity Framework Core 和 C# 12 优化企业应用程序性能"],"ja":[".NET 8 を使用して最小限の API を構築してバックエンド サービスをストリームライン化する","拡張性とセキュリティのあるアーキテクチャを使用してクラウド ネイティブ アプリケーションを開発する","Entity Framework Core と C# 12 を使用してエンタープライズ アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":[".NET 8을 사용하여 최소한의 API를構築하여 백엔드 서비스를 간소화하는 것","확장 가능하고 보안이 강화된 아키텍처를 사용하여 클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것","Entity Framework Core 및 C# 12를 사용하여 엔터프라이즈 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Construir APIs mínimas con .NET 8 para servicios de backend optimizados","Desarrollar aplicaciones nativas de la nube con arquitecturas escalables y seguras","Optimizar el rendimiento de las aplicaciones empresariales utilizando Entity Framework Core y C# 12"],"fr":["Créer des API minimales avec .NET 8 pour des services de backend rationalisés","Développer des applications cloud-native avec des architectures évolutives et sécurisées","Optimiser les performances des applications d''entreprise en utilisant Entity Framework Core et C# 12"],"de":["Erstellen von minimalen APIs mit .NET 8 für optimierte Backend-Dienste","Entwicklung von cloudbasierten Anwendungen mit skalierbaren und sicheren Architekturen","Optimieren der Leistung von Unternehmensanwendungen unter Verwendung von Entity Framework Core und C# 12"],"pt":["Construir APIs mínimas com .NET 8 para serviços de backend otimizados","Desenvolver aplicações nativas em nuvem com arquiteturas escaláveis e seguras","Otimizar o desempenho de aplicações empresariais usando Entity Framework Core e C# 12"],"ru":["Создание минимальных API с помощью .NET 8 для оптимизированных сервисов бэкэнда","Разработка облачных приложений с масштабируемыми и безопасными архитектурами","Оптимизация производительности корпоративных приложений с помощью Entity Framework Core и C# 12"],"ar":["بناء APIs المحدودة مع .NET 8 لخدمات الخلفية المُحسّنة","تطوير تطبيقات سحابية أصلية مع هياكل قابلة للتوسيع وآمنة","تحسين أداء تطبيقات الشركات باستخدام Entity Framework Core و C# 12"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in C# and .NET Core","Limited to .NET 8 and C# 12","Cloud-native application development experience necessary"],"zh":["需要 C# 和 .NET Core 的专长","仅限 .NET 8 和 C# 12","云原生应用开发经验必要"],"ja":["C# と .NET Core の専門知識が必要",".NET 8 と C# 12 限定","クラウドネイティブ アプリケーション開発の経験が必要"],"ko":["C# 및 .NET Core의 전문 지식이 필요합니다.",".NET 8 및 C# 12로 제한됩니다.","클라우드 네이티브 애플리케이션 개발ประสบการณ이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere experiencia en C# y .NET Core","Limitado a .NET 8 y C# 12","Se requiere experiencia en desarrollo de aplicaciones nativas de la nube"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en C# et .NET Core","Limité à .NET 8 et C# 12","Expérience de développement d''applications cloud-native nécessaire"],"de":["Erfahrung in C# und .NET Core erforderlich","Begrenzt auf .NET 8 und C# 12","Erfahrung in der Entwicklung von cloudbasierten Anwendungen erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer especialização em C# e .NET Core","Limitado a .NET 8 e C# 12","Experiência necessária em desenvolvimento de aplicações nativas em nuvem"],"ru":["Требуется знание C# и .NET Core","Ограничен для .NET 8 и C# 12","Необходим опыт разработки облачных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في C# و .NET Core","محدود لـ .NET 8 و C# 12","يتطلب خبرة في تطوير التطبيقات السحابية الأصلية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"16c65b635327beb4a4b71fec45ba3eb5658daa383e4ceba9ce68a40c6f780330","qualityScore":49}');
