alela de projetos com base no plano aprovado em /startproject.","ru":"Team Implement - это способность, которая позволяет параллельную реализацию проектов на основе плана, утвержденного в /startproject.","ar":"فريق التنفيذ هو قدرة تسمح بتنفيذ المشاريع بالتوازي بناءً على الخطة المعتمدة في /startproject"},"features":{"en":["Analyzes task dependencies from plans in /startproject","Determines team composition based on task dependencies","Spawns Agent Teams per module/layer","Launches teammates per module/layer","Executes parallel implementation based on approved plans"],"zh":["依据 `/startproject` 中批准的计划执行","分析任务依赖并确定团队组成","启动团队成员按模块/层","支持并行实现","依据 `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md` 中的架构文档"],"ja":[" `/startproject` で承認されたプランに基づいて実装","タスク依存関係を分析してチーム構成を決定","モジュール/レイヤーごとにチームメンバーを起動","並列実装をサポート"," `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md` に記載されたアーキテクチャドキュメントに基づく"],"ko":[" `/startproject`에서 승인된 계획에 따라 실행","작업 의존성을 분석하여 팀 구성 결정","모듈/레이어별로 팀원을 시작","병렬 구현 지원"," `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md`에記載された 아키텍처 문서에従う"],"es":["Análisis de dependencias de tareas del plan","Determinación de la composición del equipo","Lanzamiento de agentes por módulo o capa","Ejecución paralela según el plan aprobado"],"fr":["Analyse des dépendances de tâches du plan","Détermination de la composition de l''équipe","Lancement d''agents par module ou couche","Exécution parallèle selon le plan approuvé"],"de":["Analyse von Task-Abhängigkeiten des Plans","Bestimmung der Teamzusammensetzung","Starten von Agenten pro Modul oder Schicht","Parallele Ausführung nach dem genehmigten Plan"],"pt":["Análise de dependências de tarefas","Determinação da composição da equipe","Execução paralela de projetos","Integração com /startproject","Documentação da arquitetura em .claude/docs/DESIGN.md","Criação de lista de tarefas"],"ru":["Анализ зависимостей задач","Определение состава команды","Параллельная реализация проектов","Интеграция с /startproject","Документация архитектуры в .claude/docs/DESIGN.md","Создание списка задач"],"ar":["تحليل التبعيات بين المهام","تحديد تكوين الفريق","تنفيذ المشاريع بالتوازي","التكامل مع /startproject","توثيق الهندسة المعمارية في .claude/docs/DESIGN.md","إنشاء قائمة المهام"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use team-implement","team-implement setup guide","parallel implementation with Agent Teams","team-implement alternative","team-implement vs competitor","team-implement install","what is team-implement","team-implement documentation","team-implement tutorial"],"zh":["团队实施","并行实现","Agent团队"," `/startproject`"," `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md`","任务依赖分析","团队组成确定"],"ja":["チーム実装","並列実装","AIエージェント"," `/startproject`"," `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md`","タスク依存関係分析","チーム構成決定"],"ko":["팀 구현","병렬 구현","에이전트 팀"," `/startproject`"," `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md`","작업 의존성 분석","팀 구성 결정"],"es":["implementación de equipos de agentes AI","plan aprobado en /startproject","agentes AI en paralelo","desarrollo de software con agentes AI","herramientas de desarrollo de AI","agentes AI y equipos de desarrollo"],"fr":["mise en œuvre d''équipes d''agents IA","plan approuvé dans /startproject","agents IA en parallèle","développement de logiciels avec des agents IA","outils de développement d''IA","agents IA et équipes de développement"],"de":["Implementierung von AI-Agenten-Teams","genehmigter Plan in /startproject","AI-Agenten im Parallellausführungsmodus","Softwareentwicklung mit AI-Agenten","Entwicklungstools für KI","KI-Agenten und Entwicklerteams"],"pt":["team implement","agentes de ia","implementação paralela","análise de dependências","composição da equipe","startproject","claude","design md","lista de tarefas"],"ru":["team implement","ии агенты","параллельная реализация","анализ зависимостей","состав команды","startproject","claude","design md","список задач"],"ar":["فريق التنفيذ","عمليات الإيمان الاصطناعي","تنفيذ المشاريع بالتوازي","تحليل التبعيات","تكوين الفريق","startproject","claude","تصميم md","قائمة المهام"]}},"owner":"DeL-TaiseiOzaki","repo":"claude-code-orchestra","repoPath":"DeL-TaiseiOzaki/claude-code-orchestra","stars":113,"forks":18,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T18:33:37Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"team-implement","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Team Implement\n\n**Parallel implementation using Agent Teams. Executes based on the plan approved in `/startproject`.**\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `/startproject` is complete and the plan has been approved by the user\n- Architecture is documented in `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md`\n- Task list has been created\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nStep 1: Analyze Plan & Design Team\n  Analyze task dependencies from the plan and determine team composition\n    ↓\nStep 2: Spawn Agent Team\n  Launch Teammates per module/layer\n    ↓\nSt","body":"# Team Implement\n\n**Parallel implementation using Agent Teams. Executes based on the plan approved in `/startproject`.**\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `/startproject` is complete and the plan has been approved by the user\n- Architecture is documented in `.claude/docs/DESIGN.md`\n- Task list has been created\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nStep 1: Analyze Plan & Design Team\n  Analyze task dependencies from the plan and determine team composition\n    ↓\nStep 2: Spawn Agent Team\n  Launch Teammates per module/layer\n    ↓\nStep 3: Monitor & Coordinate\n  Lead monitors, integrates, and manages quality\n    ↓\nStep 4: Integration & Verification\n  After all tasks complete, run integration tests\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Analyze Plan & Design Team\n\n**Identify parallelizable workstreams from the task list.**\n\n### Team Design Principles\n\n1. **File ownership separation**: Each Teammate owns a different set of files\n2. **Respect dependencies**: Dependent tasks go to the same Teammate or execute in dependency order\n3. **Appropriate granularity**: Target 5-6 tasks per Teammate\n\n### Common Team Patterns\n\n**Pattern A: Module-Based (Recommended)**\n```\nTeammate 1: Module A (models, core logic)\nTeammate 2: Module B (API, endpoints)\nTeammate 3: Tests (unit + integration)\n```\n\n**Pattern B: Layer-Based**\n```\nTeammate 1: Data layer (models, DB)\nTeammate 2: Business logic (services)\nTeammate 3: Interface layer (API/CLI)\n```\n\n**Pattern C: Feature-Based**\n```\nTeammate 1: Feature X (all layers)\nTeammate 2: Feature Y (all layers)\nTeammate 3: Shared infrastructure\n```\n\n### Anti-patterns\n\n- Two Teammates editing the same file → overwrite risk\n- Too many tasks per Teammate → risk of prolonged idle time\n- Overly complex dependencies → coordination costs outweigh benefits\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Spawn Agent Team\n\n**Launch the team based on the plan.**\n\n```\nCreate an agent team for implementing: {feature}\n\nEach teammate receives:\n- Project Brief from CLAUDE.md\n- Architecture from .claude/docs/DESIGN.md\n- Library constraints from .claude/docs/libraries/\n- Their specific task assignments\n\nSpawn teammates:\n\n1. **Implementer-{module}** for each module/workstream\n   Prompt: \"You are implementing {module} for project: {feature}.\n\n   Read these files for context:\n   - CLAUDE.md (project context)\n   - .claude/docs/DESIGN.md (architecture)\n   - .claude/docs/libraries/ (library constraints)\n\n   Your assigned tasks:\n   {task list for this teammate}\n\n   Your file ownership:\n   {list of files this teammate owns}\n\n   Rules:\n   - ONLY edit files in your ownership set\n   - Follow existing codebase patterns\n   - Write type hints on all functions\n   - Run ruff check after each file change\n   - Communicate with other teammates if you need interface changes\n\n   When done with each task, mark it completed in the task list.\n\n   IMPORTANT — Work Log:\n   When ALL your assigned tasks are complete, write a work log file to:\n     .claude/logs/agent-teams/{team-name}/{your-teammate-name}.md\n\n   Use this format:\n   # Work Log: {your-teammate-name}\n   ## Summary\n   (1-2 sentence summary of what you accomplished)\n   ## Tasks Completed\n   - [x] {task}: {brief description of what was done}\n   ## Files Modified\n   - `{file path}`: {what was changed and why}\n   ## Key Decisions\n   - {decision made during implementation and rationale}\n   ## Communication with Teammates\n   - → {recipient}: {summary of message sent}\n   - ← {sender}: {summary of message received}\n   ## Issues Encountered\n   - {issue}: {how it was resolved}\n   (If none, write ''None'')\n   \"\n\n2. **Tester** (optional but recommended)\n   Prompt: \"You are the Tester for project: {feature}.\n\n   Read:\n   - CLAUDE.md, .claude/docs/DESIGN.md\n   - Existing test patterns in tests/\n\n   Your tasks:\n   - Write tests for each module as implementers complete them\n   - Follow TDD where possible (write test stubs first)\n   - Run uv run pytest after each test file\n   - Report failing tests to the relevant implementer\n\n   Test coverage target: 80%+\n\n   IMPORTANT — Work Log:\n   When ALL your assigned tasks are complete, write a work log file to:\n     .claude/logs/agent-teams/{team-name}/{your-teammate-name}.md\n\n   Use this format:\n   # Work Log: {your-teammate-name}\n   ## Summary\n   (1-2 sentence summary of what you accomplished)\n   ## Tasks Completed\n   - [x] {task}: {brief description of what was done}\n   ## Files Modified\n   - `{file path}`: {what was changed and why}\n   ## Key Decisions\n   - {decision made during implementation and rationale}\n   ## Communication with Teammates\n   - → {recipient}: {summary of message sent}\n   - ← {sender}: {summary of message received}\n   ## Issues Encountered\n   - {issue}: {how it was resolved}\n   (If none, write ''None'')\n   \"\n\nUse delegate mode (Shift+Tab) to prevent Lead from implementing directly.\nWait for all teammates to complete their tasks.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Monitor & Coordinate\n\n**Lead focuses on monitoring and integration, not implementing.**\n\n### Monitoring Checklist\n\n- [ ] Check task list progress (Ctrl+T)\n- [ ] Review each Teammate''s output (Shift+Up/Down)\n- [ ] Verify no file conflicts\n- [ ] Check if any Teammate is stuck\n\n### Intervention Triggers\n\n| Situation | Response |\n|-----------|----------|\n| Teammate not making progress for a long time | Send a message to check, re-instruct if needed |\n| File conflict detected | Reassign file ownership |\n| Tests keep failing | Send message to the relevant Implementer |\n| Unexpected technical issue | Consult Codex (via subagent) |\n\n### Quality Gates (via Hooks)\n\n`TeammateIdle` hook and `TaskCompleted` hook automatically run quality checks:\n\n- Lint check (ruff)\n- Test execution (pytest)\n- Type check (ty)\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Integration & Verification\n\n**After all tasks are complete, run integration verification.**\n\n```bash\n# All quality checks\nuv run ruff check .\nuv run ruff format --check .\nuv run ty check src/\nuv run pytest -v\n\n# Or via poe\npoe all\n```\n\n### Integration Report\n\n```markdown\n## Implementation Complete: {feature}\n\n### Completed Tasks\n- [x] {task 1}\n- [x] {task 2}\n...\n\n### Quality Checks\n- ruff: PASS / FAIL\n- ty: PASS / FAIL\n- pytest: PASS ({N} tests passed)\n- coverage: {N}%\n\n### Next Steps\nRun `/team-review` for parallel review\n```\n\n### Cleanup\n\n```\nClean up the team\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tips\n\n- **Delegate mode**: Use Shift+Tab to prevent Lead from implementing directly\n- **Task granularity**: 5-6 tasks per Teammate is optimal\n- **File conflict prevention**: Module-level ownership separation is the most important factor\n- **Separate Tester**: Having a dedicated Tester separate from Implementers enables a TDD-like workflow\n- **Cost awareness**: Each Teammate is an independent Claude instance (high token consumption)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:30:42.726Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Project Management Agents requiring parallel task execution and team composition analysis.","zh":"适合需要并行任务执行和团队组成分析的项目管理代理。","ja":"並列タスクの実行とチーム構成分析が必要なプロジェクト管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"병렬 태스크 실행 및 팀 구성 분석이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que requieren ejecución de tareas paralelas y análisis de composición de equipo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une exécution de tâches parallèles et une analyse de composition d''équipe.","de":"Ideal für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die eine parallele Aufgabenausführung und eine Teamzusammensetzungsanalyse erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que exigem execução de tarefas paralelas e análise de composição de equipe.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления проектами, требующих параллельного выполнения задач и анализа состава команды.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة المشاريع الذي يتطلب تنفيذ مهمات متوازي وتحليل تكوين الفريق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute parallel implementation using Agent Teams based on approved plans in /startproject, analyzing task dependencies and determining team composition, utilizing documented architecture in .claude/docs/DESIGN.md and task lists.","zh":"赋予代理执行并行实现的能力，基于/startproject中批准的计划，分析任务依赖并确定团队组成，利用.claude/docs/DESIGN.md中的文档架构和任务列表。","ja":"/startproject内の承認済みプランに基づいて、エージェントチームを使用して並列実装を実行し、タスク依存関係を分析し、チーム構成を決定し、.claude/docs/DESIGN.md内の文書化されたアーキテクチャとタスクリストを利用します。","ko":"에이전트 팀을 사용하여 /startproject의 승인된 계획을 기반으로 병렬 구현을 실행하고, 태스크 종속성을 분석하고, 팀 구성 등을 결정하며, .claude/docs/DESIGN.md에 문서화된 아키텍처와 태스크 목록을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar una implementación paralela utilizando Equipos de Agentes basados en planes aprobados en /startproject, analizando las dependencias de las tareas y determinando la composición del equipo, utilizando la arquitectura documentada en .claude/docs/DESIGN.md y listas de tareas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter une mise en œuvre parallèle en utilisant des équipes d''agents basées sur des plans approuvés dans /startproject, en analysant les dépendances des tâches et en déterminant la composition de l''équipe, en utilisant l''architecture documentée dans .claude/docs/DESIGN.md et les listes de tâches.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine parallele Implementierung mithilfe von Agententeams basierend auf genehmigten Plänen in /startproject auszuführen, indem die Aufgabenabhängigkeiten analysiert und die Teamzusammensetzung bestimmt werden, unter Verwendung der in .claude/docs/DESIGN.md dokumentierten Architektur und Aufgabenlisten.","pt":"Habilita agentes a executar implementação paralela usando Equipes de Agentes com base em planos aprovados em /startproject, analisando dependências de tarefas e determinando composição de equipe, utilizando arquitetura documentada em .claude/docs/DESIGN.md e listas de tarefas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять параллельную реализацию, используя команды агентов на основе утвержденных планов в /startproject, анализируя зависимости задач и определяя состав команды, используя документированную архитектуру в .claude/docs/DESIGN.md и списки задач.","ar":"تمكين العملاء من تنفيذ التطبيق الموازي باستخدام فرق الوكلاء على أساس خطط معتمدة في /startproject، وتحليل зависимости المهام وتحديد تكوين الفريق، واستخدام الهيكل المُستند إلى .claude/docs/DESIGN.md وقوائم المهام."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project plan execution","Analyzing task dependencies for team composition","Optimizing parallel implementation workflows"],"zh":["自动化项目计划的执行","分析任务依赖以确定团队组成","优化并行实现的工作流"],"ja":["プロジェクト計画の実行の自動化","チーム構成のためのタスク依存関係の分析","並列実装のワークフローの最適化"],"ko":["프로젝트 계획 실행의 자동화","팀 구성 등을 위한 태스크 종속성 분석","병렬 구현 워크플로우 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de la ejecución del plan de proyecto","Análisis de dependencias de tareas para la composición del equipo","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de implementación paralela"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''exécution du plan de projet","Analyse des dépendances des tâches pour la composition de l''équipe","Optimisation des flux de travail de mise en œuvre parallèle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ausführung des Projektplans","Analyse von Aufgabenabhängigkeiten für die Teamzusammensetzung","Optimierung von Arbeitsflüssen für parallele Implementierung"],"pt":["Automatizar a execução do plano do projeto","Analisar dependências de tarefas para composição de equipe","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de implementação paralela"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выполнение проектного плана","Анализировать зависимости задач для состава команды","Оптимизировать параллельные рабочие процессы"],"ar":["أتمتة تنفيذ خطة المشروع","تحليل зависимости المهام لتكوين الفريق","تحسين تدفقات العمل المتوازي"]},"limitations":{"en":["/startproject must be complete with an approved plan","Architecture must be documented in .claude/docs/DESIGN.md","Task list must be created"],"zh":["/startproject必须完成并具有批准的计划","架构必须在.claude/docs/DESIGN.md中进行文档化","任务列表必须创建"],"ja":["/startprojectは承認済みプランを含む完全なものである必要があります","アーキテクチャは.claude/docs/DESIGN.mdに文書化する必要があります","タスクリストを作成する必要があります"],"ko":["/startproject는 승인된 계획을 포함하여 완료되어야 합니다","아키텍처는 .claude/docs/DESIGN.md에 문서화되어야 합니다","태스크 목록을 생성해야 합니다"],"es":["/startproject debe estar completo con un plan aprobado","La arquitectura debe estar documentada en .claude/docs/DESIGN.md","La lista de tareas debe ser creada"],"fr":["/startproject doit être complet avec un plan approuvé","L''architecture doit être documentée dans .claude/docs/DESIGN.md","La liste des tâches doit être créée"],"de":["/startproject muss vollständig mit einem genehmigten Plan sein","Die Architektur muss in .claude/docs/DESIGN.md dokumentiert sein","Die Aufgabenliste muss erstellt werden"],"pt":["/startproject deve estar completo com um plano aprovado","Arquitetura deve estar documentada em .claude/docs/DESIGN.md","Lista de tarefas deve ser criada"],"ru":["/startproject должен быть завершен с утвержденным планом","Архитектура должна быть документирована в .claude/docs/DESIGN.md","Список задач должен быть создан"],"ar":["/startproject يجب أن يكون كاملا مع خطة معتمدة","التصميم يجب أن يكون موثقا في .claude/docs/DESIGN.md","قائمة المهام يجب أن تكون محددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"29280e5cff1da8471a5700fc7441b83ad008c5de2149cdb447755eab27a0de3d","qualityScore":49}');
