"产品吸引力分析器是Claude技能之一，帮助开发者分析产品吸引力","ja":"プロダクト・アピール・アナライザーはClaudeスキルの1つで、開発者が製品の魅力を分析するのに役立ちます","ko":"제품 어필 분석기는 Claude 스킬 중 하나로 개발자가 제품의 어필력을 분석하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El analizador de atractivo de producto es una habilidad de Claude que facilita el análisis de productos con React, Python y Node.js","fr":"L''analyseur d''attrait de produit est une compétence de Claude qui facilite l''analyse de produits avec React, Python et Node.js","de":"Der Produktattraktivitätsanalyse ist eine Fähigkeit von Claude, die die Analyse von Produkten mit React, Python und Node.js erleichtert","pt":"O analisador de atratividade de produto é uma ferramenta de IA que ajuda a melhorar a experiência do cliente","ru":"Анализатор привлекательности продукта - это инструмент ИИ, который помогает улучшить опыт клиента","ar":"محلل جاذبية المنتج هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد على تحسين تجربة العميل","en":"Claude skills that make my life easier."},"definition":{"en":"Claude skills that make my life easier."},"features":{"zh":["产品吸引力分析","开发流程优化","AI智能代理集成","React和Python支持","CLI命令行工具"],"ja":["製品の魅力分析","開発プロセスの最適化","AIエージェントの統合","ReactとPythonのサポート","CLIコマンドラインツール"],"ko":["제품의 어필력 분석","개발 프로세스의 최적화","AI 에이전트의 통합","React와 Python의 지원","CLI 명령줄 도구"],"es":["Análisis de productos con React","Integración con Python y Node.js","Herramientas de IA para optimizar productos","Análisis de atractivo de producto con CLI","Compatibilidad con Agentes de IA"],"fr":["Analyse de produits avec React","Intégration avec Python et Node.js","Outils d''IA pour optimiser les produits","Analyse d''attrait de produit avec CLI","Compatibilité avec les Agents d''IA"],"de":["Produktanalyse mit React","Integration mit Python und Node.js","KI-Tools zur Optimierung von Produkten","Produktattraktivitätsanalyse mit CLI","Kompatibilität mit KI-Agents"],"pt":["Análise de dados de cliente","Otimização de produtos","Desenvolvimento de produtos personalizados","Integração com React e Node.js","Suporte a CLI"],"ru":["Анализ данных клиентов","Оптимизация продуктов","Разработка индивидуальных продуктов","Интеграция с React и Node.js","Поддержка CLI"],"ar":["تحليل بيانات العملاء","تحسين المنتجات","تطوير منتجات مخصصة","التكامل مع React و Node.js","دعم CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","产品吸引力分析","开发流程优化","React开发","Python开发","CLI工具","AI工具安装","AI工具设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","製品の魅力分析","開発プロセスの最適化","React開発","Python開発","CLIツール","AIツールのインストール","AIツールの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","제품의 어필력 분석","개발 프로세스의 최적화","React 개발","Python 개발","CLI 도구","AI 도구 설치","AI 도구 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar herramientas de IA","qué es el análisis de atractivo de producto","alternativa a herramientas de IA","Herramientas de IA vs competidores","instalación de herramientas de IA","guía de configuración de herramientas de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","qu''est-ce que l''analyse d''attrait de produit","alternative aux outils d''IA","Outils d''IA vs concurrents","installation des outils d''IA","guide de configuration des outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist die Produktattraktivitätsanalyse","Alternative zu KI-Tools","KI-Tools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von KI-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar analisador de atratividade de produto","o que é analisador de atratividade de produto","analisador de atratividade de produto alternativa","analisador de atratividade de produto vs competitor","instalar analisador de atratividade de produto","guia de configuração do analisador de atratividade de produto","desenvolvimento de produtos com Python","otimização de produtos com IA"],"ru":["как использовать анализ привлекательности продукта","что такое анализ привлекательности продукта","анализ привлекательности продукта альтернатива","анализ привлекательности продукта vs конкурент","установить анализ привлекательности продукта","руководство по настройке анализа привлекательности продукта","разработка продуктов с помощью Python","оптимизация продуктов с помощью ИИ"],"ar":["كيف استخدم محلل جاذبية المنتج","ما هو محلل جاذبية المنتج","محلل جاذبية المنتج بديل","محلل جاذبية المنتج مقابل منافس","تثبيت محلل جاذبية المنتج","دليل إعداد محلل جاذبية المنتج","تطوير المنتجات باستخدام Python","تحسين المنتجات باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"erichowens","repo":"some_claude_skills","repoPath":"erichowens/some_claude_skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:20:06.213Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"product-appeal-analyzer","description":"Evaluate product desirability, market positioning, and emotional resonance—the complement to friction analysis. Assess whether users will WANT a product (not just use it), identity fit, trust","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Product Appeal Analyzer\n\nEvaluate whether users will *want* a product—not just use it. The complement to friction analysis.\n\n**Core insight**: Users don''t choose the best product—they choose the product that feels most like it was made for them.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **Use for:**\n- Evaluating landing pages, product pages, app store listings\n- Positioning a product against alternatives\n- Crafting messaging, tone, visual identity direction\n- Assessing emotional resonance with target personas\n- Pre-","body":"# Product Appeal Analyzer\n\nEvaluate whether users will *want* a product—not just use it. The complement to friction analysis.\n\n**Core insight**: Users don''t choose the best product—they choose the product that feels most like it was made for them.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **Use for:**\n- Evaluating landing pages, product pages, app store listings\n- Positioning a product against alternatives\n- Crafting messaging, tone, visual identity direction\n- Assessing emotional resonance with target personas\n- Pre-launch \"will this convert?\" analysis\n\n❌ **NOT for:**\n- UX friction audits (→ use ux-friction-analyzer)\n- Visual design execution (→ use web-design-expert)\n- A/B test implementation (→ use frontend-developer)\n- Market size estimation or financial forecasting\n- Feature comparison matrices\n\n---\n\n## The Desirability Triangle\n\n**All three must be present.** Missing any one kills conversion:\n\n```\n                    IDENTITY FIT\n                    \"This is for people like me\"\n                         /\\\n                        /  \\\n                       /    \\\n                      /  ★   \\\n                     / DESIRE \\\n                    /          \\\n                   /______________\\\n        PROBLEM               TRUST\n        URGENCY               SIGNALS\n   \"I need this now\"     \"This will actually work\"\n```\n\n| Missing Element | User Reaction |\n|-----------------|---------------|\n| Identity Fit | \"Seems useful, but not for me\" |\n| Problem Urgency | \"Cool, maybe someday\" |\n| Trust Signals | \"Looks sketchy / too good to be true\" |\n\n**Decision tree**: When analyzing, score each vertex 1-10. If any is &lt;5, that''s your priority fix.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Analysis: The 5-Second Test\n\nWithin 5 seconds of landing, a visitor should know:\n\n1. **What is this?** (Category recognition)\n2. **Who is it for?** (Identity signal)\n3. **What''s the core promise?** (Value proposition)\n4. **What do I do next?** (Clear CTA)\n\n**How to run it:**\n- Show landing page to someone unfamiliar for exactly 5 seconds\n- Hide it, then ask: \"What was that? Who''s it for? What would you do there?\"\n- Record verbatim—don''t coach or clarify\n\n**Scoring:**\n\n| Result | Score | Action |\n|--------|-------|--------|\n| All 4 clear in &lt;3 sec | 9-10 | Ship it |\n| All 4 clear in 3-5 sec | 7-8 | Minor polish |\n| 3 of 4 clear | 5-6 | Fix the gap |\n| 2 or fewer clear | 2-4 | Significant rework |\n| Confusing/unclear | 0-1 | Start over |\n\n---\n\n## Analysis Process\n\n### Step 1: Identify Target Personas\n\nFor each persona, document:\n- **Who**: One-sentence description\n- **Problem**: What''s broken + how it feels\n- **Current workaround**: What they do today (and why it sucks)\n- **Identity**: How they see themselves, who they want to become\n\n### Step 2: Score the Desirability Triangle\n\nFor each persona:\n\n```\nPERSONA: [Name]\n\nIDENTITY FIT                    [/10]\n  Visual identity match         [/10]  \"Does this look like my kind of tool?\"\n  Language resonance            [/10]  \"Do they speak my language?\"\n  Implied user match            [/10]  \"Are people like me shown?\"\n\nPROBLEM URGENCY                 [/10]\n  Pain point acknowledged       [/10]  \"They understand my problem\"\n  Emotional resonance           [/10]  \"They get how frustrating it is\"\n  Solution clarity              [/10]  \"I see how this fixes it\"\n\nTRUST SIGNALS                   [/10]\n  Professional execution        [/10]  \"This looks legitimate\"\n  Social proof                  [/10]  \"Others like me use it\"\n  Risk reduction                [/10]  \"What if it doesn''t work?\"\n\nOVERALL APPEAL SCORE:           [/90]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Map Objections\n\n| Objection | Type | How Addressed? |\n|-----------|------|----------------|\n| \"Is this legit?\" | Trust | [Answer] |\n| \"I''ve tried things before\" | Skepticism | [Answer] |\n| \"Too expensive\" | Value | [Answer] |\n| \"Too complicated\" | Effort | [Answer] |\n| \"Not for people like me\" | Identity | [Answer] |\n| \"What if it doesn''t work?\" | Risk | [Answer] |\n| \"I''ll do it later\" | Urgency | [Answer] |\n\n### Step 4: Generate Recommendations\n\nUse priority formula: `Impact = (Users Affected × Severity) / Fix Difficulty`\n\nCategorize into:\n- **Immediate** (ship this week)\n- **Medium-term** (this sprint)\n- **Long-term** (roadmap)\n\n---\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\n### Feature Soup Headline\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"List all capabilities to show value\"\n\n**Reality**: Visitors scan for 2-3 seconds. Feature lists feel generic.\n\n**What to use instead**:\n| Bad | Good |\n|-----|------|\n| \"AI-Powered Recovery Planning Tool with Analytics\" | \"Know exactly what to do next in your recovery\" |\n| \"Comprehensive Legal Document Platform\" | \"Find out in 2 minutes if your record can be expunged\" |\n\n**Detection**: Headline contains 3+ nouns or buzzwords like \"AI-powered\", \"comprehensive\", \"platform\"\n\n### Screenshot Hero\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Show the product interface so people know what they''re getting\"\n\n**Reality**: Strangers don''t understand your UI. They care about outcomes.\n\n**What to use instead**:\n- Person experiencing the benefit\n- The outcome/result they''ll get\n- Abstract visualization of the transformation\n\n**Detection**: Hero image is a product screenshot with no context\n\n### Trust Ladder Violation\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Get their email immediately, then convert them\"\n\n**Reality**: Trust builds in stages. Asking for too much too early kills conversion.\n\n**The Trust Ladder** (each rung requires more trust):\n1. Land on page → Professional design, no broken elements\n2. Click/explore → Clear navigation, fast load\n3. Spend &gt;2 min → Demonstrated value, clear progress\n4. Enter info → Why you need it explained, no dark patterns\n5. Create account → Privacy visible, minimal fields, clear benefit\n6. Pay money → Guarantee, testimonials, recognizable processor\n\n**Detection**: Asking for account creation before demonstrating value\n\n### Identity Mismatch\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Broad appeal = more users\"\n\n**Reality**: When everyone is the target, no one feels targeted.\n\n**What to use instead**:\n| Signal Type | How It Works |\n|-------------|--------------|\n| Visual identity | Dark mode = \"power user\"; Soft pastels = \"wellness\" |\n| Language/tone | \"Crush your goals\" vs \"Find your balance\" |\n| Social proof | Company logos vs individual testimonials |\n| Complexity | Minimal = simplicity-seeker; Feature-rich = power user |\n\n**Detection**: Homepage tries to appeal to 3+ different personas\n\n---\n\n## Self-Contained Tools\n\n### Analysis Workflow\n\n1. **Read** the landing page content and structure\n2. **WebFetch** the target URL to analyze live content\n3. **Write** analysis results to a markdown file\n4. **Edit** recommendations into actionable copy changes\n\n### Appeal Scorer Script\n\nRun: `python scripts/appeal_scorer.py <url>`\n\nProduces structured JSON output with scores and recommendations.\n\n### Reference Files (See for deep dives)\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| `references/scoring-templates.md` | Full scoring matrices and templates |\n| `references/trust-ladder.md` | Deep dive on trust building stages |\n| `references/identity-signals.md` | Visual/verbal identity signal catalog |\n| `references/objection-catalog.md` | Common objections by product type |\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen running this skill, produce:\n\n1. **Executive Summary** - 3 bullet key findings\n2. **Desirability Triangle Scores** - Per persona\n3. **5-Second Test Assessment** - What''s clear, what''s not\n4. **Top 3 Objections** - And how to address them\n5. **Priority Recommendations** - Immediate / Medium / Long-term\n\n---\n\n## Integration with ux-friction-analyzer\n\n**Appeal + Friction = Complete picture**\n\n| This Skill Answers | ux-friction-analyzer Answers |\n|--------------------|------------------------------|\n| \"Do they want it?\" | \"Can they use it?\" |\n| Will they choose this over alternatives? | Can they complete the task? |\n| Does it feel made for them? | Does the flow make sense? |\n| Is the promise compelling? | Is the experience smooth? |\n\n**Run both**: High appeal + high friction = frustrated users. Low friction + low appeal = abandoned product.\n\n---\n\n**Philosophy**: A product with low friction but low appeal gets abandoned. A product with high appeal but high friction gets frustrated users. You need both.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T07:06:33.209Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced product appeal analysis and emotional resonance assessment.","zh":"非常适合需要高级产品吸引力分析和情感共鸣评估的营销Agent。","ja":"高度な製品魅力分析と感情的共鳴の評価を必要とするマーケティングAgentに最適です。","ko":"고급 제품 매력 분석 및 감정적 공감 평가가 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan un análisis avanzado de atractivo de producto y evaluación de resonancia emocional.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de marketing qui ont besoin d''une analyse avancée de l''attrait du produit et d''une évaluation de la résonance émotionnelle.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine fortschrittliche Analyse des Produktappeals und eine Bewertung der emotionalen Resonanz benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de análise avançada de apelo de produto e avaliação de ressonância emocional.","ru":"Идеально для Маркетинговых Агентов, которым необходим продвинутый анализ привлекательности продукта и оценка эмоциональной резонансности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تسويق بحاجة إلى تحليل متقدم لجاذبية المنتج وتقييم للتوافق العاطفي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate product appeal through comprehensive content analysis, leveraging core insights on user preferences and crafting messaging, tone, and visual identity direction using protocols like A/B testing and user feedback integration.","zh":"使Agent能够通过全面的内容分析来评估产品吸引力，利用关于用户偏好的核心洞察，并通过A/B测试和用户反馈集成等protocol来制定消息传递、基调和视觉识别方向。","ja":"包括的なコンテンツ分析を通じて製品の魅力を評価し、ユーザー選好に関するコアな洞察を活用し、A/Bテストやユーザーフィードバック統合などのprotocolを使用して、メッセージング、トーン、ビジュアルアイデンティティの方向性を策定することをAgentに可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석을 통해 제품 매력을 평가하고, 사용자 선호도에 대한 핵심 인사이트를 활용하며, A/B 테스트 및 사용자 피드백 통합과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 메시징, 톤 및 시각적 아이덴티티 방향을 수립할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar el atractivo del producto a través de un análisis de contenido integral, aprovechando información básica sobre las preferencias de los usuarios y creando una dirección de mensaje, tono e identidad visual utilizando protocolos como pruebas A/B y la integración de retroalimentación del usuario.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer l''attrait du produit grâce à une analyse de contenu complète, en exploitant les connaissances de base sur les préférences des utilisateurs et en créant une direction de message, de ton et d''identité visuelle en utilisant des protocoles tels que les tests A/B et l''intégration de la rétroaction des utilisateurs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Produktappeal durch eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse zu bewerten, indem sie Kerninformationen über die Nutzerpräferenzen nutzen und eine Nachrichten-, Ton- und visuelle Identitätsrichtung unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie A/B-Testing und Nutzerfeedback-Integration erstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes avaliem o apelo do produto por meio de análise de conteúdo abrangente, aproveitando informações essenciais sobre preferências do usuário e criando direção de mensagens, tom e identidade visual usando protocolos como teste A/B e integração de feedback do usuário.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценить привлекательность продукта посредством всестороннего анализа контента, используя основные идеи о предпочтениях пользователей и создавая направление сообщений, тона и визуальной идентичности с помощью протоколов типа тестирования А/Б и интеграции обратной связи пользователя.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تقييم جاذبية المنتج من خلال تحليل محتوى شامل ، باستخدام المعلومات الأساسية حول تفضيلات المستخدم وإنشاء اتجاه رسائل ونبرة وهوية بصرية باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل اختبار أ و ب وتكامل ملاحظات المستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating landing pages and product pages for emotional resonance","Positioning products against alternatives through competitive analysis","Crafting targeted messaging and tone for specific personas"],"zh":["评估落地页和产品页的情感共鸣","通过竞品分析对产品进行定位","为特定用户角色制定有针对性的信息和基调"],"ja":["ランディングページと商品ページの感情的共鳴の評価","競合分析を通じた代替製品に対する製品のポジショニング","特定のペルソナに向けたターゲットメッセージングとトーンの構築"],"ko":["랜딩 페이지와 제품 페이지의 감정적 공감 평가","경쟁 분석을 통한 대체 제품 대비 포지셔닝","특정 페르소나를 위한 타겟 메시징 및 톤 수립"],"es":["Evaluar páginas de aterrizaje y páginas de producto para resonancia emocional","Posicionar productos contra alternativas a través del análisis competitivo","Crear mensajes y tonos dirigidos a personas específicas"],"fr":["Évaluer les pages de destination et les pages de produit pour la résonance émotionnelle","Positionner les produits par rapport aux alternatives grâce à l''analyse concurrentielle","Créer des messages et des tons ciblés pour des personas spécifiques"],"de":["Bewerten von Landingpages und Produktseiten auf emotionale Resonanz","Produkte durch Wettbewerbsanalyse gegen Alternativen positionieren","Erstellen gezielter Nachrichten und Töne für bestimmte Personas"],"pt":["Avaliar páginas de destino e páginas de produtos para ressonância emocional","Posicionar produtos contra alternativas por meio de análise competitiva","Criar mensagens e tom direcionados para personas específicas"],"ru":["Оценка посадочных страниц и страниц продукта на эмоциональную резонансность","Позиционирование продуктов против альтернатив посредством конкурентного анализа","Создание целевых сообщений и тона для конкретных персон"],"ar":["تقييم صفحات الهبوط وصفحات المنتج للتوافق العاطفي","وضع المنتجات مقابل البديل من خلال التحليل التنافسي","إنشاء رسائل ونبرة مستهدفة للأشخاص المعينين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to product and user data","Limited to digital products and services","Needs integration with user feedback mechanisms"],"zh":["需要访问产品和用户数据","仅限于数字产品和服务","需要与用户反馈机制集成"],"ja":["製品およびユーザーデータへのアクセスが必要","デジタル製品およびサービスに限定される","ユーザーフィードバックメカニズムとの統合が必要"],"ko":["제품 및 사용자 데이터에 대한 액세스 필요","디지털 제품 및 서비스로 제한됨","사용자 피드백 메커니즘과의 통합 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de productos y usuarios","Limitado a productos y servicios digitales","Necesita integración con mecanismos de retroalimentación del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux données de produits et d''utilisateurs","Limité aux produits et services numériques","Nécessite une intégration avec les mécanismes de rétroaction des utilisateurs"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Produkt- und Benutzerdaten","Begrenzt auf digitale Produkte und Dienstleistungen","Benötigt Integration mit Benutzerfeedback-Mechanismen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados de produto e usuário","Limitado a produtos e serviços digitais","Necessita de integração com mecanismos de feedback do usuário"],"ru":["Требует доступа к данным продукта и пользователя","Ограничен цифровыми продуктами и услугами","Требует интеграции с механизмами обратной связи пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات المنتج والمستخدم","محدود بالمنتجات والخدمات الرقمية","يحتاج إلى تكامل مع آليات ملاحظات المستخدم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f49886727454ae1bb3f44ad7b21a8f88b8f97ae569ea715967573a8567b096ac","qualityScore":49}');
